<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">1 Saamu'eeli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Taakkakaa Saamu'eelikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Saamu'elika Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Sam.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Taakkakaa Saamu'eelikaa Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Taakkake Saamu'eli maxaafi, Isira'eel hayyooletixxe galchanaa'ni moyaanjuwwiinxe galchaba'a foofeexxa kuldaan; tinni jijjiirra Isira'el giddo kadde'ek sase mannixxe buutonniten; insa'neenna, taakaxxe siretixxe lumolla hayyoolenaa'ni taakaki Saamu'eelite kadaa wodda, langaki Isira'elike siretike moyanjo kedeemmak Sa'ooliten; sakkaki kinni baalooma adhdhebaa edi gama hedhemmak siretixxi jirte isixxi Saamu'eelixxenna Saa'oolixxe jirtennn welti abidemeek Daawwititen.</para>
  <para style="ip">Konne maxaafi giddo umo kaddeexxi erga dullate kako giddo afema'neeke wele jirtetek maxaafishsha; Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a addatema eebbanna duuchchinxa yaane qajeeldasha assitaaxa, ajajema gopha kinni salphinake'ninna ba'nete'ni geessissaaxxa kulaan. Tinninna Duuchchi Woddi Gootti qeesichcho Eeli'a, «Ani ane'e ulfeessaaka ulfeesannon; tuffataaka salphisannon» hiyye haaso'eek hiyyichcho'ni ca'a hiyyedhen (2:30).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kunni maxaafi moyanjuwwinke mootummaxxa ke'injo gargar hedheeka yaada leellishan; edi wodda Isira'elike dhugaatik moyanjo kadeexxa ege'neek umi isinginnin Duuchchi Woddike Goottamman. Yaane kinni hekki hiyye ardakenaa'ni ke'eeke qortumishshanni, Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'ne'a moyanjo file. Iittanna kaddoole umo yaane moyanjokeenna kadoo, Isira'elik ardi Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe galcha hundanna murte hunda afensha insa'neexxen (2:7-10) tinninna Duuchchi Woddik Goottik seeri hunda dureeyyetenna kaddo hiyyeeyye manjunte manjiinxi qixxe ulfessendaaxxe kaddeexxa kulaaken.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Saamu'eel Isira'eelike akeekissanji kadeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 1:1-7:17">1:1—7:17</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Sa'ool moyeexxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 8:1-10:27">8:1—10:27</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Siretixxa Sa'ooli moye galcheexxa wogguwwa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 11:1-15:25">11:1—15:25</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Daawwitinna Saa'ooli'i <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 16:1-30:31">16:1—30:31</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s1">Hilqaananna Isiki Mini Hadi Seeloke Booncho'n</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Isira'eeli'i Efireemike minik ardi hedhaammake koobuwwatike boga'n Raama hiyyemmamke qachchi giddo Isira'eeli'i Gaadike miniki Hilqaana hiyyemaake manjo hedhemman; isiki anninna Yirohaam hiyyemaake Elihuke beltike belto kadaa wodda, Elihu Toohuki belti kinni Tsufike beltike beltomman. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Hilqaananna lame melaalle Haannanna Finiina hiyyendaaxxe afe'emman; Finiina oosetixxe amamman; Haanna kinni ila affe'emmabaan.<verse eid="1SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Hilqananna kunni wogga wogga'ninni Dada Duuchcha Ajajaake Duuchchi Woddika Gootta magenoonfato'anna tolcha shiqisho'a alalle Seelo'a me'a'nemmaan; ookkone baro'ni Hofiininna Finihaasi hiyyendaaxi Eelixxi lame labbaxxi oose qeesolete kaddeexxi Seelo Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ergatenda'emman. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Hilqaana tolcha shiqishammaxxi yanna geltaa wodda duuchcha tolchinke maalanaa'n mitte qoobbo Finiina'a uwwa'emman; iittanni mitte mittende isexxe labbaxxenna meyyaxxe oose'anna mitte mitte qoobbo uwwa'nemman. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Haannaa'a yo'oshsha eeyya'emmaxxee lame anga qoobbo ise'a uwwa'nemman; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna ise'a ila hoyyedhemmaxxee ilde egendebaan. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Haanna'a ila hoyyedhemmaxxee gina isexxi Finiina isee miita'ni yo'oshsha mufachchiissa'emman. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Tinni yaane wogga wogga'ninni duuchchi wodda kada'emmaxxee yaanemman; Duuchchi Woddike Goottike miniba'a Haanna marteexxe yanna duuchcha ooxxa'n ita gibaa qico'n Finiina isee miita'n yo'oshsha mufachchiisa'emman. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Tennenaa'ni kexxeexxa aro'i iseki Hilqaana isee «Tee Haannaa! Mayyee ooxxato? Mayyee ita gibbatto? Mayyeete duuchchi wodda konne qico yaaddattochchi? Tomme labbaxxe oosenaa'n ati'a anee woyyabaa?» Hiyya'nemman.<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Haanna Mageno Soodateexxa Soodachcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Seelo tolcha tolchine ke'nexxi inde ha'winechchi uduma Haanna kexxe uurrite; qeesichchi Eelinna Duuchchi Woddike Goottike galmixxe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">afenshatike duunkaana hiyyaten.</char></note> hula bira ofo'lemman. <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Issenna godobi giddo gubatemmaxxee hinqiffatee ooxxa'n Duuchchi Woddika Gootta soodatte. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" />Haannanna hiteexxi werreeggee qici, «Ee, Dada Duuchcha Ajajaatoke Duuchchi Woddike Goottaa! Anee atixxe erganjoka salphinne uudi! Rakko anxanna affetexxi anee dedhagophe'e, mitte labbaka belto ani'a uutottole, aninna baro isika duuchcha ati'a gargar foyyemeeke kadaashsha assannon; umo isikanna haado tuqqabaan» hitte.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:5">Lak. 6:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Haannanna konne qicinni Duuchchi Woddika Gootta soodachcho qeerriseexxi lumoxxa yanna turtemmaxxee, Eeli isee afo'i giddo uda'nemman. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Haannanna hafuura iseki laqemebaang suume calli le'mitaana'a godobik soodata'ammaxxee Eeli'n ha'wite machchoteechcho labbe. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Eelinna, «Machche tinni atenaa'n baxxabaaki haani qico'nite? Tenne atixxa machche qiidiffati!» Hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Issenna iso'n hiissitee haasotee hitee qici: «Anke gootta ani jabaxxe rakko afe'nexxe manjon; woyinetixxa booka yoakani machchessaaka ha'wo ha'webe'noni; yaane kinni anxa godobixxa rakko Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n ku'la'neten. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Anee erganjo atixxa wayi fuldabaaxxe manjoshsha anee uuddoxxe'e; konne qico soodachcho qeerriseennechch rakkonna abara uudennexxe manjo kadennexxeeten» hitte.<verse eid="1SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Eelinna «Yaddobelo me'i! Isira'eeliki Mageni ati isoo soodatettexxa ati'a uwwoo!» Hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Isenna «Soodachcho atixxenni anee erganjo atixxa duuchchi wodda qabataata!» Hite. Ookko'ni kexxe me'iteexxi itte ha'wite, yaddotanna waalde.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samu'eelixxa Ilenshanna Magenokee Uwwenshaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Langa baro gorsa Hilqaananna isiki mini hadi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a sagadeechchi uduma ifike minibaa Raama'a me'ine; Hilqaananna Haanna'a are ifixxeni welti diiphe; Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna ise qaabate'naa; <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />sila'witexxi labbaka belto ilde. «Isenna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta soodate alfenneken» hita'n summa isika Saamu'eeli hite fulchite.<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Hilqaananna ifike mini hadinni welti woggatiika tolchanna wereega Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uwwo'a alalle Seelo'a me'e. <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />«Belti ununa walee'naa baro isika duuchcha ookko hedho'a Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo iyyemare isoo uwwannon» hiteexxi aro'oke'n kuldemmaxxe eettene yanna ise insa'nen welti me'iteba'a.<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Hilqaananna «Eloxxenni, eldaan hitattoxxa assi; belti ununa wala qico'n minenni ofo'li; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ate'n addachchiise haaso'emmaka ifika hiyyichcho ati'a muoxo'o» hiyye. Tennexxee Haanna belti ununa wala qicon minenni ofoolideexxi belto nossexxammani.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Belti ununa waale uduma sase wooggaka jibbichcha, tomme kiillo bullenna, mitte qaliqallo woyinetika bulbulo aaxeexxi belto ifika alalle Seelo hedheeke Duuchchi Woddike Goottike mine'n iyyemarte; ookkone wodda Samu'eeli shiixxonge beltomman. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Jibbichchakanna duleechchi uduma beltokanna Eelibaa iyyemarre. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Hannanna Eeli'a hitee qici, «Anike gootta, atixxe lubbo! Mittele ati edo uurritexxe Duuchchi Woddika Gootta soodata'emmaxxi manjichcho itti anten. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Duuchchi Woddika Gootta soodate'na'a kunni ani'a uwweeke belton; isoo laqennashshanni konne belto ani'a uwweene. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Tennexxee ani ta'a isoo Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uwwe'enne; isinna hedhaake baro duuchcha'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a uwwemeeke» kadaan hite. Isinna eettene bakka'n Duuchchi Woddika Gootta sagade.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Haannaxxa Soodachcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />Haannanna soodata'n hitee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">«Ani yo'oshsha Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n gammadeenneni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">Magenik hunna anxi jabaateen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">Naapha anikanna oso'lannon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">anee anjirtetexxee gamadannon.<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />«No'oke Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Goottishsha woyyichchi hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">ati gadho weli hedhebaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">no'oke Magenishsha hedheek golli hedhebaan.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />Hollammak manni hollatika haaso'a waalowwaal;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni duuchchinxa ege'ne'een;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">ardi hujaaxxa duuchchanna muraan.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti jajjabbi Lolinke mannixxa gabuwwa enqe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:4">gophaaleeyye kinni hunna labbe.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Goddeemmaki manni, itaachchi'a manni hunda huje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">yaane kinni solo'we hedhemmak manni godde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">ila afeemmabaaxxi torbaane oose ilde;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">heddo oose affeemmaxxi kinni oose belo gatte.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti shiyaan, hedhotanna uwwaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:6">buttin hundi darre reyemmak manni hedhemmaba sa'isaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:6">ookko'ninna fulchaan;<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti dureeyye hiyyoonsaan; hiyyeeyyetanna duuroonsaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:7">salphisaan; ulfantashshanna assaan.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Isi hiyyeeyye hiyyummatenaa'n fulchaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">rakkiyyetanna rakkotenaa'n gatiseexxi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">ja'labuwwik insa'nee offo'lishaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">ulfiniinka booncho insa'nee dhalchisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">Duuchchi Woddike Goottan buttati hundika utuphuwwa giiseek;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">konne uutuphuwwi hana buttatanna dadeeki isoten.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />Mageni isi'a addatemeeke mannixxa hedho heqqaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:9">fuggaaleeyye kinni buttin hundi darre reyemmak manni hedhemmaba sa'issaan.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:9">«Manji hunna ifixxi injiffachcho alfabaan;<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n morkaakiir bullo'aan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">isinna insa'ne'n iimi'n dindimaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti butta duuchcha'n hedheekeni muraan.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 2:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">«Moyanjo ifikeenna hunna uwwaan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">hariire moyaashsha assekeenna hunna lebaan» hite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:46-55">Luq. 1:46-55</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Hilqaana mini ifikiba'a Raama'a higeexxi me'e; shixxok belti Saamu'eeli kinni qeesichcho Eeli hunda Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ergatema'nemman.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eelixxa Fuggaaleeyye Oose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Eelixxi labaxxi oose Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ajajendaammabaaxxe fuggaaleeyyemman. <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />Qeese barateemmak adabishshanni assitaamma qici, manji mitti tolcha shiqishshaa wodda gafememmak maali ra'ate'n hedheena'a qeesichching erganji sase ottisanjik sibilinke qalasuma aadhe dagaan; <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />Ookkone ottisanjinke qalasuminni disiteti giddi'n yookaan meshshe giddi'n yookaan waabi giddi'n yookaan huburi giddi'n hoole fulcheeka duuchcha qeesichchi ifi'a adhdha'emman; tinni yaane Seelo'a dageexxi tolcha tolchammake Isira'eelike arda duuchcha'n assendaammexxeman. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Iittanni ha'yyi ciincessemebaa edo qeesichchink erganji dageexxi tolcha tolchammaka manjichcho «Qeesichchi inqaka maala malee gafeemeeka atenaa'n aadh agophaammaxxee isi'a dudhishonna'a inqaka maala ane'n uwwi» hiyya'emman.<verse eid="1SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Manjichchikinna, «Ediseexxi ha'yi ciinceessemee'naa ookkenneechchi uduma ati eetetteka adhdhitato» hiyyeele midde qeesichchink erganji, «Waawo'a ta'anni ane'n uwwi! Gibottole kinni hunnati atenaa'n aadhannon» hiyyamman.<verse eid="1SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Konne qicinni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqaammaka tolcha shollisha'emmaxxee Eelixxe oosexxi cubbo Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo ha'urteemmaxxemman.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saamu'eeli Seeloke Bonchon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Saamu'eeli kinni oosummande'n suqqendeexxi ganendeexxa seema<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Seema </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrititotikenni efuude hiyyaan; kunni hiyyichchi Ibritotikenni qeesichchi oddo'waaxxe seemmake yookaan qoma qeesichchiinxe'n uggendaaxxe yaaneke summaman. </char></note> odo'wee Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a erigatema'nemman <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Ama isixxinna wogga wogga'ninni aro'ik welti woggatika tolcha shiqishatee me'itaa wodda duuchcha oddoonoti hana lebeme oddo'wemmaaka kaabba qopheessita'n isi'a iyyemarta'emman. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Eeli, Hilqaananna isixxa are Haanna'a, «Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a gargar foyemeeke kadaashsha werreege uutemmake beltixxe bakka'n ati'a tenne manjichchonaa'n wele oose uwwoo!» Hiyya'n eebbise.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 2:20">Ookkonechchi uduma insa'nenna mine ifikiba'a hinga'emman.<verse eid="1SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Haanna'a eebbisee; tennexxee wele sase labbaxxa oosenna lame dubarra ilde; shiixxoki belti Saamu'eelinna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ergatema'n nophphe.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eelinna Isixxa Lame Labbaaxxa Oose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Eelinna eettene yanna yo'oshsha cimeemman; Oose isixxinna Isira'eelike arida'n assita'neexxa elobaaxxa yaane, afenshatixxe dunkaaniinxe hula edo erigatendaammaxxe melaallenni welti yabaabuldeexxa laqe. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Tennexxe insa'ne hiyyee qici, «Mayee tenne elobaaxxa yaane assitina'ne? Assitina'neexxa elobaaxxa yaane duuchcha duuchchinge Manjonaa'n laqeennen; <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Anixxe labbaxxe oose! Duuchchi Woddike Goottike ardi gido ha'noxxee haaso'enda'neexxi odo eloxxebaan iitta hexxeexxa elobaaxxa yaane walle hujjinoqqe'e! <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Mitti manji mitte manjo balleesoole, Mageni oddote'n e'ye muraan; yaane kinni manji Duuchchi Woddika Gootta balleesoole ayyete isoo Duuchchi Woddike Goottinni araarsaa?» Hiyye. Yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'ne biro'a hasemmaxxe Eelixxi oose anniinka gorsa adhdhiteba'a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:52">Luq. 2:52</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Shiixxok belti Saamu'eeli kinni hojjati nophpha'n, Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'ninna Manjoke'n eeyyemeeke kade.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eelike Mini Hadixxee Kulemeeka Wabeekkuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootti ergemeeki mitti wabeek Eelibaa dageexxi iso'n hiyyee qici, «Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna: ‹Atik hundayyetike annixxi horte Gibtseke boga'n Feri'oonixxe anga'n garba kandeexxi hexxamma wodda ani insa'nen leellennen; <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" />Isoo Isira'eelixxe gosake minuwwinaa'n anke tolchimalcho'n hixxaana gubaashsha, ani edo Efuude odo'waashsha, anke qeesichcho kado'a fi'lennen; hundaayyetike atike annixxe oosenna Isra'eelik ardi shiqishaaka ciincatika tolcha insa'ne'a uwweennen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1-4">Fula. 28:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:35-36">Lew. 7:35-36</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Anke kakotike Taabotike galduma'n shiqaashsha ajajenneka tolchanna uwwa tuffatineechchi mayeete? Atinna atixi oose Isira'eeli ank ardi shiqishemmake tolchinaa'n elo eloka ittinee furdatiyyoti anee irra oose atixxa mayee ulfeesitette?›<verse eid="1SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />«Tennexxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eeliki Mageni hiyya'nee qici: ‹Atik mini hadinna atike hundaayyeke annik mini hadi duuchchi wodda ani'a ergatendinaan hiyyee addachchiiseennani: ta'a kinni iitta kaddabaan; Anee ulifeessaaka ulfeessannoni; anee tuffataaki tuffatemaan. <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Laqi; atike mini hadike daali giddo mitti manjinna cimoti qico'n hedhabaashsha atika mini hadonna atike annuwwika mini hado shiyye birannoxxi yanna shiqqa'neen. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Ane'e magenooffachotixxe bakka'n ate'n abarate geltaan; Isira'eeli giddo eloxxi yaane kadaa woddanna midde atike mini hadi giddo mittikinna cimoti qico geyaaki afemabaan. <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Anke tolchimalcho'n ergatendina'neeke atike manji giddi'n lubbo gataak mitti manji ooxxa'na'a ille atixxi garjitaashshanna godoba atee boorossaake kadaan; tinninna ati'a beessissake kaddaan.<verse eid="1SA 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />« ‹Atixxi laminxi oose Hofiininna Finihaasi mitte barra'n wolatichchoke'n mundaaan; tinni ati'a bessissake kaddaani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 4:11">1 Sam. 4:11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Godobi anki gammadaaxxa assaka addatemeeka mitte qeesichcho fi'lannon; isi'anna ani hariirenneke moyanji edo ergatenda'n hexxaaxxa horte uwwannon. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Atixxe horte giddi'n lubbo gataak duuchchi ookkone qeesichchiba mareexxi guluffatee anga bane'e maallaqakanna itaachcho isoo kadhataan; Barratixxa ita alfonna'a maganneten qeesumma atix hunda ergatemo'a eeti'i ani'a uwwi.› »<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s1">Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Saamu'eeli'i Ye'e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Shixxok belti Saamu'eeli Eelixxe akeette hunda Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a erigatemammani; ookkone baro'n Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ardake'n ammamma haaso'ammabaan; ardikinna waleella Duuchchi Woddik Goottinaa'n adhammaba'a. <verse eid="1SA 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />Cimotenaa'n kexxeexxa ille uushsho gopha'n daggemmak Eeli mitte hashsha diiphammaxxe kuta giddo diiphee hedhemman. <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Saamu'eelinna Kakkotik Taaboot hedheemmaba Duuchchi Woddike Goottike galmi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">galdumiinke duunkaanan</char></note> giddo diipheemman; Mageniink xassinna xo'eemmaba'a. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Ookkenneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Saamu'eeli ye'e; Saamu'eelinna heeyyeexxi «Kunna'a kabanni hedhennen anke gootta!» Hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Eeliba'a gonge mareexxi «Yexxetaxxee dageennen» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:5">Eeli kinni «Ani atee ye'ebe'non; higettexxi diiphi.» Saamu'eelinna hige diiphe.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna higgeenni Saamu'eeli ye'e; Saamu'eelinna Eeliba'a mareexxi, «Kunnina'a yexxettaxxe dagennen» hiyye. Eeli kinni «Anke belto! Ani ate ye'ebe'non; higgettexxi diiphi» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Saamu'eeli konnechchi edo Duuchchi Woddik Gootti iso'n leella leellisha gopheemmaxxee Duuchchi Wodddike Gootta kadeexxa ege'neemmabaan.<verse eid="1SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti sakkaxxa Saamu'eeli ye'e; Saamu'eelinna ke'e Eeliba'a mareexxi «Kunna'a! Yexxettaxxee dagennen» Hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:8">Ookkoneechchi uduma Saamu'eeli'i ye'a'nemmaki Duuchchi Woddike Gootta kadeexxa Eeli ege'ne. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Tennexxee Eeli Saamu'eeli'i «Higgee diiphi; higeenna ate'e ye'oole ‹Duuchchi Woddike Gootta! Ani atiki erganji laqaannen haaso'i› hiyyi» hiyyeexxi Saamu'eeli'ni kule. Saamu'eelinna diiphammaba'a hige me'e.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna dageexxi okkoo uurre; edi woddishshanni «Koo Saamu'eeli! Saamu'eelii!» Hiyye ye'ee.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">Saamu'eelinna «Anke Duuchchi Woddike Gootta! Ani atik erganji laqaannen haaso'i» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Saamu'eeli'n hiyyee qici, «Kunniseten ani Isira'eelike arda'n laqaaka duuchcha bajabaja assitaaxxa mitte yaane assa'ennexxi barra shiqqe'een. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />Eettene barra, Eeli'ninna isike mini hado'n ani assonna'a edisennexxi jaba qicinni xexxe'achchiise haaso'ennexxa duuchcha muuxxannon. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Oose isixxi anee diqachchiisaaxxa yaane assitee wodda isi insa'nee xixa gophemmaxxee mini hado isika duuchchi woddi'a xixannoxxa iso'n kule'ennan. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Tennexxe ‹Eelike mini hadixxa cubbo tolchi yookaan uwwa duuchchi woddi'a birtabaaxxa kakatee haaso'ennen.› »<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Saamu'eelinna bogi sooda qico'ni diipheexxi, soodaa wodda ke'exxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottike minixxa huluwwa bane; uudemmaxxa waleellanna Eeli'n kula sodaate. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Eeli kinni Saamu'eel'i «Anke belto!» Hiyye ye'e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">Saamu'eelinna «Kunninna'a kabanni hedhennen anike gootta!» Hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Eelinna «Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ate'n maa hiyye haaso'e? Mittelchonna anee shoxxoxxee; isi ate'n haaso'eexxe yaanenaa'n mittetanna shoxxottole Mageni jaba qicinni atee xixo» hiyye qore. <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Saamu'eeli mitte yaanenna sho'e gatisebaangi duuchchinxa iso'n kule; Eelinna «Isi Duuchchi Woddike Goottan; tennexxee isi eldaan hiyyaaxxa assowwaal.»<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Saamu'eelinna nophaa'ninni dage; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna isinni hedhemmaxxee Saamu'eeli hiyyexxe duuchchanaa'n mittetinna butta ibba'emmabaan. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Tennenaa'n kexxeexxa Daanike qachchinaa'n Bersaabehi qico'n hedheeki Isira'eeliki ardi duuchchi Saamu'eeli Duuchchi Woddike Goottike wabeeka kadeexxa ege'ne. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Seelo Saamu'eeli'n lebe leellexxi ifike hiyyichchi darree'n iso'n leela'emman.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1" />Saamu'eelinna haaso'amaka haaso'a duuchcha Isira'eelik ard adhdhe.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1SA 4:1">Kakotika Taabota Filisixeemi Boojite</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:1">Eettenne yanna Isira'eelik manni Filsixeemika manna lolo'a fule; tennexxee Isira'eelik manni Abeenezer hiyyendaaxxa bakka abixxe ofoo'le; Filisixxemik manninna Afeeqi hiyyemaaba bakka abixxine ofolle. <verse eid="1SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Filisixeemito Isira'eelii'i loldo'a googessa giissexxe; loli safeme eebbee wodda Filsixeemik manni injifateexxi shoole kuma Isira'eelika manna shiyye. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Isira'eelik loliink manni abixxinemmaxxe bakkaba'a higee wodda Isira'eelike ardik akeekisanjuwwi hiyyee qici, «Techcho Filisixeemitotee injifatemmannoshsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'oo asseechchi mayeete? No'onni welti me'a'ni naaphakenaa'n no'o anjiro'a marrennexxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottika kakkotika tabbota Seelo'n iyyedango» hine. <verse eid="1SA 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />Tenexxe Seelo'a manna ergineexxi Kirubeelixxe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kirubeeli hiyya Mageno hqeqitaaxxe keela affe'eexxe daduwwan</char></note> oddo'n ifixxe moote hana ofoleeke Dada Duuchcha Ajajaake Duuchchi Woddike Goottik kakotik Taaboti dagaashsha assine; Eelixxi laminxi labbaxxi oose Hofiininna Finihaasi Mageniinke Kakotike Taabotin welti he'nemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Fula. 25:22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik Kakkotik Taabota ookkone booncho'n geyee wodda Isira'eelik ard duuchchi gammadeexxi buttini le'ma qico'n ililliise. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Filisixeemito tennee ililleete laqeexxi «Ibrawotinbaa lanqannexx tinni buttinna le'missaaxxi ililleete mayinxe?» Hiyye qore. Duuchchi Woddike Goottik kakkotik Taabot Ibirito abixxiteemmaxxe bakkabaa dageexxa egendee wodda, <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />Filisixeemik manninna sodaate hiyyee qici: «Mgenoke insa'nexxe kaanbeba'a dage'een; yoona aanne no'o'a! Konnechchi edo iitta hexxeexxi yaane no'o'n kadde egendebaan. <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Kone huunamesa magenuwwixxe anganaa'n ayyete no'oo anjira? Aanne no'o'o! Kunni magenuwwi bire Gibtseka manna qiilla gammojje giddo gargar gargar hexxeexxe balanni gane'eeken. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />Koo Filsixeemike ardaa! Yooni jabaate! Jabaata gophinoole edi wodda insa'ne no'oke garba kandemmashsha no'onna Ibiritotike garba kada no'oxxi gattaxxebaan; yoona labbalinsha jabaatine lollee!»<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Tennexxee Filisixeemik manni jabaate loleexxi Isra'eeli injifatemmaxxe Isira'eelik manninna ifi fixxe duunkaanebaa baaje; lumok manni mude; sasi tommi kummi Isira'eelik lolink manninna shiyeme.<verse eid="1SA 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Mageniink kakkotik Taaboti boji'eme; laminxi Eelixxi labbaxxi oose Hofiininna Finihaasi shiyyemme.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eelixxa reyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />Eettenen barra Biiniyaamixxe gosatik minik mitti mannji yaade'emmaxxee daddarendeexxa seemma oddo'weexxi, bukotanna umoke'n filfilxeexxi, lolinba'n ke'eexxi lekka butta geltebaang gonga'n Seelo dage geye. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Manjichchi dagaa wodda, Eeli Mageniinke Kakotike Taabotixxee godobi iso'o raafeme'emmaxxee ofo'lammake barcuma'n orini qarqara ofo'leexxi caqasa'emman; Manjichchikinna qachchi giddo dageexxi kaddeexxa yaane duuchcha haaso'ee wodda ardi duuchchi oodhe humbaashshe. <verse eid="1SA 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Eelinna hunbaashsha laqeexxi «Mayeete ardi humbaashshanechchi» hiyye qore. Manjichchikinna rake mareexxi Eeli'n kule. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Eettene yanna Eeli sallaane tommenna saddeeta woggake geerchommani; ille isixxinna afa'emmaba'a. <verse eid="1SA 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Manjichchi Eeli'i, «Ani lolinba'n baaje ta'a dage'ne qicon; ookko'n ke'ennekinna telchonden; gongichchik kaba geyennen» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:16">Eelinna «Anike belto! Yoona yaane hittateta?» Hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Odo iyyedagemmak manjichinna, «Isira'eelii Filsixeemike manni'a baajjeen; no'oki heddi lolink manninna mude'een; iittanni kinni oose atixxi Hofiininna Finihaasi shiyemme'een; Mageniink Kakotik Taabotinna booji'emeen» hiyye hisse haaso'e.<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Manjichchi kakkotike Magniinke Taabotixxa booji'ensha haaso'ee wodda Eeli dala'inxe hula bira ofo'lemmake barcuminaa'n finqilli hiyye udumi'a ibe; isinna cimee'emmake furda manjo kademmaxxee quce qurubbi hiyye reye. Eelinna hayyichchake kadee shoole tomme wogga'a Isira'eeli akeke'emmakemman.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Eelike beltixxi Finihaasixxi are siila'witee ilatanna shiqqeemman; Mageniinke Kakotike Taabotixxa booji'ensha balliixxanna aro'o ifikixxa reyo laqqee wodda ciniitto eebbilshite ilde; ciniinto ise'n jabbate'emman. <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Isenna reyotee ga'ntaa wodda hobbaassammaxxi ise bira hexxeexxi melaalle «Mee co'o jabati! Labbake ilide'eten!» Hite. Yaane kinni ise hiissichcho uuteba'a; mitte godobinninna laqeba'a. <verse eid="1SA 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Issenna Mageniink kakkotiki taaboti booji'ememmaxxee, ballikinna aro'i reyemmaxxee «Gaachchanni Isira'eelinaa'n gargar higeen» hitta'n beltinka summa Ikaboodi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ikaboodi hiyya gaachchanni hedhebaan hiyyaten.</char></note> hite fulchite. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Isenna lebbeexxi, «Mageniinki kakotik Taaboti booji'ememmaxxee Magenik afensha Isira'eelinaa'n gargaarti higgeen» hite.<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kakotik Taaboti Filisixeemi Giddo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Filisixeemik ardi Mageniika Kakotika Taabota booji'echchi uduma Abeneezerinaa'n Ashidoodi hiyyemaaka ifike qachchiba'a adhdhine me'ineexxi, <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Daagoni hiyyemaake fakketike mine'ni e'yinsheexxi Daagoni bira uggine. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Ashidoodik ardi gorsa ke'eexxi uudaa wodda Daagoni Duuchchi Woddike Goottike kakotike Taaboti edo albik gonbisemee'na'a anfe; insa'nenna eettene Daagonxa fakke ookko'n ke'isineexxi edi wodda hedhemmaba hiisine. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Langa baro gorsanna ke'neexxi uundaa wodda Daagonxi fakke Duuchchi Woddike Goottike Taaboti edo gonbisende'na'a anfe; ookkone Daagonixxe fakkek goobinna laminxi anga kukkutendeexxi hulatixxe huddumme'n ibee'na'a Daagonik bisi susuma gateemman. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Telchi qco'n Daagonixxi qeesolenna kadi Ashidoodi giddo hedheeke Daagonixxe fakkeke galmi giddo magenoonfachchotee e'yaak manni duuchchi lakkati isixxe hulaxxa huddumme tarkaaffante sa'naachchi tene'aaten.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Ashidoodika ardanna qarqara insa'neeke'n hedheeka arda duuchcha'n fulantichchi fule dho'e malaqqi malaqqi hiyyashsha assiyyoti insa'nee jaba qicinni gane. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Ashidoodik ardi tennee kaddeexxa yanne uudeexxi weli'anni weli, «Isira'eelike Mageni Kakotik Taaboti no'oonna no'oka mageno Daagoni'ii jabaxxe mufenni ganemmaxxee isik Taaboti kaba no'oba turoqqe'e» hine. <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Tennexxe duuchchinga Filisixeemika galchalluwwa ye'neexxi, «Isira'eelike Mageniinka konnee Kakotika Taabota maa assinano?» hine insa'nee qorre.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:8">Insa'nenna «Gaati iyyemarre» hine hiisine; tennexxee Isira'eeli Magenika Kakotika Taabota Gaati iyyemarre. <verse eid="1SA 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Yaane kinni kakotik Taaboti Gaati iyyemarreechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ookkone qachchika mannanna mufet ganeexxi jaba qicinni weekemmaashsha asse. Isinna lumo shiixxoke gatebaang arda duuchcha fulantichchike dhukubinni gane. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Tennexxe Mageniinka Kakotika Taabota Aqarooni hiyyemaake wele Filisixxeemtotik qachcha dhaalasha asse. Yaane kinn ookko geyyeeshanni ookone boga'ni hedha'nek manni, «Isira'eelk Mageniinka Kakoti Taabota kaba'a iyyedange'echchi no'oonna no'oka arda shiltino'aten» hina'n hunbaashine. <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Higgeenna Filsixeemike moyanjuwwiba manna ergineexxi «No'oonna no'oka arda shiyebaang, Isira'eelika Kakotika Taabota edo hedhemmanba'a hiisse» hine; Mageni qachcha mufeti ganemmaxxee qachcha duuchcha'n hedheek ardi reyyo lumoshsha sodaate'emman; Filisixxeemike galchalluwwa ye'neexxi «Isira'eelika Kakotika Taabota kabaa'n hoyye; edo hedhemmanba'a higowwaal; kadagophphoole no'onna no'oka arda biraan» hine. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Reyebaak gateeka fulaantichchi rakkisa'emmaxxee qachchinke mannixxi raare iima gelte.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kakoti Taabotixxa Isira'eeli'a Higa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik Kakoti Taaboti torbaane agenjo Filsixeemike baga'n turee wodda, <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Filisixeemik ardi ifixxa qeese Daagoninna Ashidodi morammaka manna ye'eexxi, «Konne Duuchchi Woddike Goottika Kakotika Taabota maa assinannoxxa? Hitta wirri assine isixxe bakkaba'a hiissinannoxxa no'o'ni kulle» hiyya'n qodhdhe.<verse eid="1SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Insanenna hine hissinee qici, «Isira'eelike Magenika Kakotika Taabota illeema hiisitina'noole balleessa ha'noxxee uwwemaake tolchinni welti illeema hiisse malee isoo calla hiissitinoqqe'e; ookkone wodda dhibotenaa'n fayyitinaan; jabaxxe ifixxe mufenninna ha'no'o mayee ganeexxanna egendinaan» hine. <verse eid="1SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Filisixeemik ardinna «Balleessaxxa leellisho'anna tolcha maacho isi'a erginnano?» hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 6:4">Qeesetinna galchalluwwi hiyye hiissichcho uwwee qici, «Ha'no'inna ha'noke ondinge moyanjuwwa'n ibeek dhukkubi mitteke kademmaxxee fulantichchinxe fakke'n giisemeeka onde worqetika fulantichcho, Filisixxeemike moyanjuwwike laakkossixxe qixxe'n onde lama'inxe fakke'n giisemeeka worqetika lama'e uutinaan. <verse eid="1SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />Tennexxe boga ha'noka balleeso'a ergemeekee lama'uwwinxenna fulantichchuwwinxe fakkuwwaxxa uwwa giisiyyoti Isira'eelika Mageno ulfeesse; iitta assitineexxe kaddoole Isi ha'no'o, ha'noka magenuwwanna ha'noka boga duuchcha mufeti gana waalaxxe hexxeen. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Gibtsek ardinna Gibtsek moyanji assemmashsha mayee godoba jabeesixxene? Gibtsek ardi Isira'eelika arda me'o'a wocci asseek Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Gibtseka arda mufeti ganeechchi udumateba'a? <verse eid="1SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />Tennexxe haaroxxa gaare giissitine'e lame unuunsaaka, qanbar fe'eme ege'nemebaaka saayya qophpheesse; gaare harkilsaashsha ookkone lame saayya'n qanbara usurtinee jabbuwwa isixxanna moona giddi'a hiissitine usurre. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottika Kakotika Taabota saxxine aaxxine gaarete'ni hana ugge; balleessa ha'noxxike tolchixxe uwwa'a isi'a ergitino'a giissitinemmaxxa worqetixxa fakkuwwa saxxine giddo uggitineexxi Taabotii qarqara uggurre; lami saayyi harkilsa'n me'ashsha orake'n fulchitine waale. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Yaane kinni lami saayi gaare haba'a haarkilse me'aaxxa uudde; Beetishemeshike qachchi darre'n me'oole konne fuggoka dhukkuba no'o'n ibiseek Duuchchi Woddike Goottan hiyyoten. Ookkone darre'n me'a gophoole kinni kunni fuggok dhukkubi iittanni dageeke malee Isi no'o'n ibiseeke kadebaaxxa egennanon.»<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Filisixxeemiki ardinna hiyyendemmashshanni gaarete'n usurremmaka qanbara aaneexxi lame saayya'n feene; jabuwwatanna moona giddi'a aassine hula cunfe. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Insa'nenna Duuchchi Woddike Goottika Taabota aa'nexxi lama'uwwinxenna fulantichchuwwinxe fakkuwwa'n giissendemmaxxe worqe giddo hexxeexxe saaxxinen welti lami saayyixxe gaare hana feene. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Lamingi saayyi middi bita'i'a gorebaang ora abixxe'e Betishemeshi darree'n me'ate'n ke'e; me'amma wodda madhata'ne'e me'aamman; Filisixeemik galchaluwwinna udumi udumi'n me'a'n Beetishemishixxe gabala qico'n genne.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Beetishemeshik manninna dhooqa giddo dinne haa'ma'nemman; tammi assine uundaa wodda Kakotika Taabota anfe; isoo anfemmaxxenna lumoshsha gammande. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Gaaretik lamingi saayy Beetisheemmeshi hedheeke Iyyaasu hiyyemaake manjichchike fichchibaa geyeexxi lomoke kinji bira dage'e uurre; ardikinna gaaretika haqichcho shashatte laminga saayya Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a hedheeshshanni ciincatike tolcha assine shiqinshe. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Leewwitotinna Duuchchi Woddike Goottika kakotika Taabotanna isinni welti hedhemaka worqe giddo hexxeexxa saaxxine ke'isineexxi lumokekinji hanauggine; Beetishemeshik manninna ciincatika tolchanna wele tolchuwwa duuchcha Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a shiqinshe. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Ondiniig Filisixeemik galchalluwwi tenne duuchcha uuda'n tureechchi uduma eettenenni barra Aqarooni'a hige.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Filisixeemik manni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a balleessa ifixxike tolcha kadoe'a onde worqetike fulantichchinxa fakkuwwa mitte mitte qachchuwwi'a mitte Ashidoodi'a, mitti Gaaza'a, mitti Asiqelona'a, mitti Gaati'anna mitti Aqarooni'a erge'nemman. <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />Insa'nenna onde worqetike lama'uwwixxa fakke Filsixeemike galchalluwwike laakkossixxe qixxe'ninna insa'ne galchinammake kinjike dalla'uwwike qachchuwwixxe qixxen ergine. Worqeti giissineke lama'uwwixxi fakkuwwanna ergendeemmak mitte mittenge Filisixxi'eemik moyanjuwwi galcha'emmake onde kinjik dala'uwwike qachchuwwikenna qarqarake'n hedheek olla'uwwike summinnitemman; Beetisheemmeshi hedhaammake Iyyaasuke fichchi giddo Duuchchi Woddike Goottika Kakotika Taabotanna hana uggine'emmak lumok kinji telchii qico'n kaddeexxa yaane qalli assaake kadee ookkone hedheen.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Kakotike Taaboti giddo uundemmaxxee Mageni Beetishemeeshike torbaane tomme manna shiye. Duuchchi Woddik Gootti konne manna duuchcha insa'ne giddi'n biremmaxxee Beetishemeeshik ardi yaande oo'ne.<verse eid="1SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Tennexxe Beetishemeeshik manni, «Konne Woyyichcha Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo dande'e shiqaak hedhebaan. Taaboti no'oba'an ayyibaa me'u?» hine qore. <verse eid="1SA 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Qiriyatiyi'aarimi manniba'a manna ergineexxi «Filisixeemik manni Duuchchi Woddike Goottika Taabota idage hiisse'een adade daggineexxi aadhdhe» insa'nee hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />Qiriyatiyi'aarimik manninna dageexxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottika Taabota adhdheexxi alale me'ine; ookko'n tullichchi hana hedhaa'neeke Abinadaabike mine'n iyyemarreexxi Duuchchi Woddike Goottika Taabotanna heqqaashshanna belto isika Ali'aazaarii'i woyyonsine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:2-4">2 Sam. 6:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 13:5-7">1 Odo. 13:5-7</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saamu'eeli Filsixxeemito Injifate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottik Taabotinna Qiriyatiyi'aarimi'n qeeraxxe yanna lame tomme wogga offo'le; Eettene yanna'n Isira'eelik ardi duuchchinna oodhe Duuchchi Woddika Gootta halse.<verse eid="1SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Tennexxee Saamu'eeli Isira'eelika arda duuchcha hiyyee qici, «Mitti godobinni Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa higgina'neexxe kaddoole wele alaga magenuwwanna Asitaarootixxa fakke ha'noxxe oddoo'ne bayyisse; Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'anna ifi hiremme; Isoo callanna magenofatte; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna ha'no Filisixeemitotixxe anga'naa'n gatisaan» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Tennexxee Isira'eelito Ba'aalixxanna Asitaarootixxa fakkuwwa fugusineexxi Duuchchi Woddika Gootta calla magenofante.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Saamu'eeli, «Isira'eelika arda duuchcha Mitsipha bukki asse; aninna ha'noxxee Duuchchi Woddika Gootta soodatannon» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Isira'eelito Mitsipha bukki hitee wodda wode'e ikileexxi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo dunne. Eettene barra agabo goddo honseeexxi «No'o Duuchchi Woddika Gootta'n cubbo hunjeennen» hina'ni faacine. Saamu'eelinna Mitsipha hayyichchake kadeexxi Isira'eeli'i galcha'emman.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Filisixxeemito Isira'eelito Lolde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Isira'eeli Mitsipha bukki hiteexxa Filisixeemito laqee wodda Filisixxeemik galchalluwwi insa'ne loldo'a alalle dagge. Isira'eelitotinna tenne laqeexxi Filisixxeemii'i sodaatte. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Insa'ne Saamu'eeli'i hinee qici: «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'ok Filsixeemitotixxe anganaa'n no'oo anjiro'a Duuchchi Woddika Gootta no'oka Mageno no'o'xxee soodaata uurrisoxxe'e» hine. <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Tennexxee Saamu'eeli unu'na'neeka mitte gedhebiinka beltanjo aadheexxi isonna hedheeshanni ciincesse Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolche. Isira'eelike ardixxeenna Duuchchi Woddike Gootta soodate; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna soodachcho isixxa laqe. <verse eid="1SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Saamu'eelinna ciincatika tolcha tolchande'n hedhee'nanni, Filisixeemito Isira'eelika arda lolatee dagge shiqqe, yaane kinni eettene barra Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Filisixxeemitote'n jabaxxe dindinso dindimemmaxxee insa'ene yo'oshsha weekkemme; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Filisixxeemito Isra'eelitoti edo baajaashsha asse. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Isira'eelitotinna Mitsiphanaa'n fuldeexxi Filisixeemito ora ora'n shilta'n Beetikaare'n adadde hedheeke boonchi qico'n shorshe.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Saamu'eeli mitte kinjo aadheexxi Mitsiphaxxenna Shenixxe oddo'n uurrise. «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti techchi qico'n no'o'o gargaare'en» hiyyaan ookkone kinjo «Abeenezer» hiyye summa fulche. <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Konne qicinni Filsixeemito injifatendemmaxxee Isira'eelitotika boga langaxxa lollebaan. Saamu'eeli lubbot hedhemmake baro duuchcha'n Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Filisixeemito ifixxe hunnanni lola'emman. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Filisixeemito Isira'eelitotenaa'n adhdhiteek Aqarooninaa'n Gaati qico'n hedhemmak qachchuwwi Isira'eeiltotee hige; Isira'eelitotike bogixxi gabalanna Filisixxeemitotenaa'n qullo fulde. Isra'eelitotixxe'ninna Amooritotixxe odd'n nage'i afeme.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Saamu'eeli Lubboti hedhemmak ifike baro duuchcha'n Isira'eelito hayyichchummati galcha'emman. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Wogga wogga'in Beeti'eelii, Geligeelinna Mitsipha mammarema'n konne booncho duuchcha'n Isira'eelitote'n hayyichchake kadee mura'emman. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Yaane kinni duuchchii wodda Raama hedheeke ifike miniba'anna higa'emman; ookkonna Isira'eelitote'n hayyummati mura'emman. Ookkonna Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolchimalcho giisse.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s1">Moyanji Moyaashsha Isira'eeli Qorte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Saamu'eeli cimee wodda ifixxa lame labbaxxa oose Isira'eeli'n hayyummati murtaashsha asse. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Angafi isi beltike summi Iyyu'eel, langakik Abiya hiyyemmaake kandaa wodda lamnig Beersaabehi hayyummati murte mura'emman. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Yaane kinni insa'ne anna insa'neek me'eeka ora me'inebaan. Seeri belo la'o alfatee matta adhdhina'n murte dassina'emman.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Tennexxe Isira'eelik akeekisanjuwwi duuchchi mitteba bukki hiyyeexxi Saamu'eeli hedhemmaba'a Raama dageexxi isoo, <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" />«Kunnisse, ta'a ati cinde'eten oose atixxi ora ati me'itetteka me'itebaan; wele arduwwi afemmashshanni no'oo galchaak moyanjo moyaashsha assi» hine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:4">Lew. 17:4</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Yaane kinni insa'ne «Moyanjo no'oo moyaashsha assi» hiyyiyyo insa'nexxi Saamu'eelii'i gammachchiiseba; tennexxee Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa soodate. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Saamu'eelii'i hiyyee qici, «Moyanjo insa'nek kadabe'noshsha tuffanteek ante malee atete kada gophphetaxxee ardi hiyyaaxxa duuchcha laqi. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Ani insa'nee Gibtseke boginaa'n fulchennexxe yannanaa'n telchi qico'n anee waalexxi wele magenuwwa magenoonfachchoti assinemmaxxa duuchcha ate'inna assina'neen. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Ta'a ati insa'ne hinaaxxa laqi; yaane kinni insa'ne'n moyaak moyanji maa insa'nee assaaxxa insa'ne'n ege'nish; jaba qicinninna insa'nee xexxe'achchiise.»<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Saamu'eelinna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hiyyemmaxxa duuchcha moyanji moyaashsha laqedhemmake arda duuchcha'n kule. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Isinna hiyyeexxi kulee qici, «Ha'no'n moyaak moyanj assaxxi yaaneri konnechchinni butti'a hexxeexxen: labbaxxa ha'nooxxa oose aadheexxi ifixxe loliinxe fadhadinxe gaaretike oofalluwwanna lolinke manna kandashsha assaan, weletanna fadhadiinxe gaare edo gongita'n insa'ne'a ora giissitaaxxe kaddaaxxe assaan. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Insa'e giddi'n wele lolinke mannike kumiinke ajajalluwwa, onde tommike ajajalluwwa kandaashsha assaan; labbaxxi ha'nooxi oose moyanjika fichcha hujjaaxxenna isi'a midha aassitaaxxe, isika lolinka miyanna isixxe fadhadiinxe gaareka miyya hujjaaxxe kaddaashsha asaan. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Meyyaxxi ha'nooxxi oosenna adheexxi isi'a shitto giissitaaxxe, wele isi'a ita duuchcha ra'issitaaxxe kaddaashsh asaan. <verse eid="1SA 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />Shamo shamoka ha'nooka fichcha, elo elolla woyinetike hiddichchixxa bakkanna ha'noxa ejersinxa haqquwwa adhdheexxi ifike jalqabuwwi'a uwwaan. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Ha'nooxxe midhanaa'ninna ha'nooxxe ejersiinxe haqqenaa'n tomme anganaa'n mitte mitte adhdheexxi ifike moyeti minike ja'labuwwi'anna jalqabuwwi'a uwwaan. <verse eid="1SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />Labbaxxanna meyyaxxa ha'nooxxa garboole, elo eloka ha'noka lalonna harruwwa ha'nooxxa adhdheexxi ifixxe la'o'n hosilsaan. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Ha'nooke gedhebokenaa'ninna re'etenaa'n tommitte adhaan; ha'nonna isixxe garboole kaddinaan. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Iitti barra geltaa wodda ifi'aanni fi'litinemmak moyanji ha'no'ni geessisaaxxe rakkonaa'n kexxeexxa qaraarfatinee ooxxinaan; yaane kinni eettene barra Duuchchi Woddik Gootti oodhishsha ha'nooxxa laqabaan.»<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Yaane kinni ardi Saamu'eeli hiyyaxxa laqa gibee hiyyee qici, «Waawwo'o, moyanji no'o'n moyaasha hansaanneni; <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />No'onna wele ardishshanni no'oo akeekakenna no'o edo me'aake no'okaa lolanna no'o'a lalaaka moyanjo anfeenneke arda kandannoni.» <verse eid="1SA 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Saamu'eelinna ardi hiyyeexxa duuchchinxa laqe ke'eexxi mareexxi eetteneenni Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n haaso'e. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Saamu'eeli'i «Ardi hiyyeexxa adhdhitetexxi moyanjo insa'ne'a uwwi» hiyye. Ookkoneechchi uduma Samu'eeli Isira'eelika manna «Duuchching ifi ifike miniba'a higge» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Saamu'eeli Sa'ooli'i Moyanjoke Kaddo'a Hariire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Qiisi hiyyemaak mitti gurra fuleek Biiniyaamitotik manji hedhemman; anni isik Abi'eel, Tseroorike, Tseroori Bikooratike Bikoorati Afeeqii'i Biiniyaamixxe gosatike minike minjichchike beltomman. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Qiisinna Isira'eelixxe oose giddi'n danchummati ayyinna isoo lekka uggaak hedhebaake Sa'ooli hinake belto afe'emman; Sa'ooli wele manni duuchchinaa'n agoodik alalle taggagichcha hojja qeerrakemman.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Barratixxa barra Sa'oolike annixxi Qiisixxi harruwa baxxemmaxxxee Qiisi belto ifika Sa'ooli'i, «Eriganjuwwakenaa'n mitte adhdhite me'ite baxxeexxa harruwwa hasi» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Tennexxe Kooba callike Efireemike boga'ninna Shaaliisha qarqara hedheeke boncho duuchcha'ni mammareemme. Yaane kinni insa'ne harruwwa anfebaan, Shaalshake bogi giddi'a e'yi'ne harruwwa kinni ookkonna hexxemmabaan. Ookkoneechchi uduma Biiniyaamike gosati minike bogiba'a hinige me'ine; ookkonna anfebaan. <verse eid="1SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Tsufike bogiba gennee wodda Sa'ooli isinni welti hedhemmaka erganjo «Ta'a anni ank harruwwatee yaada waaleexi no'oxxee yaadammaxxee ta'a hadi'a hingo» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Erganjikinna, «Egedhdhi mee! Konne qachchi giddo mitti Mageniink manji hedheen; isinna yo'oshsha ulfeessemeeken; isi hiyyaaxxi duuchchi butta ibbabaan. Hoone ora me'inannoxxa no'o'n kula dande'ammaxxee ookko'a me'ino» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="1SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Sa'oolinna, eriganjo ifike, «Marronnoole manjichchokee maachcho uunanno? Indannoxxi gala'anna no'oxxe qaliqallo giddi'n mude'een. Mageniike manji'a uunannoxxi uwwa hexxebaan; maachchonna anfennechchi hedhebaan» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Erganjikinna langaxxanna, «Kunse, ani sase giraama birretika sibiljo afe'ennen; hoone ora me'inannoxxa no'o'a kulo'a mitte shiixxoka birretika sibiljonna Mageniinke manji'a uwwannon» hiyye hiisse.<verse eid="1SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />(Bireke baro'n Isira'eelike boga'n mitti manji Mageno qodhdhatee haseexxe kaddoole, «Magenokenaa'n waleella uudammake manjiba'a me'ino» hiyya'nemman; techcho wabeekake hiyyema'neeki edi wodda Magenokenaa'n leella uudake hiyyemammani.)<verse eid="1SA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Sa'oolinna eriganjo isika «Eloxxe ke'i me'ino!» hiyye. Tennexxe Mageniiki manji hedheeke qachchiba'a me'ine.<verse eid="1SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Insa'nenna qachchiiba'a me'iyyotee tullicha qabanta'neegge'n wodde'e ikki'lo'a me'aammaka dubarra anfeexxi «Mageniixxa waleella uudammaki manjichchi kaba hedhe?» Hineexxi qorre.<verse eid="1SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Dubaarrikinna, «Eeti ha'no edo hedheen, ardi telcho tullichchake'n tolcha tolchinammaxxe bakka'n tolcha tolchammaxxee Mageniinxa leella uudammakinna telcho qachchi no'okiba'a dage'eeni rakine marre. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Qachchi giddi'a e'yitineeshshanni, tullichchi hana magenoonfatammaxxe bakka ita ito'a qabateba edi darre isoo affinaan. Isi Magenii tolcha eebbisaashsha soodatebaak ardi tolcha ita gophammaxxee isi dagaa qico'n ardi ita safabaan; ookkoneechchi uduma ye'emeeki ardi itaan; rakkine ta'anni alalle marre; iikki woddi isoo affinaani» hine. <verse eid="1SA 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Tennexxe insa'ne qachchiba'a alalle marreexxi, qachchi giddi'a e'yande'n he'nenaa'n Saamu'eeli tullichchi hana tolchinamaxxe bakkaba'a qabato'a insa'ne he'needarre'n dagaa'na'a anfe.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Sa'ooli dago'a mitte barra edi darre Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Saamu'eeli'n hiyye leelishe'emma qici, <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />«Soodo tenne yanna'n Biniyaamixxe gosaka mitte manjo atiba'a ergannon; anke arda Isira'eel'ni akeekaashsha isoo hariir; isinna anka arda Filsixeemitotixxe anganaa'ni anjiraan. Anke ardixxa rakko uudeennen, kunnisse arda anka gargarona'a anyee ye'edheexxa ye'a.»<verse eid="1SA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Saamu'eelinna Sa'oolii'i uudee wodda, Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Saamu'eeli'i, «Ikki atte'n kule'ennak manjichchi kunnisse isoten; isi anka arda galchaan» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Sa'ooli dala'iinxe hula biri'a Saamu'eelibaa shiqeexxi, «Magenokenaa'n leella uudaake majichchiki mini haba'ate kadeexxa maganneten ani'n kuli» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Saamu'eelinna Sa'ooli'n hiyye hiisse haaso'e, «Magenokenaa'n leella uudannek anten; telcho aninni welti ita itinammaxxee ani'a edissine hana magenoonfantaak tullichchiba'a alalle me'e; godobika atika yaada duuchcha soodo gorsa ate'n kulee atee me'isannon. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Sase barra edo baxxemmaaxxi atixxi harruwwa afende'een isexxee yaaddoxxee; yaane kinni Isira'eelike ardixxi halcha atenna atike annike mini hadon» isoo hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Sa'oolinna hiisse haaso'ee qici, «Ani Isira'eelixxe gosake minuwwinaa'n lumoshsha shiixxooke Biiniyaamike gosatike minike manjjon; gosa anxinna Biiniyaamixxe gosanaa'n yo'oshsha shiixxoxxen Mayeeta iitta hexxeexxa yaane ane'ni kuldaate?» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Saamu'eeli Sa'oolinna isika erganjo itatike mini giddi'a iidage; ye'eemeeke sase tomme kadaak manni offoleexxe itatixxe bakka duuchchinaa'n ulfaateexxe bakka'n insa'nee ofo'lishe. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Saamu'eelinna ookkone ita ra'isammaka, «Qoffinni uggi hiyya'n ate'n woxxe uwwennaka maala hinni» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Tennexxee iikki ita ra'isammak lukatika maala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lukatika maala uwweechchi isixxi moyanjumma Magen isoo'o fi'lemmaxxee'e gargar hexxeexxe kaddemaxxent</char></note> hedheeshshanni iyyedageexxi Sa'ooli edo ugge; Saamu'eelinna Sa'ooli'i, «Kunni ati'a qofinni uggemeeke maalan; ‹Ani keesuma ye'ennen› hiyyennexxe yaannanaa'n tenne yanna qico'n ati'a uggemeeke kademmaxxee it» hiyye. Sa'oolinna eettene barra Saamu'eelinni welti ite ha'we. <verse eid="1SA 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Sa'oolinna Saamu'eeli goorotenaa'n adadde qachchibaa dangeechchi uduma Saamu'eeli ifike minixxe heelichcho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edik mannixxi heellichcho mini giddo iti hana hedhatee'e fayyendeexxi giisendeexxeman. </char></note> hana Sa'oolinni welti haaso'e.<verse eid="1SA 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Soodimaro ke'ne; Saamu'eeli Sa'ooli'i mini giddixxe heelichchotenaa'n ye'eexxi, «Ke'we geegesee'na'a me'itota'a» hiyye; Sa'oolinna ke'ee wodda Samu'eelinni welti gadhi'a fulle. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Qachchinke kasiba'a adadde me'ate'n he'neenge'ni Saamu'eeli Sa'ooli'i, «Erganji atik no'o edi'a sa'e me'aashsha iti kuli» hiyye. Erganjikinna edi'a sa'eexxi me'e; ookkoneechchi uduma Saamu'eeli Sa'ooli'i, «Mageni ane'n kuleexxa erga ate'n kulonna'a hee'nooxxe yanna'a kabanni hekki hiyyi» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Saamu'eeli ejersiinxe zayitexxa buuda aadheexxi zayite Sa'oolike umo'n hana dune isoo sunqedhe hiyyee qici, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti isika arda Isira'eeli'i galchitota'a atee hariiredheen. <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Techcho ani birii'n gargarti higgatoxxa yanna Biiniyaamike bogixxe gabalaa'ni hedheeke Tseltsahi hiyyemaake boonchcho'ni Raaheelike hirreesi bira lame manninni afendatton; Insa'ne atee, ‹Ati hassaatexxi harruwwa afende'een. Anni atik Qiishi harruwwaatixxee heda waaleexxi, «Belto ankixxa yaane maa assennexxa woyya?» hiyyati ta'a qodhdhate'n hedheen hinaan› ate'n kullaan.<verse eid="1SA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />«Ati ookko'n saxxetexxi Taaboori hedheeke lumooke haqichchiba me'itatton; ookkonna sase manna, mitti sase re'etika buruusuwwa ga'na'n, langaak sase kebbo anga abixxe, sakaaki woyinetixxe bookaxxa qalqallo dulkeexxi Magenokee tolcha tolchatee alaalle Beeteli'a me'a'ni atinni afemaan. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Insa'nenna atee nage'a aa'neexxi lame kebbo ati'a uunaan; atinna insa'nenaa'ni aadhitatton.<verse eid="1SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />«Ookkoneechchi uduma Filisixeemik loliink manni hedheeba Gibi'a hiyyendaaxxe Mageniinxe koobabaa martatton; qachcha gelteteshshanni raagoletixxi tuuta kiraara, okole masinqonna lumoka kiraara ganda'n, suusu'le ufuufaa'n raaga raanga'n tullichchii hana tolchinammaxxe bakkanaa'n adadde daggaa'na'a afendatton. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Dedhange'n Duuchchi Woddike Goottik Hafuuri ate'n hunnati dirraan; atinna insa'nenni welti raaga raagatton; atiinna jijjirende wele manjonna kaddatton. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Kunni beessisuwwi muuxxemaaxxa yanna Mageni atini welti hedhemmaxxee assiyyo dandeetattoxxa duuchcha assi.<verse eid="1SA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />«Ati ani'a edisetexxi adadde Geligeeli'a me'i; aninna ciincatika tolchanna mittummatika tolcha tolchona'a atiba'a dagannon yaane kinni atiba dageneexxi maa assitattoxxa ate'n kulanno qico'n torbaane barra turiyyo hassisaan.»<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sa'ooli Moyajanjoke Kade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Sa'ooli Saamu'eelinaa'ni garigari higee me'o'a ke'eshaanni Mageni Sa'ooli'a haaroka adaba uwwe; Saamu'eeli kulemaki beessisi duuchchi eettene barra'n muuxeme. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Sa'oolinna isiki erganji Gibi'a gennee wodda raagolettixxe tuutanni welti afemme; Mageniinki Hafuuri Sa'ooli'n hunnati dirre'na'a isinnna insa'nenni welti raaga raage. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Edi wodda isoo egge'neemmaki duuchchi wabeekoti welti raaga raaga'naa anfeexxa yannna weli'anni weli «Qiisike belto'ni maa dagee? Sa'oolinna wabeeka kade?» hine. <verse eid="1SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />Ookko hedha'neeki mitti manjichchi hiisse haaso'e, «Insa'nek anni ayyete?» hiyye. Tennexxee, «Sa'oolinna wabeekotixxe gamonaa'nite?» hiyyemaak mammaasi mammakeme.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 19:23-24">1 Sam. 19:23-24</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Sa'ooli raaga raage ke'eechchi uduma tullichchake'n hedheeke tolchimalchiba'a me'e.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Sa'oolike anniki dayyi, Sa'oolinna erganjo isika, «Haba hexxinema?» hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:14">Saa'olinna, «Harre hasito me'ineennan; yaane kinni harre afendabaaxxa egennene wodda qortetee Saamu'eeliba marreennan» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="1SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Sa'oolike annik dayyinna, «Saamu'eeli ati'n kuleexxa ane'n kuli» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Sa'oolinna hiisse haaso'e, «Harruwwa afendeexxa no'o'n kokeesse kule'een» hiyye. Yaane kinni Saamu'eeli mootummatixxa yaane anniike dayyo'n haaso'eba'a.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Saamu'eeli Isira'eelik arda Duuchchi Woddike Goottinni afemo'a Mitsipha'a ye'eexxi, <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />insa'ne'n hiyyee qici, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelik Mageni hiyya'nee qici, ‹Ani Isira'eeli'i Gibtsee'n fulchennen; Gibtsexxe hunnaa'ninna ha'no wele gosa gosake miicama duuchchinaa'n ha'no anjirennen.› <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Telcho kinni ha'noxxe rakkonaa'ninna abara duuchchanaa'n ha'no'o anjiraaka, Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ha'noka Mageno tuffatineexxi, ‹Waawo'o, Moyanj no'o'n moyaashsha assi› hitineen. Tennexxee ta'a ha'noo, ha'noke gosatike minimininna aanchi anichinni Duuchchi Woddike Gootti magenoonfantamaba'a shiqqe.»<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Ookkineechchi uduma Saamu'eeli mitti mittiniinge Isira'eelixxe gosak mini hadi duuchchi magenoonfachchotee shinqee wodda Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Biiniyaamixxe gosak mine fi'le. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Higgeenna Saamu'eeli Biniyaamike gosatika mine anchi anchinni shiqishee wodda, Maxiirik aanchi fileme. Muuxamake'n Sa'ooli Qiisik belti fileme. Yaane kinni iso'o hansee wodda isi afemeba'a. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Tennexxee ardi higgeenna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta, «Manjichchi kaba dage'ee?» hine qorre.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:22">Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, «Eeti, Sa'ooli mi'yi giddo sho'omedheen» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Insa'nenna gongine marreexxi sho'omebaa'n aa'ne iyyedange, isinna ardi giddo uurree wodda wele ardi duuchchinaa'n agoodik alalle tataagichcha hoja qeerakemman. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Saamu'eelinna arda duuchcha, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti fileeka manjichcho uddineen? Ardi duuchchinaa'n isinni qixxo'aak mitti manji hedheba'a» hiyye. Ookkoneechchi uduma Ardi duuchchi hafuura gikki asseexxi, «Moyanji lubbo galowwaal!» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Saamu'eelinna moyanjokee assemiyyo hassisaaka seeranna aada ardake'n barrise kuleechchi uduma ookkone seeranna aada maxaafake'n borreesseexxi Duuchchi Woddika Gootta magenoonfantammaba ugge. Ookkoneechchi uduma Saamu'eeli arda wocci assee'naa'a ifi fike mininbaa me'e. <verse eid="1SA 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Sa'oolinna Gibi'a ifike minba'a me'e; Mageni qalbe insa'nexxa ke'iseek jajjabbi manni Sa'oolixxa duuka me'e. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Yaane kinni mitti mitti wayi fulabaak manni, «Kunni manjichchi naaphakenaa'n no'oo dande'e anjiraa?» hina'ni isoo tuffante. Uwwatanna isi'a uuneba'a. Sa'ooli kinni sammi hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s1">Sa'oolinna Iyyabiisika Qachcha Gatise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Amoonik moyanji Na'oosi, alaalle mareexxi Iyyabiisi Gele'adii'i erqe kayyi'n buqe; Iyyabiisik manni duuchchi isoo hiyyee qici: «Ati no'onni welti kako aagi no'onna ati'a hiremmannon» hine.<verse eid="1SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Amoonichchi Na'oosinna, «Ha'nonni welti kako aagannok ha'no mitti mittingixxa middixxa ille ha'noonaa'n fulche Isira'eelika arda duuchcha salphiseennole callanni» hiyye hiisse.<verse eid="1SA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Iyyabiisixxi geedhuuwwanna isoo hitee qici, «Isira'eelike boga duuchcha'n erganjuwa erge'nona'a torbaane barra no'o'a uwwi; no'o'o anjiro'a dagaaka manjo gonphonnole ati'a anga uunannon» hine.<verse eid="1SA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Erga maremmaak manninna Sa'ooli hedhemmaba Gibi'a marre gennexxi Na'oosik ardi insa'ne hiyyeexxa yaane duuchcha ardakee haasonnee wodda, Isira'eelik ard duuchchi hafuura gikki asse oodhe. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Eettne yaanna Sa'ooli fichcha hucca'ni hosemmabaa'ni ifixxa qotiyyuwwa oofaa'n hige; isinna, «Ardi maa kadee? Mayeete oodha'neek?» hiyye qore. Insa'nenna Iyyabiisik manni insa'ne'ni higgeenna hiyyyexxa iso'ni kulle. <verse eid="1SA 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Sa'oolinna konne haaso'a laqee wodda Mageniink Hafuuri hunnati iso'n hana dirre; Sa'oolinna yo'oshsha aare. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Isinna lamiinxa qotiyyo aadhe duleexxi, maalakanna kukkute; kukkutemmaka maala ookkone erganjuwwake'n anga ergeexxi hiyyee qici: «Sa'oolixxanna Saamu'eelixxa duuka fulabaake manjixxi qootiyyonna iitta kukkutendaan!» hiyya'n Isira'eelike boga duuchcha'n lassinaashsha asse. Eettene yanna ardi duuchchi Duuchchi Woddik Gootti lumoxxa soda'a ardake'n ibise; duuchchingi mitteke kadee fule. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Sa'oolinna Bezeqi hiyyendaaxxe baka'ni lolinka manna bukki assee wodda, laakkoossi insa'neki Isira'eelinaa'n dageek sase dhibba kuma kadaa wodda, Yihudannaa'ni dageek sase tomme kuma lolinke mannamman.<verse eid="1SA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Sa'ooli Iyyabiisi'n erga dangemmake manninna, «Iyya buusi Gele'adiki manna hitinaa qici, ‹Soodo arishsho eebbitamma wodda anjirendinaan hitine kulle› » hiyye. Ergeme'emmaki manninna mareexxi konne hiyyichcho Iyyabiisike manna'n kulee wodda, insa'ne yo'oshsha gammande. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Iyyabiisik manninna Amoonika manna, «No'o soodo anga ha'no'a uunannon; ha'no'n eloxxe labbe leellitaaxxa no'o'n assa dandeetinaan» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Langa baro gorsa Sa'ooli ifika lolinka manna saseba qoode; insa'nenna soodimaro Amoonitotike mannixxe kaambe giddi'a e'yeneexxi heddo manna saafo'ii qico'n shinne; reyotenaa'n gateekiri midde lame lameke kadee welti hedhabaa qico'n xexxeeremme.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sa'oolixxi Moyanjumma Kokesseendeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelik ardi Saamu'eelii'i, «Sa'ooli no'o'n moye galcha dande'abaan hiyyeeki manni ayyeerramaa? Ookkone manna shinnona'a iyyedagge!» hine.<verse eid="1SA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Sa'oolinna kinni, «Tinni barra Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eeli anjireexxe barra kademmaxxee mitti manjinna tenne barra'ni shiyemabaan» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Saamu'eelinna ardakee, «Amme Geligeeli'a me'ino Sao'oli moyanjo no'oke kadeena'a adhdhinnenexxa haaroba kokeesino» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Ardi duuchchingi Geligeeli'a mareexxi; Sao'oli'i moyanjumma Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo kokeesse. Ookkonna ardi mittummatika tolcha Duuchchi Woddike Gootta magnoffantaaba shiqishshe; Sa'oolinna Isira'eelik ardi lumoxxa jila jille.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Saamu'eelika Nage'a Dhaamatika Haaso'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Saamu'eelinna Isira'eelike arda duuchcha'n hiyyee qici, «Ani ha'no hitineexxa duuchcha laqennexxi ha'no'a moyanji moyaashsha asseennen. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Moynjoke kadeexxi ha'noo akeekaaka manjo ta'a ha'no afine'een. Ani cimeenen, umi ankinna aro'eedheen, labbaxxi oose anxinna ha'nonninni welt hexxeen; dargageessummatenaa'n telchi qico'n ani ha'nooke akeekisanjomman. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Ani kunnisse ha'no edo hedhennen; Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edonna isi hariireke moyanji edo dhugaa kulle; ayyike jibichcha adhdhene? Ayyixxe harreta adhdhene? Ayyee sobenne? Ayyee miicenne? Uuda'ni uuda'ebe'noshsha kadona'a ayyinaa'n matta adhdhennne? Konneechchuwwi duuchchinaa'n mittelchonna midde assennexxe kaddoole ha'no'a hiissannon» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Isira'eeli ardinna hiissee haasoe'e, «Hara matta ayyenaa'n adhdhitebexxo yookaan no'oo miicebexxo; ayyinaa'ninna mittelcho adhdhitebexxo» hine.<verse eid="1SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Saamu'eelinna insa'nee, «Ane'n mitti dhedha affinebaaxxa Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna isi hariireeki moyanji telcho ha'no'n dhugaaten» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 12:5">Isira'eelik ardinna, «Eet! Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti dhugaate!» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Saamu'eelinna ardake'n hiyyee qici, «Muusenna Aaroonii'i fileek, hundaayyetika ha'noka annuwwa Gibtseke boganaa'n fulcheek Duuchchi Woddike Goottan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:26">Fula. 6:26</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Tennexxee ta'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hedheeba uurre, ani Duuchchi Woddi Gootti ha'no'anna ha'noke edike annuwwi'a asseexxa anjiratixxa huje duuchcha kokeessona'aten.<verse eid="1SA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />«Ya'iqoobi Gibtse'a e'yeechchi uduma insa'ne gargaaro'a annuwwi ha'nok Duuchchi Woddike Goottibaa oo'ne; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna insa'ne'a Muuseenna Aarooni'i erge; Muusenna Aarooninna edika ha'noka annuwwa Gibtseke boginaa'n fulchineexxi konne boga'n he'naashsha assine.<verse eid="1SA 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />«Yaane kinni insa'ne Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ifika Mageno deene; tennexxee Duuchchi Woddi Gootti Siisaara'n, Hatsoorike loliinke mannike ajajalixxe anga'n, Filisixeemitotanna insa'nee lolee injifateeke Mo'aabike moyanjixxe anga'n insa'nee sa'isse uwwe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:12">Hay. 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:2">4:2</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:1">13:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" />Insa'nenna, ‹No'o cubbo hunje'ennen Duuchchi Woddika Gootta waalleenneexxi Ba'aalinna Asitaarooti magenofante'eennen. Ta'a kinni no'oo naapha no'okixxe anganaa'n anjir, no'o ateenna magenofantannon› hina'ni Duuchchi Woddike Goottiba'a oo'ne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 10:10-15">Hay. 10:10-15</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Yiruba'aalii'i<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibrititotike lagaadinni Yeruba'aali hiyya Gede'ooniten</char></note> Baraaqii'i<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giriikike laagadinn Bedaan hiyyemaan</char></note> Yoftaaheenna Saamu'eelii'i<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giriikikenna Sooriyake laagadinn Somisoon hiyyemaan</char></note> ergeexxi nage'ik hexxinaashsha qarqara ha'noke'n hedheeke ha'nooke naaphixxe anganaa'n ha'noo anjire.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:20">1 Sam. 3:20</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:6">Hay. 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 7:1">7:1</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:29">11:29</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />«Yaane kinni Amoonik moyanji Na'oosi dageexxa uuddinee wodda Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'noki Mageni moyanjo kade'naan anee ‹Waawwo'o, no'o'a moyanji moyaashsha assi› hitine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:19">1 Sam. 8:19</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />Ta'a moyaashsha laqexxinemmakinna fi'litinemmak moyanji kunniseten, Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'no'n moyaji moyaashsha asse'een. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Duuchchi Woddika Gootta sodaatineexxi isi'a ajajendinoole, ajaja iseke'ninna jallata gophinoole, ha'nonna ha'no'n moyeek moyanji Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ha'noka Mageno hordofinoole yaane duuchchi eloxxe ha'no'a kadda. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ajajema gophphinoolenna ajaja isike'n jallatinaake kaddinoole kinni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'noka hundaayyeti annuwwa xixemmashshanni ha'noonna moyanjo ha'noka xixaan.<verse eid="1SA 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />«Tennexxe ta'a hexxineeba jabaatine uurre Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ille ha'noxxenni uudinaa'na'a assaneexxa mambe'a yaane uuddinaan. <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Ta'i dinne aadhatixxe yannan; balaqakanna xeena ergaashsha ani Duuchchi Woddika Gootta soodatannon. Tinni kaddaa wodda ha'nonna moyanji ha'no'n moyo'a laqedhiyyoti Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo fuggoxxa yaane assitineexxa eettenee yanna egendinaan.»<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Samu'eeli Duuchchi Woddika Gootta soodate; eettenenni barra Duuchchi Woddik Gootti balaqakanna xeena erge. Tennexxee Saamu'eelinna ardi iikki duuchchi Duuchchi Woddika Goottanna Saamu'eeli'i yo'oshhsa sodaate. <verse eid="1SA 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Iikki ardi duuchchinna Saamu'eeli'i, «Rennabe'noshsha maganneten Duuchchi Woddika Gootta atike Magenibaa no'o'a soodat; moyanji no'o'a moyaashsha laqedhiyyoti edo hunjennexxe cubbo duuchchi hana wele cubbo lephphine'ennen.» <verse eid="1SA 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Saamu'eelinna insa'ne'n hiisse hiyye haaso'ee qici, «Meeco'o, sodaatinoqqee; dhugaaten moyanji moyaashsha laqedhiyyoti tenne fuggo duuchcha assitine'een; kaddoo malee Duuchchi Woddika Gootta mitte godobinni ergatemme malee'e Duuchchi Woddika Gootta ergatematenaa'n illeema higginoqqe'e. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Ha'no'a wayi fuldabaaxxa fakkuwwa hordofinoqqe'e. Tinni fakkuwwa wayi faldabaaxxe kaddeemmaxxee ha'no'a eloxxa yaane assa yookaan ha'noo anjira dandeetabaan. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'noo ifike arda assedho'a eeyyemmaxxee, ifike summa lumoke hiyyeexxi arda ifika waalabaan. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Aninna ha'no'a soodata waaliyyoti Duuchchi Woddika Gootta balleessa anenaa'n bayyatto'o. Ani eloxxanna qajeelto yaane ha'noo barsiisannon. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Yaane kinni ha'no calli Duuchchi Woddika Gootta sodaatte; mitte godobinninna addatenshati isi'a ergatemme. Ha'no'a asseexxa lumollamma yaanuwwanna deetionoqqe'e. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Cubbo hujiyote'n murum hitinoole kinni ha'noonna moyanji ha'nok muddinaan.»<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Sum'eeli Sa'ooli'i Xixe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Sa'ooli moya safaa wodda wagga isixxi sase tommemman<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sase tomme wogga hiyyendeek, tenne bakka'n woggatixxi tika heddo tikuwwa'n gargar higgeemmaxxee'e, no'o Qawwuffa haaroxxa hordonfeeten</char></note>; Isira'eelinna shoole tommenna lame wogga moye galche. <verse eid="1SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Sa'ooli Isira'eelike ardi giddi'n sase kuma manna file; insa'ne giddii'n lame kuma manna Mikimaasininna koobatike boga'ni Beeti'eeli Sa'oolinni welti hedhemme; mitti kumi manni kinni Biniyaamixxe galcha giddo Gibi'a Yoonataaninni welti hedhdhemmani. Gatemmaka manna kinni ifi ifike miniba'a me'aashsha asse.<verse eid="1SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Yoonataani Gibi'a hedhemmaka Filsixeemike lolinke mannixxa kaanbe loleexxi heddo lolii manna shinne; Filisixxeemik manninna tenne odo laqe. Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'oolinna, «Ibirito laqqowwaali!» hiyyeexxi bogga duuchcha'ni malagata ufuunfaashsha asse. <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Tennexxe Isira'eelito duuchchi «Sa'ooli Filsixeemike loliinke mannixxa kaanbe lole heddo manna shiyye; Filisixxeemito Isira'eeli'i bobbeechishsha boshshexxe» hiyyendaaxxa odo lanqe; Sa'ooli Isira'eelitotik loliink manni isinni Geligeela bukki hiyyo'a ajaje.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Filisixeemik manninna Isira'eelito lolemo'a bukki hine; insa'nenna sase tomme kuma fadhadinxa gaarenna jaane kuma sarageelluwwa lolliinka manna, abbaayyatike maanchishsha laakkossi bira sa'eeka lekkatika lolliinka manna adhdhine Isira'eeli lollo'a bukki hinne; insa'nenna alaalle qabante Beeti'awwee'ni boroti daree'ni hexxexxe Mikimaasi hiyyendaaxxa kaamibe giisse'ne ofolle. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Isira'eeliki manni hedheeki jeeji yo'oshsha sodaachchisaake kadeexxanna insa'neki lollinki manninna jabbaxxe weekenshsha giddo hedheexxa uudee wodda wolo'uwwa giddo, ko'mo'lichuwwi giddo, lumollamma kinoxxe oddo'n baluwwa giddonna dareeruwwi giddo sho'omme. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Ibiritotike mannanaa'ni mitti mitti manni Yordaanoosika galaana foofeexxi Gaadikenna Gele'adike bogibaa me'e.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:7">Sa'ooli kinni Geligeelanni ture; isinni welti hedhemmak lolliinki manni duuchchi sodaate culphisa'emman. <verse eid="1SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />Sa'oolinna Saamu'eeli isoo ajajeemmashanni torbaane barra Saamu'eel'i dagaaxxa heqqe, yaane kinni Saamu'eeli Geligeeli'a dageba'a; Sa'ooliki lolliinki manni xexxeremate'ni ke'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:8">1 Sam. 10:8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Tennexxe Sa'ooli arda, «Ciincatika tolchanna mittoominka tolcha iyyedage» hiyye. Ciincatika tolchanna tolche. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Isinna tolcha tolche ke'eeshshani ikki woddi Saamu'eeli ookko ge'ye; Sa'oolinna gadhi'a fuleexxi isoo nage'a aadhe. <verse eid="1SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Saamu'eelinna, «Assitetechchi maachcho?» hiyye isoo qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:11">Sa'oolinna iso'n hiyye hiisse haaso'ee qici, «Ard anee waale'e me'o'atemman; atinna dagannoni hiteteexxe yaanna'n dagebexxon; iittanni Filisixeemik manninna Mikimaasike booncho'ni bukki hiyye'na'a uudenneni. <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />Tennexxee ‹Filisixeemik manni adaadde Geligeela anee lolo'a dagoole aninna Duuchchi Woddika Goottika gargaarsa laqedhebe'non› hiyye hedenneni. Tennexxee yaadi anki ciincatika tolcha tolchanoshsha asse» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Saamu'eelinna isoo hiyyee qici: «Ati gowwummatixxe huje hujjeten; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atik Mageni ati'a uwweeka ajaja heqqexebexon; heqqexxeetexxe kaddeele isi mootuma atixxa Isira'eeli'ni duuchchi woddi'a hexxeeshsha assamman. <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" />Ta'a kinni mootumma atixxi hegere affabaan; kunnisse Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ifike godoba'ni aagaka manjo alfe'een; ati Duuchchi Woddik Goottika ajaja heqqedha gophphetaxxee isi ifike ardiinke akeekisanjo kado'a isoo fi'le'een.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:22">Erga. Huj. 13:22</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Ookkonneechchi uduma Saamu'eeli Geligeela'n ke'eexxi Biiniyaamixxe galcha giddo alalle Gibi'a me'e. Sa'oolinna isinni welti hedhemmaka manna laakko'e; laakkossi insa'nekinna jaane dhibba kade.<verse eid="1SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isira'eeli Loliinke Mi'yi Belo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Filsixeemito Mikimaasi bukki hiteemma wodda Sa'ooli, belti ifiki Yoonataaninna insa'nenni welti hedhemmaaki manni Biniyaamixxe galcha giddo hexxeexxe Geba'i hinaaba he'nemman; yaane kinni Filisixeemik lolliink manni Makimaasi kaanbe ofo'lemman. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Sase kanbe'n qoqqoodemeek lolliink manni Filsixeemitotixxe kaanbenaa'ni fule; taakaxxe kutaki manni Sogaalike boga'n hedheek Ofira'a me'e, <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />wele kutaki manni Beetihoroni'a, sakkaxxe kuta manni kinni qiilla gammoojje edi darre hexxeexxe Siboyimmixxe Dhooqanaa'n adadde hexxeexxe gabalaba'a wirri hine.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Filisixeemito, «Ibirito wolaantichcha yookaan bagedo ifi'a giise'noqqe'e» hiteemmaxxee Isira'eelike boga duuchcha'ni sibilo tumaaki manni afemebaan. <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Tennexxee Isira'eelito duuchcha qottisanjo sibiljo (Maarasha), qottuwwa gangansiilso'a, meesanuwwakanna haanituwwa gangansiilso'a Filisixeemitotibaa adadde dirrinaamman. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Qottotika sibiljonna qotto gangansiisatee uunamaki hiri shoole giraama biretike sibiljo kadaa wodda meesano iitanni qottotika sibiljo gangasiilisatik hiri kinni saddeeta giraama biretike sibiljomman. <verse eid="1SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Tennexxe Filisixxeeminna Isira'eeli lola inbeexxa barra Sa'oolinna belto ifike Yoonataani gadho insa'ne'ni hedhemmake loliinke manni giddii'ni wolaantichcha yookaan bagedo abixeeki mitti manjinna hedhemmabaan.<verse eid="1SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoonataanni Heddo Filisixxeemito Shiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Ookkone wodda Filisixeemitotik loliink manni sannachchi Mikimaasixxe xurreba'a fuleemman.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Mitte barra Sa'oolik belti Yoonataani isika lolliinka miyya ba'edhdhammaka dargageessa, «Amo, wele darree'n Filisixeemik loliink mannixxe kaanbeba'a foonfo» hiyye. Yanne kinni Yoonnatani tenne yaane anna ifike'n kule'emmabaan. <verse eid="1SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Sa'oolinna Gibi'ake kassa'n Migiroon hiyyeendaxxe bakka'n roommanni hiyyemaake mitti haqqichchi hunda ofo'leemman. Isinni welti jaane dhibbi qici loliinki manni hedhemman. <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />Konne manni giddo Efuude oddo'waammak Akiya hedhemman; Akiyak anni Ahixuub Ikaboodike dayyomman. Ahixuub Finhaasike, Finihaasi Seelo giddo Duuchchi Woddike Goottike qeesichcho kadeemmake Eelike beltomman. Ardi Yoonataani haba mareexxa ege'neemmabaan.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Yoonataani Filsixeemike sannachchixxe kaanbeba'a foofo'a hedeexxe xurreke middi bita'a'n, mitti Boozezi, mitti Senne hiyyendaaxxe lame suuxxite kino hexxemman. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Tenne kinnonaa'n mitti kinji middi darre'n, Mikimaasi edi darre, langak bita'a darre'n Gibi'a edi darre'n uurremman.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Yoonataani isika lolinka miyya ba'edhammaka ookkone dargageessa, «Amo, Mageno ege'nebaake Filisixxeemike sannachchixxe kaanbebaa foonfo; heenokenninna kadi heddik anjira Duuchchi Woddika Gootta dhibbammabaaxxee, akimagaada Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'o'a lolaaxxe hexxeen» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Isika loliinka miya ba'edhamak iikki dargaggeessinna, «Godobi atik yoreexxa duuchcha assi; mee udumi'a higi; aninna mitte godobinni atinni welti hedhennen» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="1SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Yoonataani isoo hiyyee qici, «Yoona amota'a Filisixxeemike mannibaa widi'a foonfennexxi insa'ne'n leellino. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Insa'nenna no'oo, ‹Ha'noba'a dangannoxxee ookkonni no'oo heqqe› hinoole, he'nennenba he'nanno'n alalle marabe'no. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Yaane kinni insa'ne no'oo, ‹No'obaa alalle amme› hinoole no'onna alalle marrannon, Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Filisixxeemika manna anga no'oxxe'n sa'isse uuweexxa tinni beessisake kaddemmaxxee insa'nebaa alalle marrannon.»<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Tennexxe insa'ne lamingi Filsixeemike loliinke mannik sannachchi insa'nee afaashsha kande; Filisixxeemito, «Uuddineen! Ibirito sho'ondemmaxxe baleenaa'ni fulate'ni hexxeen!» hine. <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Filisixxeemixxe lolinke mannixxe kaambek sannachchinna «kaba no'oba'a alaalle amme; ha'no'a barrisiinsanexxe yaane hexxeen» hinaa'ni Yoonataaninna isika loliinka miyya ba'edhammaake'ni caancine.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:12">Tennexxe Yoonnataani ifika lolinka miya ba'edhammaka, «Anxa duuka amo; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Filisixxeemika manna Isira'eelixxe anga'n sa'isse uuwe'een» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Yoonataaninna anga lekkati boxxaa'ni lolinka miyya ifika ba'edhammak udumi'n duuka dagana'a alaalle qabate fule; Yoonataninna edi darre'n loldammaxxa Filisixxeemito shiyye; isika lolinka miyya ba'edhammakinna insa'ne udumi darre'n loldammaxxa Filisixxeemito shiye. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />Yoonataaninnna ifika lolinka miyya ba'edhammaaki Siretixxe barraxxe shiyya'n mitte qottiyyo barrate'n hujaaxxe bakkaxxe qixxexxe'n lame tomme geyaaka manna shinne. <verse eid="1SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Hadi giddo hexxemmaxxi Filsixxeemito duuchcha weekende; fuggoxxa assaamak kaambe giddo hedhemmake loliinke manna'n weekenshate kadde; buttinkinna lele'me; tinni weekenshanna Magen insa'ne'n ibiseexxemman.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Biiniyaammixxe galcha'ni Gibi'a hedheemmaki Sa'oolik heqqanjuwwi Filisixxeemitotiki lolinki manni ora ora'n culphisa'n baanja'neexxa uunde. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'oolinna isinni welti hedheemmaka loliinka manna hiyyee qici, «Amme loliinka manna laakkotineexxi kabaa'ni ayyi me'exxa affee» hiyye. Laakkone woddanna Yoonataaninna isika loliinka miyya ba'edhammaki ookko he'nemabaan.<verse eid="1SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Sa'oolinna qeesichcho Akiyaa'a hiyyee qici, «Mgeniinka kakotika taabota kabaa iyyedagi» hiyye; (Eettene yanna taaboti Isira'eelitoti giddo hedhemmaani) <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Sa'ooli qeesichchoke'ni haaso'ande'n hedhee'naa, Filsixeemike loliinke mannixxe kaambe'n canci bira saa'a'ni me'e. Tennexxe Sa'ooli qeesichcho, «Assitatexxa yaane uurrisi» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Okkonneechchi uduma Sa'oolinna isiki loliinki manni bukki hineexxi loliinbaa me'ine. Insa'nenna, Filisixxeemiki loliinki manni dommi hiyyeexxi ifinge wolaantichchinni weli'aanni weli wowwonxaa'naa anfe. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Ediwodda Filisixeemitotike loliinke mannibaa higeexxi Filisixeemitotixxe kaanbebaa alaalle me'emmak Ibiritotik manni Sa'oolinninna Yoonataaninni welti he'nemmabaa Isira'eelitotibaa hinge. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Koobuwwa callike Efireemike bogga'n sho'omee hedhemmaaki Isira'eelik manni duuchchi; Filisixeemik manni baajate'ni hedheexxa lanqee wodda; jaaba qici'ni insa'nee horidonfeexxi lolle. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Eettene barra Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Isira'eelito anjire; Isira'eelitotinna Filisixxeemito Beeti'awweke qachchi widi qico'n lolde.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yoonataan Malebo Ite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Sa'oolii, «Ani techcho naapha anke'n halo fulanno qico'n ayyinna hashshi qico'n mitteechchonna afo'ik maqoole badinemeeke kadowwaal!» hiyyeexxi arda kakachchiisemmaxxee, eettene barra Isira'eelik ardi wexeqema'n hose. Tennexxee Isira'eelik ardinaa'n ayyinna midha afo'ik maqeek hedhemmabaan. <verse eid="1SA 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Loliink manni duuchchi gongomi giddi'aa e'ye, malebiinxa dhaaba butta booncho booncho'inni anfe. <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />Ardikinna gongomi giddi'aa e'yee wodda malebiinxi la'e dhaabatenaa'n coccobe'eexxa afe; yaane kinni kako sodaatemmaxxee ayyinna ookkone malebiinaa'n afo'ik maqeek hedhemmabaan. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Yaane kinni Yoonataani anni isik arda kakachchiiseemmaxxa laqeemmaba'a. Tennexxe anga afeexxe siqqoxxa qacce malebi giddo cuuphe angate'n coccossa'n muxedheen, hafuurakanna hiissedhe jabaate. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Ookkoneechchi uduma loliinke mannanaa'n mitti, «Ani atik loliinka manna, ‹Telchixxa barra ayyinna midha wode'e afo'ik maqaak manji badinemeeke kadowwaal!› hiyyeexxi jaba qicinni kakachchiisedheen. Manji duuchchi shaqqe'echchi tenne buutonniten» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Yoonataaninna, «Anni anki no'oka arda rakkisse; malebokenaa'n shiixxoka afo'ik abidene woda hitte qico hafuura hiissedheennexxa uudde. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Ardita techcho naapha injifatee booji'emmaxxe booji'onaa'n iteechcho kaddeele silaa hittatta eloxxemman. Shiyyemammak Filisixeemik manni konne caala kadammabaan.»<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />Eettenne barra Isira'eeliki manni Filisixeemika manna Mikimaasinaa'n Ayyaloon qico'n shinnechchi uduma yo'oshsha gopheemman. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Tennexxe naaphakenaa'n boojinemmaxxe booji'o'n tirbi hiyya'n gedhebo, lalokanna jibootuwwa dulaa'n mundendinni maala ite. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" />Sa'ooli'n mitti manji, «Kunniseten ardi kunni maala mundendinni itati Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n cubbo hunjeen» hiyya'n odo kule.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:33">Sa'oolinna «Seera enqitine'een!» Amme ta'a «mitte lummoka kinjo anibaa gogo'mishshe»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Dada. 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Lew. 7:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Lan. 12:16</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:23">15:23</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'oolinna, «Ardi giddo mammarendina'n ‹Horatineeka lalakanna gedhebo duuchcha iyyedagineexxi duldinee kaba itte; maala mundendinni ittina'n Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo cubbo hujjinoqe› hitina'n kulle» hiyye ajaje. Tennexxe eettene hashsha mitti mitting manji ifi ifika mitte mitte jibichcha iyyedageexxi ookko dule. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Sa'oolinna ookko Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolcho'a tolchimalcho giisse; tolchimalcho giissa tinni isi'a siretixxemman.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Sa'oolinna ifika loliinka manna, «Amme Filsixeemike mannibaa aadadde marennexxi dokko hashsha insa'nee lollee sooda qico'n karra insa'neexxa saamme insa'nee duuchchiinga birro» hiyye; insa'neenna «Eeldaan hitattoxxa duuchcha assi» hine; qeesichchi kinni, «Edinseneexxi Mageniinxa fedhi laqe'no» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Tennexxee Sa'oolinna Magenoo, «Filisixeemika manna aade marre lolloo? Insa'nee anga'n no'oxxe'n sa'issite uutato?» hiyye qore. Yaane kinni Mageni eettene barra qortuma isike hiissichcho uwwebaan. <verse eid="1SA 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'ooli loliinke mannika akeekisanjuwwa, «Kabaa daggine'exxi telcho hiini cubbo hujendeexxa qorqortine affe. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Hedhaak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti, Isira'eeli'i anjireek ege'neexxa balleessa hujeeke manji belto anke Yoonataanite kaddoolenna midde iikki manji dhugaaten shiyemaan hiyye kakate.» yaane kinni manni giddi'n mittikinna isi'a hiissichcho uwweek hedhemmabaan. <verse eid="1SA 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'ooli insa'nee, «Ha'noo duuchchiingi konne darre'n uurre. Aninna anki belti Yoonataani ookkone darre'n uurrinaannoni» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:40">Insa'nenna, «Eldaani hitattoxxa assi» hine hiissine haasonne. <verse eid="1SA 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />Sa'oolinna «Duuchchi Woddika Gootta Isira'eelika Mageno dhugaa fulchi» hiyya'n soodate; hixikinna Sa'ooli'ninna Yoonataani'n ibe; ardi kinni qullo fule.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:21">Lak. 27:21</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:6">1 Sam. 28:6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'ooli, «Ane'ninna Yoonataani anke belto'n hixa ibisse» insa'nee hiyye. Hixikinna Yoonnata'n ibe. <verse eid="1SA 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'ooli Yoonataanii'i, «Assitetechcho ane'n kuli» hiyye qore. Yoonnatanninna, «Anga abixxenexxe siqqoxxe qaccenni malebo shiixxoka muxedhe'eennen, shiyyemona'anna kunna'a qixxeefate'e» hiyye kule.<verse eid="1SA 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Ookkonneechcha uduma Sa'oolinna, «Mageni fuggoxxa ane'n ilo ati shiyema gophphotole!» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Ardki kinni Sa'ooli'n, «Isira'eeli tenne lummoxxa injifacho'a geessisseek Yoonataani shiyemaa? Hara shiyemabaan! Hedhaak Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa, shiyema waalinii umike isike ordichchinaa'n mittikinna qunxi hiyyabaan; telcho tinni isi asseexxi duuchchi Mageniinke gargaarsinni kaddeexxen» hiyye; Konne qicinni ardi Yoonnatani shiyematenaa'n anjire.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'ooli Filisixeemika manna shorrishsha waale; Filisixxeemiki manninna illeema higee ifike bogiba'a me'e.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sa'oolika Mini Hado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Sa'ooli Isira'eelike moyanjo kadeechchi uduma, qarqara duuchcha'n hedheeka isika naaphuwwa duuchcha lole; insa'nenna. Mo'aabik, Amoonikinna Eedoomiki arduwwa, Tsobak moyanjuwwanna Filsixeemike ardan; duulokee fuleeba duuchcha'ni naapha ifika injifata'emman. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Isinna jannummati Amaaleeqika arda lolee injifateexxi Isira'eeli'i booji'emmakiirixxe naaphphuwwixxe anganaa'n anjire.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Sa'oolixxi labbaxxi ooseki summi Yoonataani, Yishiwinna Malkishu'a hiyyendammaxxeeramman; dubarakenaa'n angafa beltok summi Meeraabi kaddaa wodda, shixxooxxi kinni Melkooli hiyyendaxxemman. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Sa'oolixxe arek summi Ahino'aam hiyyendaan; isenna Ahima'aatsixxe beltomman; Sa'oolike lolinke manniki ajajalli Abeneertemman. Abineer Nerike, Nerinna Sa'oolike annike dayyike beltomman. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Abeneerik anni, Nerinna Sa'oolik anni Qiisi dayyuwwakemman; insa'nee lamingiik anninna Abi'eelitemman.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Sa'ooli lubboti hedhemmaka baro duuchcha Filsixeemike manninni welti jaba qicinni lolemaa'nee hedhaamman; tennexxee Sa'ooli jabaka yookaan janna manjo afoole adhdheexxi ifike lolinke mannixxe una assedha'emman.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Sa'ooli Amaleeqitote'ni Asseeka Bago</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />Saamu'eeli Sa'ooli hiyyee qici, «Isira'eelike ardi'a ate harrire moyaanjoke assanoshsha Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti Ergeemmak anten; ta'anna lumok Duuchchi Woddik Goottik hiyyaaxxa laqi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:1">1 Sam. 10:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" />Isira'eeli Gibtsee'n fuldee wodda Amaaleeqik ardi orake'n lola'ni rakkissemmaxxee Dada Duuchcha ajajake Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Amaleqika manna mura woxisatee mudhdheen.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:8-14">Fula. 17:8-14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:17-19">Lew. 25:17-19</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Ta'a maritettexxi Amaaleeqika manna koli; anfeechcho duuchcha kutti assi; mitteelchonna gatissoxxee; labbakanna meyyaaka, oosuwwatanna unnoole, lalo, gedhebo, gaaluwwakanna harre shilte biri.»<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Sa'oolinna ifika loliinka manna mitteba ye'ee bukki asseexxi Xeeleemi hiyyemaaba laakko'e; insa'nek laakkossinna Isira'eelike manninaa'n lame dhibba kuma lekkatika loliinka manna Yihudakenaa'n tomme kumma loiinka mannamman. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'ooli ifike loliinke manninni welti Amaaleeqike qachchibaa mareexxi wode'i hedhebaaxxe dhooqa giddo riphe gaade. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Isinna Qenaanika manna «Isira'eelik ardi Gibtsee'n fulee wodda eloxxa insaa'ne'aa assitineemmaxxe insa'nenni welti ha'noo birabo'noshsha Amaaleeqike manni giddi'n fuldine me'we» hiyye kule; tennexxe Qanaa'nik manni Amaaleqike manni giddi'n fule me'e.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Sa'oolinna isika loliinka manna Amaaleeqika manna Hawila hiyyendaaxxe bakkanaa'n Gibtsee'n boroti darree'n hexxeexxe Suuri hiyyendaaxxa bakka qico'n lolle. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Amaaleeqika moyanjo Agaagii'i lubbondinni hedhee'naa booji'eexxi, arda duuchcha wolaantichchiki bire. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Yaane kinni Sa'oolinna isiki loliinki manni moyanjo Agaagii'i lubbondinni waale; iittanni munde afeeka gedhebo, ha'iteexxa jibootanna ha'yiteexxa koromme, buruussuwwa, wele elo eloochcho duuchchanna balleessineba'a; insa'ne balleessineechchi la'o afebaachchonna tuffatemeechchuwwa callamman.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Saamu'eeli, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />«Sa'ooli anee wale'een; ajaja ankanna heqedha gopheemmaxxee isoo moyanjoke asseenexxee yo'oshsha yade'ennen.» Saamu'eelinna tennee yanee'a mufateexxi hashsha duuchcha Duuchchi Woddika Gootta soodate. <verse eid="1SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Gorsa bariisa ke'eexxi Saamu'eeli Sa'ooli hedheebaa mare; mitti mitti manni iso'ni, «Sa'ooli Qermeloosi qachchi'a me'een, ifike umike ulfinniinxe qallii kaddaaxxa soodo ookko uurriseechchi uduma Geligeelike qachchika adadde me'een» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Saamu'eeli Sa'oolibaa mare; Sa'oolinna, «Koo Saamu'eel! Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atee eebbisoo; aninna Duuchchi Woddike Goottika ajaja muuxxeenenni» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Yaane kinni Saamu'eelinna, «Eega tinni laqaannexxi laliinxe korommexxi barochchonna gedhebiinxi ma'la maachchota?» hiyye qore.<verse eid="1SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Sa'oolinna, «Kunni hori anki loliink manni Amaaleqike mannanaa'n booji'eken; insa'ne munde afeeka laluwwanna gedhebo Duuchchi Woddika Gootta attike Mageni'a tolchaakee iyyedageeken; no'o gateechcho kinni duchchinigelcho kutti assine'een» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Saamu'eelinna Sa'ooli, «Sammi hiyyi! Duuchchi Woddik Gootti yebeno hashsha ane'n kuleexxa ate'n kulo» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:16">Sa'oolinna «kulitaa» hiyye hiise haaso'e.<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Saamu'eelinna hiyye hiissee qici, «Ati ifi shiixxishshe uuddotolenna Isira'eelixxe gosake minnuwwike akeeksanjo kadde'eten. Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atee hariireexxi Isira'eelike moyanjo asse'een. <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />Cubbaaleessa kadeeka ookkonee Amaaleeqika arda biritattoshsha atee ergeen; mundaa qico'ninna insa'ne shilte birtattoshsha atte'n kuleen. <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Egedhita mayee Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ajajema gibbete? Alfitattoxxe la'o'aa booji'ememmachchuwwi'a haafende Duuchchi Woddika Gootti edo mayee fuggoxxa assitette?»<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Sa'oolinna hiyye hiisse haaso'ee qici, «Ani Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ajajeme'enen; hiyyemmashshanni duule'ennen; Amaaleeqika wele manna shiyye birennexxi moyanjo Agaagii calla booji'e aadhe dagennen. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Yaane kinn anki lolinki manni booje'ememmachchuwwinaa'n silaati shiyemammaka munde afeeka gedhebonna laluwwa shiya waaleexxi Geligeela Duuchchi Woddika Gootta atike Mageni'a tolcho'a iyyedage'een.»<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Saamu'eelinna hiyyee qici:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">«Duuchchi Woddike Goottike hiyyichchi'a ajajemate'n gammada qicishsha; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">isi'a uuwwendaaxxe midhatixxe uwwuwwa'ninna tolchuwwa'ni gamadaachcho labbee?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">Kunnisse! Magenokee ajajensha isi'a uunaaxxe uwwanaa'ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">hiyyaaxxa caqasatinna gedhebiinke korbeesike ha'yonaa'n saxxaan.<verse eid="1SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Duuchchi Woddike Gootta'n jallata morsiilsatixxe cubbinn qixxeten,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">hollaati ifi saada fakkuwwa magenoonfatatixxe cubbonni qixxenden.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">Ati Mageniinka hiyyichcho tuffatettaxee, isinna ati moyanjo kaddaboxxoshsha atee tuffate'een.»<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Sa'oolinna Saamu'eeli'n hiyye hiisse haaso'ee qici, «Eetti ani cubbo hujeenneni; Duuchchi Woddike Goottika ajaja sa'ennen atika hiyyichchonna heqqedhebe'noni; anka lolinka manna sodaate insa'ne hineexxa duuchcha assenneeni. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Ta'a balleesseennen ani'a gattowwaali hitotta'a ate'e kadhataannen; Duuchchi Woddika Gootta magenoonfatonna'a aninni welti Geligeli'a illee iima higi.»<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Saamu'eelinna isoo, «Ani atinni welti ileema higabe'non; ati Duuchchi Woddike Goottika ajaja tuffateeten; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Isira'eeli'n moyanjummati hexxabexxoshsha atee tuffate'een» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Saamu'eeli Sa'ooli birii'n ke'e me'o'a wiri hiyye; Sa'oolii kinni me'abaashsha Samu'eelixxe seemmaka kasa abidee wodda seemmatinna haaqi hite. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Saamu'eelinna Sa'ooli hiyyee qici, «Telcho Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eelixxe mootummaxxa galcha atenaa'n haaqi asse aadheexxi atenaa'n woyyo'aake atike ollalchi'a uwwe'een.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 28:17">1 Sam. 28:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:30-31">1 Moy. 11:30-31</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />Isira'eelik ulfaatek Mageni isi manjishshatebaan; isi sobabaa, lame afo'onna haaso'aba'a; isi manjoke kada gophemmaxxeenna yaada ifika jijiirabaan.»<verse eid="1SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Sa'oolinna hiisse hiyye haaso'e qici «Ani cubbo hujenneen; ate kadhataanexxi anke ardike akekisanjuwwi edonna Isira'eelike ardi duuchchi edo anee ulfeessi; Duuchchi Woddika Gootta atika Mageno magenoonfatonna'a aninni welti Gelgeli'a illee iima higi» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Tennexxe Saamu'eeli isinni welti Gelgeli'a me'e; Sa'oolinna Duuchchi Woddika Goottta sagade.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Saamu'eelinna «Amaaleeqika moyanjo Agaagii'i kabaa iyyedag!» hiyye ajaje. Agaaginna alaayye culphisa'n isiba'a dage; Agaaginna godobi giddo «Dugaandinni reyo iitta qarara'neechcho!» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Saamu'eelinna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:33">«Ati wolantichcho atiken amuwwa oose belo gatissetteshsha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:33">ama atixxinna wele meelalle giddi'n oosebelo gate» hiyye;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1SA 15:33">Ookkoneechchi uduma Saamue'eeli Geligeela Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolcha tolchimalchii edo Agaagii'i kochchise.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Saamu'eeli ifike minibaa Raama'a me'e; moyanji Sa'oolinna ifike minbaa Gibi'a hige. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Saamu'eelinna hedhoti hedhemmake baro duuchcha'n langaxxa Sa'ooli'i uudebaan. Yaane kinni isi'a hinqilfatee oodhaamman Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Sa'ooli'i Isira'eelike moyanjo assemmaxxee yo'oshsha yaade'emman.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s1">Saamu'eeli Daawwiti Moyanjoke Kado'a Hariire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Saamu'eelii'i, «Isira'eeli'n Moyanjummati hedhabaashsha Sa'ooli'i gibennekee ati isi'a haani qico'n ooxxa'n hexxato? Ejeerisiinxa zayite buudate'ni wonshitettexxi Beeteliheemi hedhdhaake Isseyiba mari; ani oose isixxi gidi'ni mitti moyaanjoke kadaashsha fileennen» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Saamu'eelinna «Tennee laqoole Sa'ooli anee shiyaan; hittata mara dande'anno?» hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:2">Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, «Mitte raada aaxxe marte'e ‹Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolchona'a dageennen› hiyyi. <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Tolchiinba'anna dago'a Isseyii'i ye'i; aninna ati maa assitattoxxa ate'n kulannon; ani hariiri hiyyannoka manjichchonna hariite moyashsha assitaatton.»<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Saamu'eelinna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ajajeexxa asso'a Beetelihemi'a mare; ookko geyeeshshaanni qachchinki akeekisanjuwi sodaate culphise Saamu'eeliba'a mareexxi «Elonxe daggete?» hiyye qorre.<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Saamu'eelinna, «Eett! Eloxeenden; ani Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a tolchona'a dageennen; ifi woyyoonsitine'e aniba'a amme» hiyye hiisse insa'ne'n haaso'e. Saamu'eelinna Isseyinna Isseyixxa labbaxxe oose woyyonseexxi tolchinba'a insa'nee ye'e.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Ookko genne wodda Saamu'eeli Isseyyixxe labbaxxe oose giddi'n Eli'aabite hiyyemaaka belto uudeexxi «Kunni manjichchi kaba Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo uurre'eki isi, dhugaandin moyanjummati fileme'eeken» hiyye hede. <verse eid="1SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Yaane kinni Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Saamu'eeli'i «Eli'aabixxe Ejjumaka qeerinenna isixxe bifaxxa biifa uuddoxxee; ani isoo tuffate'ennen; ani uudannok manji uudashshatebaan; manji albake uudaan Duuchchi Woddik Gootti kinni godoba hexxeexxe uudaan» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isseyi Abinadaab hiyyemaaka ifika belto ye'exxi Saamu'eeli edo shiqaashsha asse. Saamu'eeli kinni, «Konnenna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti file'ekebaan» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Ookkoneechchi udumanna Isseyi Saama hiyyemaaka ifika belto shiqaashsha asse; Saamu'eeli kinni «Konnenna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti file'eekebaan» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Konne qicin Isseyi ifixxa labbaxxa toorbaanixxa oose Samu'eeli edo shiqishe; Saamu'eelinna Isseyyii «Tenne atixxe labbaxxe oose giddi'n Duuchchi Woddik Gootti mittekanna filebaan» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Saamuee'linna Isseyi'i, «Atixxi labbaxxi oose yoona tennendee?» hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Isseyyina «Maa'nichchi hedheen; kinni isi gedhebo allaletee me'een» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Saamu'eelinna «Isiba'a manjo ergte dagaashsha assi; isi dagaaxxe offollabe'non» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Tennexxe Isseyyi manjo ergeexxi dagaashsha asse; isi daayyake, dhagga biifaakenna ille giddo kololotishsha hedheeke dargageessamman; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Saamu'eeli'i, «Fileenneki konneten, kexxettexxi isoo hariir!» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Saamu'eelinna ejersiixxi zayiite hexxemmaxxa buuda aadhexxi Daawwiti'i, isike dayyuwwi edo hariire; iikki woddi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti Hafuuri Daawwiti'n hunnati dage; ookkoneechchi uduma Saamu'eeli ifike minibaa Raama'a illee iima hige.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawwiti Sa'ooli'a Ergateme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottiki Hafuuri Sa'oolinaa'n gargari higemmaaxxe Duuchchi Woddike Gootti ergemmak fuggichchi hafuuri isoo wixxirri assaamman. <verse eid="1SA 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Sa'ooli'a erganjuwwinna Sa'ooli'i hiyyee qici, «Kunni Magenibaa'n ergemeeki fuggooki hafuuri atee wixxirri assaani; <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Tennexxe no'oke moyanjoo! Kiraara gana ege'ne'eeka manjo hanse ati'a iyyedangannoshsha mitte atika erganjo ajaji; ookkoneechchi uduma iikki fuggichchi hafuuri ate'n dagaa wodda iikki manjichchi ati'a kiraara ganaan, atinna fayyake kaddaton.»<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Sa'oolinna ifika erganjuwwa, «Kiraara elo qico gane ege'neeka manjo ani'a hassine iyyedagge» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Isike erganjuwwi giddi'n mitti, «Kiraara elo qico gana ege'neeka Beeteliheemi qachchi giddo hedhaammake Isseyika belto afeennen; isi jannake, dhagga biifake, jabake lolinke manjonna haaso'a ege'neeken; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna isinni welti hedheeke manjon» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Tennexxe Sa'ooli Isseyibaa manjo ergeexxi, «Atika belto, gedhebo alalammaka Daawwiti'i anibaa ergi» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Isseyinna buddeenakanna qalqallo wo'ma woyinetixxa booka aadhee harrete'n fe'eexxi Daawwitinni mitte re'etika buruusin welti Sa'ooli'a erge. <verse eid="1SA 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Daawwitinna Sa'ooliba'a dageexxi isi'a ergatemate'n ke'e; Sa'oolinna yo'oshsha isoo eeyyeexxi ifika loliinka miyya ba'edhaake assedhe. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'ooli Isseyi'n «Daawwiti yo'oshsha eeyyennen; tennexxe kabaanni hedheexxi ani'a ergatemuun» hiyye dhaame. <verse eid="1SA 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Mageniibaa'ni ergememmaaki fuggichchi haafuuri Sa'ooli'n daggaamma wodda duuchcha Daawwiti kirraara aadheexxi gana'emman. Fugggichchi haafuurinna isinaa'n bayyata'emmaxxee Sa'oolinna fayyake kada'emman.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Daawwitinna Golyaadi'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Filisixeemik manni ifika sannachcha lolakee bukki asse'ne'ee; Yihudake boga'ni Sekooti'ni bukki asse'ne. Insa'nenna Sekooti'ninna Azeeqaxxe oddo'n Efeesidaamimi hinaammaxxe bakka'n kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Sa'oolinna Isira'eeliki loliinki manni Filisixeemika manna lolatee qophpheenfanteexxi Eelaxxe dhooqa giddo bukki hine kaanbe oltine. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Dhooqa oddote'n hexxe'naa mitte darree'n hedheeke tullichcha'n hana Filisixeemik manni wele darree'ni hedheeke tullichcha'n kinni Isira'eeliki manni googesiki uurre'emman.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Gaatike qachchinaa'n dageeki, Goliyaadi hiyyemaaka mitti janni manjichchi, Filsixeemike mannixxe kaanbe giddi'n fule dage; isixxe hojjaki qeerrnni sase meetirenna taakkotemman. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Isinna maalde'iinxa gulle umoke'n uggudheexxi, ha'urri onde tommenna torbaane kiilo kaddaaxxa maalde'inxa koote qomate'n oddo'weemman. <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />Sarbuwwatanna maalde'inxe ganbelenni buqedheemman; maalde'inka bagedonna dugumote'n dulke'emman. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Isike bagedike somelchiki furidinni seemma gandammaxxe ogeeyyeke mirqisanjo haqichchiinshaten; isike bagedik sibiljik a'urrinna torbaane kiilomman; isixxa wonte ba'edhammak iikki loliink manjichchinna isi edi edii'n eettene wonte ba'edhee me'aamman.<verse eid="1SA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Golyaadi ke'e uurrexxi googesake'n uurre'eka Isira'eelika loliinke manna hafuura gikki assexxi hiyyee qici, «Ta'a ookko lolake'e googeessitinechchi maa assitino'ate? Ani Filisixeemichchokebaa? Ha'no kinni Sa'oolike reganjuwwabaa? Yoona ha'noo giddii'n mitte manjo fildine'e isi ani hedhenebaa adade dirruuni; <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Isi anee lole injifate shiyoole, no'oo ha'nooke garba kande ha'noo hunda hiremee gallanon; yaane kinni ani isoo injifate shiyoonnole, ha'noo Isira'eelito no'ke garbuwwa kaddine no'oo Filisixeemitoti hunda galdinaan.» <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Okkoneechchi uduma, iikki Filisixeemichchi, «Ani techcho kaba Isira'eelika loliinka manna geeqqisha'ennen! Aninni welti lolemaaka ha'nooka mitte manjo uwwe!» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Sa'oolinna Isira'eeliki loliink manni konne Filisixeemichchiinka hiyyichcho lanqeexxa yanna yo'oshsha alanne culphinse.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isseeyyi Daawwiti Sa'ooli'a Ergatemo'a Erge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Daawwiti Yihudake bogike Beetelihemike qachcha'n hedhamake ookkone Eefiraatichchi Isseyyike beltommani; Isseyi saddeeta labbaxxa oose afe'emmake manjomman. Isi Sa'ooli moyemmake baro'n cime'eeke qeerraxxe woggake manjomman. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Isixxi Sasiinxi lumolla oose Sa'oolinni welti duulde'emman; angafi belti Eli'aabi, langaki Aminadaabi, sakkaki Saama hiyyemaakemman. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Daawwiti maa'nichchoke kadaa wodda, sasingi isik angafuwwi Sa'oolixxa duuka me'emman. <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />Daawwiti Sa'oolibaa'n mara'n anniinka gedhebo Beetelihemi allala'emman.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Golyaadi Filisixeemichchi shoole tomme barra duuchcha gorsanna galgala Isira'eelike manni edi darre dage uurra'nee geerara'emman.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Mitte barra Isseyi Daawwitii'i hiyyee qici, «Tomme kiilo ayyeemeeka deeddamonna tomme kebbo aaxxee bagediinxe kanbe'n hedheeke atike dayyuwwi'a rakke'e iyyemar. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Tennee tomme loobo itichchanna loliinka manna ajajammake jalaaban uwwi; dayyuwwi atiki nage'inginni hedheexxa uuddi; nage'ik hedha insa'nexxa ege'nannoka beessisa insa'nenaa'n ani'a iyyedagi. <verse eid="1SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Moyanji Sa'oolii, atiki dayyuwwinna Isira'eelik ardi duuchchi Eelaxe dhooqa'n Filsixeemike manninni lolake'n he'neen.»<verse eid="1SA 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Daawwitinna gedhebo wele allalisanjo'n waaleexxi Isseyi ajajemmashshanni qophpheessendemmaxxa ita aadheexxi bariisa ke'e me'e; Isira'eeliki loliink manni bagedo ibiso'a hafuura gikki assee geerara'n bakka abixa'emmaxxee safe: Daawwiti bagediinxe kaanbe giddo mare geye. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Filisixeemikinna Isira'eelik loliink manni ifi ifixxa bakka erqe kayya abixxeexxi welti iba calla gate'emman. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Daawwitinna iyyemaremmaxxa ita gala'a heqqammake'n uwweexxi loliinbaa gongee mareexxi dayyuwwa ifika nage'a aadhe. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Daawwitinna dayyuwwa ifikenni haaso'a'neege'n Goliyaadite hiyyemammaki Filisixeemichchi Gaatike qachchik janni manjichchi edi wodda assammashshanni loliinke mannike googessi giddi'n fuleexxi Isira'eeli'n geeraraa'na'a Daawwiti laqe. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Isira'eeliki manninna Golayaadi uudeexxi yo'oshsha sodaate baaje. <verse eid="1SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Isira'eeliki manninna weli'aanni weli hiyyaamma qici, «Isira'eeli geeqishsho'a barra barra'inni daga'neeka konne manjichcho uudineen? Moyanji Sa'aooli isoo shiyaake manji'a lumoxxa karra uwwo'aaten; belto ifixxanna ookkone manjichchi'a uwwo'anna isike anniki minni hadik manninna Isira'eelike bogi giddo irbo laqemabaashsha haasoe'edheen» hiyya'n haaso'a'naa laqe.<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Daawwitinna isi bira uurreemmaka manna, «Konne'e Filsixeemichcho shiyee Isira'eeli salphinakenaa'n gatisaake manji'a maachcho assemaa? Issinni hedhaake Mageniinka arda geeqisha'nek kunni jila offolebaaki Filisixeemichchi isi ayyete?» hiyye qore. <verse eid="1SA 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Insa'nenna, Golyaadi shiyake manji'a maachchi assemaaxxa Daawwiti'n kulle.<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Daawwittiki angafi dayyi, Eli'aabi, Daawwiti manniki haaso'a'naa laqeexxi, yo'oshsha aareexxi, «Maa assitato kaba? Qilla gammoojje hedheeka ookkone gedhebo ayye'n walide daggete? Ifi dukkatoxxanna fuggoxxa godoba uggudhitatoxxa ege'nennen; welechchi'atebaan ati daggeetechchi bagedo daa'weteten» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Daawwitinna, «Ani ta'a maa assene? Qortumakanna qorabe'no hyyotee?» hiyye hiisse haaso'e. <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Ookkoneechchi uduma wele manjichchib'a wirri hiyyexxi wolidinga qortuma isoo qore; qortuma qoreexxe yanna duuchcha'n uwwemaammaki hissichchi edike'n mittengemman.<verse eid="1SA 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Daawwiti haaso'emmaka haaso'a laqemmaki manni mareexxi Sa'ooli'n kule; Sa'oolinna Daawwiti'n manjo erge ye'isiise. <verse eid="1SA 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Daawwitinna Sa'ooli'i, «Moyanjoo! Konne Filisixeemichchokenaa'n kexxeexxa ayyinna ayyik godobinna hojjoggi hiyyoqqe'e! Atiki gaaribbichchi ani maree isoo lolanon» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Sa'oolinna Daawwiti'i, «Ati ooseten; isi oosumande'n lolake'n nophpheeke kademmaxxee konne Filisixeemichcho marite lola dandetabexxon» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="1SA 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Daawwiti kinni hiyyee qici, «Moyanjoo! Atiki garibbichchi ani anke annika gedhebo allalenneke allalanjon; hore iitaak biniichchi dageexxi gedhebi giddii'n mitte adhdhaa wodda, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />Shorre maree'e adhdhemmaka afo'okenaa'n ibisanaan; biinniichchi ikki ane'n illee iima higeexxi dagaa woddanna isoo hudhe abidee'e gane shiya'ennan. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Ani atiki garibbichchi ookkone biniichcha shiyeneeneken; ookkone biniichcha'n asseneeshshanni hedhaake Mageniinka arda qeeqishemmaxxee konne mageno ege'nebaaka Filisixeemichchoke'ninna iittanni assannon. <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />Daawwitinna lebeexxi, biiniichchike afo'inaa'n anee anjireek Duuchchi Woddik Gootti konne Filisixeemichchiinxe anganaa'ninna ane'e anjiraan.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:37">Sa'oolinna, «Eloxxen! Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti atinni hedhuun, me'i!» <verse eid="1SA 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Sa'oolinna ifixxa lolinxa oddoono Daawwiti'ni oddeese. Maalde'iinxa gullenna umoke'n uggeexxi sibliinxa koote qomate'n oddeesse. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Daawwitinna iitta hexxeexxa seemma odo'we ege'na gophemmaaxxe Sa'oolika wolaantichcha loliinxe seemma'n hana ka'le'e me'o'aa hobbi hiyyee wodda me'a dande'ebaa; tennexxe Daawwiti Sa'ooli'i, «Baratebe'noxxe yaane kaddemmaxxee tenne seemma odo'we lola dande'abe'non!» hiyye. Tennexxe duuchchingeechcho fulchedhe. <verse eid="1SA 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Ookkoneechchinni udumi'a Siqqichcho adhdheexxi, onde kuku'michcha kinjo lagii'n file aadheexxi allaleti woddixxe subbi giddo uggudheexxi looyyatanna adhdhee Filisixeemichchiinbaa shikki hiyye mare.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawwiti Goliyaadi Shiyye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Goliyaadi Filisixeemichchi Daawwitibaa shiqqa'n dage; isika lolinka miyya ba'edhdhaammak manjichchinna isi edi edii'n me'a'nemman. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Daawwiti daayyake, dhagga biifaamake, oosichcha belto kademmaxxee Goliyaadi isoo hubate uudee wodda tuffate. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Tennexxee Goliyaadi Daawwitti'i, «Siqqo abixxite ane'n daga'etechchi ani wolchokee?» hiyye ke'exxe Filsixeemike magenuwwike summinni Daawwiti'i badine. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Lebeexxi, «Kaba'anni amo! Maala atika allaateteenna biniichchi itaashsha assannon» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Daawwitinna Filisixeemichchoke'n hiisse haaso'e hiyyee qici, «Ati wolaantichcha, bagedokanna marca abixxite aniba'a daggeten; ani kinni ati geeqqishshaateke Dada Duuchcha Ajajaak Duuchchi Woddika Gootta, Isira'eelike sannachchike Magenike summinni ate'n dagaannen. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Techcho Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atee anxe anga'ni sa'isse uwwaan; aninna gooba atika kutannoni; Filisixeemitotike sannachchika renshanna alaattuwwatinna biniinchuwwi itaashsha assannon. Tennexxe uduma butta duuchcha Isira'eeli Mageno affe'eexxa egendaan. <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />Kaba bukki hiyyeeki duuchchi, Duuchchi Woddik Gootti arda ifika anjiraaki wolaantichikinna bagedikite kadebaaxxa ege'naan; lolaak Magenoke kadeemmaxxee lollee ha'noo injifantannoshsha isi midditte no'aa uwwaan.»<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Goliyaadi Daawwiti lolo'a Daawwitiba'a sheqe maree wodda Daawwitinna Goliyaadi'i lolo'a filsixeemike loliinke mannike googessiba'a gonga'n mare. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Daawwitinna anga subbi giddi'a luqqu'mi asse mitte kinjo aadhdhe'e Goliyaadi'n looyye; kinjikinna Goliyaadike kallachcha'n mare lixe; Goliyaadinna buttinake'n gonbiseme ibe. <verse eid="1SA 17:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Konne qicinni Daawwiti wolaantichcha anga afebaang kinjkinna looyyati ookkonee Filisixeemichcho injifate shiye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:19">2 Sam. 21:19</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 17:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />Daawwitnna gonge mareexxi Goliyaadike renshi hana uurre; wolaantichchakanna Goliyaadike gonofinaa'n luqqiseexxi gooba isika qurubbi asse.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:51">Insa'nek janni iikki Goliyaadi shiyyemeexxa afeexxi Filisixeemik loliink manninna ke'e baaje.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:9">1 Sam. 21:9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Isira'eelikinna Yihudak manni hafuura gikki assine geerara'n Filisixeemika lolinka manna Gaati qico'n okko'inna Eqiroonike dalla'ixxe huluwwa qico'ni shorrishe; Filsixeemike manniki renshi Shi'arayiimii'n Geeti qico'n, okko'ninna Aqaroonike dalla'ixxe huluwwa qico'ni hedheke ora duuchcha'n ibe'eemman. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Isira'eelik manni Filisixeemika manna shorrishe illeema higa'n kaanbe insa'nexxa saame. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Daawwiti ookkone Filisixeemichchiinka gooba aadheexxi Iyyerusaalemi iyyedage; Goliyaadika loliinka miya kinni ifinge duunkaani giddo ugge.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abenerii Daawwiti'i Sa'ooliba Iyyemare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Daawwiti ookkonee Filisixeemichchinni lolo'a me'aamma wodda Sa'ooli Daawwiti afeexxi ifike lolinke mannika akeekisanjo Abeneerii'i, «Kunni belti ayyike?» hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:55">Abeneerinna «Moyanjo! Atixe hedhoo! Ayyike belto kadeexxa ege'nebe'noni» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 17:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Sa'oolinna, «Kunni belti ayyike kadeexxa manna qorte wo'mi» hiyye ajaje. <verse eid="1SA 17:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Tennexxe Daawwiti Ookkonee Filisixeemichcho shiyyeexxi ille iima higee wodda Abeneeri isoo Sa'oolibaa iyyemare; eettene yanna Daawwiti Goliyaadika gooba anganni afe'emman. <verse eid="1SA 17:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Sa'oolinna Daawwiti'a «Koo dargageessa! Ati ayyike belto?» hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:58">Daawwitinna «Ani Betelheemike qachcha'n hedhammake erganjo atike Isseyike belton» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Daawwiti Sa'oooli'n haaso'a bireechchi uduma Sa'ooliki belti Yoonataani Daawwiti'a lubbote kadeexxi isoo ifishsha eeyye. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Eettene barranaa'n Sa'ooli Daawwitii isinni welti hedhaashsha assexxi mini ifikiba'anna me'abaashsha hoyye. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Yoonataani Daawwiti lubbo ifixxitishsha eyyemmaaxxee isinni kako aage jaalome. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Yoonataani oddo'weemmaka kaaba Daawwit'a fulche uwwe; iitaanni oddo'wine lolaaxxa seemma, wolaantichcha, gabetanna mixxe ifixxa uwwe. <verse eid="1SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Daawwiti Sa'ooli isoo duulo'a ergaammake booncho duuchcha'n injifachchoti aaga'emman; tennexxee Sa'ooli ifike lolinke mannike ja'laaba kaddaashsha hariire; tinninna Sa'oolika lolinke mannika jaa'labuwwa duuchcha gammachiisse.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sa'ooli Daawwitike Naapha Kadeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Daawwiti ookkonee Filisixeemichcho shiyyeechchi uduma loliink manni ifi ifike miniba'a higaammaxxa yanna melaalle iliilinsa'ninna sirbita'n, masiinqonna ookole ganenda'n Isira'eelike bogike qachchuwwi duuchchinaa'n Sa'ooolii'i qopheexxo'a fulde. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" />Melaalletinna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 18:7">«Sa'ooli kuma shiyalloo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 18:7">Daawwiti tomme kuma shiyaloo!» hitaa'n meellite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:11">1 Sam. 21:11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 29:5">29:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Kunni hiyyichchi Sa'ooli gammachchiisa gophemmaxxee yo'oshsha aareexxi «Daawwiti'i tomme kumike, anee kinni mitte kumike calla assineen; yooni isi'a moya malee maachcho gate?» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Tennenaa'n kexxeexxa eetene barranaa'n Sa'ooli Daawwiti'i gaabbexxi elobaaxxe illenni uushshote'n ke'e.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Langa baro Mageniibaa'n ergemeeki fuggichchi hafuuri hunnat Sa'ooli'n dage; Sa'oolinna mine ifik gido maraatee manjiishsha rara'nemmani; Daawwitinna barra barra'ninni assammashshanni kiraara gana'emma wodda Sa'oolinna angate'n bagedo abixxe'emmani, <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />«Daawwiti'i otennexxi miniki welti mineke assannon!» hiyye hede. Ookkoneechchi uduma bagedo Daawwiti'n lamele darbate; Daawwiti kinni lamiinxe yanna'n milqe gate.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Sa'ooli'i gibe'e Daawwitinni welti hedhemmaxxee Sa'ooli Daawwiti'i sodaate. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Tennenaa'n kexxeexxa Sa'ooli Daawwiti'i ifi biri'n bayyisatee kuma lolinke mannike kuma ajajallo kadaashsha asse; Daawwitinna loliinka manna bagidinba'a adhdhe me'e. <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti isinni welti hedhemmaxxee assaammaxxi duuchcha isi'a qajeelda'nemman. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Daawwiti assaaxxi duuchchi isi'a qajeeldeexxa uudeexxi Sa'ooli edi irra yo'oshsha isoo sodaate. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Yaane kinni Daawwiti lolinka manna bobbaase assa'emmaxxe Isira'eelikinna Yihudak ardi duuchchi isoo eyya'nemman.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawwiti Sa'oolixxa belto Aadhdheexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'ooli Daawwit'ii, «Magenokee lola jannunteti loliddottole angaafa anxa belto Meeraabii'i ate'ni heerunsiisannon» hiyye. Sa'ooli tennee hiyyeechchi «Filisixeemik manni Daawwitii shiyyuuni male'e ani anga anxa isoo'n wirri assabe'non» hiyye hedemmaxxeeten.<verse eid="1SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Daawwitinna Sa'ooli'i, «Moyanjinke ballo kadiyyotee ani ayyete? Anke annik mini Isira'eeli gido hoonte kade?» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Yaane kinni Meeraabi Daawwiti'n herudammaaxxi yanna geltee wodda Sa'oolii Mehoola hiyyemaake boganaa'n dageeke Adiri'eeli hiyyemaake welenge manjo'n heerunsiise.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Kaddo malee Melkooli hiyyenddaxxi Sa'oolixxi belto Daawwiti eette; Sa'oolinna tenne odo laqeexxi gammade. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Isinna godobi giddo, «Melkooli'i Daawwiti'n heerunsisannon; ise Daawwiti Filisixeemike mannixxe anga'n reyo'a isi'a fonxorete kaddaan» hiyye hede; tennexxe Sa'ooli langaxxa yanna Daawwiti ye'eexxi «Ta'a ati langaxxa anke ballo kaddatton» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Sa'oolinna jalqabuwwa ifika ye'eexxi «Moyanji atee eeyya'neen; isiki ja'labuwwi atee eeya'neen; tennexxee isixxa belto tenne yaanna'n haadhi» hineexxi Daawwiti'n qofiba kullaashsha ajaje.<verse eid="1SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Tennexxe Sa'oolik jalaabuwwi tenne yaane Daawwiti'n higgeenna sho'ik kulle; Daawwitinna kinni insa'nee, «Anishsha hedheek hiyyeessi manji moyanjinke ballo kada shiixxoxxe yanne ha'no'n labe?» hiyye; ani mitti hiyyeessa manjonna konne qiconna ege'nemenneke manjobaan.<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Sa'oolik erganjuwwikinna Daawwiti hiyyeexxa Sa'ooli'n kullee wodda, <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Sa'oolinna, «Moyanji ifixxe beltoke araari'a atenaa'n hasa'neechchi naapha isike'n halo fulo'a dhibba Filisixxeemika manna shilte shoggora iyyedaggota'a callan» hine Daawwiti'ni kullaashsha jalqaabuwwa ifika ajaje. Sa'ooli tenne assechchi Daawwiti Filisixxeemike mannixxe anga'n reyuuni hiyye hedemmaxxeten. <verse eid="1SA 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Sa'ooliki jalqaabuwwinna tenne yaane Daawwiti'n kulle; moyanjike ballo kadatixxi yaane Daawwitii yo'oshsha gammachchiisse; Aadhatixxi barra geltebaa edi gama, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />Daawwitinna ifiki lolinki manni duuleexxi lame dhibba Filisixxeemika manna shiyye; Daawwitinna moyanjinke ballo kado'a shiyyemmake mannika lame dhibba shoggora laakko'e uwwe; Tennexxe Sa'ooli belto ifixxa Melkooli'i Daawwiti'n heerunsiisse.<verse eid="1SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Sa'ooli Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Daawwitinni hedheexxanna isixxi belto Melkooli isoo eeteexxa ege'ne. <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />Tennexxee Sa'ooli edi irra Daawwiti'i sodaatatenaa'n kexxeexxa hedhemmake baro duuchcha'n isi'a naaphake kade gate.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Filisixeemik loliinke mannik ajajalluwwi yanna yanna'ninni lolake'e fula'emman; kaddo malee fuleeke duuchchinge lola'n Sa'oolike lolinke manni irra injifatammaaki Daawwititemmani; tennenaa'n kexxexxa Daawwiti yo'oshsha gurra fuleeke kade.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Sa'ooli Daawwiti'i Shiyo'a Asseexxa Wo'lancho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Sa'ooli Daawwiti shiyo'a hedeexxa belto ifike Yoonataani'ninna jalqabuwwa ifike duuchcha'ni kule; yaane kinni Yoonatanni Daawwiti'i yo'oshsha eeyya'nemman. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Yoonataani Daawwitii'i, «Anki anni atee shiyo'a hasa'neen; soodo gorsa ifi heqqedhi; mitte qoonne bakka'n sho'onde hosi. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Ati sho'onde hexxetek fichchi giddi'a anke anninni welti dangennexxi atixxa yaane ke'issennexxi haaso'ashsha assannon; hexxeexxi yaane hexxoolenna egendattoshsha assannon.»<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Yoonataaninna anna ifike Sa'oolinni Daawwitixxa eloxxa yaane haaso'a'ni hiyyee qici, «Erganjo atika Daawwiti fuggo assitoxxee; isi ati'a heddo elooxxa yaane assee malee atee balleessechchi hedhebaan. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Isi ookkone Filisixeemichcho shiyeek lubbo ifixxa gurgudheeten; Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Isira'eelik ardi lumoxxa injifachcho injifataashsha asse; atinna tenne uudete wodda gammade'ettan; hittata mittechchonna balleessebaaka manjo fuggo assitota'a heddatto? Mayee tola boddichcha Daawwiti'i shilitota'a hassette?»<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Sa'oolinna Yoonataani hiyyeexxa laqeexxi Daawwiti'i shiyabaaxxa: «hedhaake Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summinni kakate.» <verse eid="1SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Tennexxe Yoonataani Daawwitii'i ye'eexxi tennee duuchchinxa iso'n kuleechchi uduma Sa'ooliba isoo iyyemare; Daawwitinna edishshanni moyanjokee erigatemate'n hige.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Filisixeemike manninni haaroba lola ke'e; kaddolenna Daawwiti insa'ne lole heddo manna shiyyemmaxxe'e baanje me'ine.<verse eid="1SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Mitte barra Duuchchi Woddike Goottnaa'n ergemeeki fuggichchi hafuuri Sa'ooli'n dage; isinna bagedo anga abixxe mine ifike'n ofo'lemman; Daawwitinna ookko kiraara gana'nemman. <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />Sa'ooli bagedi ifikinni Daawwiti'i oteexxi miniki mineke asso'a hedeexxi bagedo iso'n darbe; Daawwiti kinni milqi hiliqemmaxxee bagedi mare mineke'n gobeme; Daawwitinna eettenenni hashsha ookko'n baaje fule.<verse eid="1SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />Sa'ooli Daawwiti'i mine bunqee heqqa'n galeexxi gorsa shiyaaka manna erge; Daawwitixxi are Melkooli «Techcho hashsha baaje fula gophphotole soodi gorsi ati'a shiyyemanden» hita'n jaba qicinni xexe'achchiise kulde.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 59">Far. 59</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Mlkoolinna masikootetenaa'n Daawwiti'i fulchite'naa baaje fule. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Melkooli mini hadi magenoonfantammaxxa fakke aaxxexxi taqete'n diiphisse; re'etixxe oridanninna ganendeexxa boraate umii darre'n uggiteexxi seemma iti buyyisse. <verse eid="1SA 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Sa'oolik lolinki manni Daawwiti'i abido'a dagee wodda Melkooli insa'ne'n «Isi elagophee diiphe'en» hite. <verse eid="1SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Sa'ooli kinni «Isoo shiyona'a taqendinni dukkine anibaa iyyedage» hiyya'n manna illee iima hiisse erge. <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Ergememmak manni mini'a e'yee wodda mataa magenoofachchotixxa fakkenna re'etixxe oridanni gandeemmaxxa boraate calla afe. <verse eid="1SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Sa'oolinna Melkoolii'i «Naaphi anki baaje fulaashsha assite anee iitta sobbettechchi mayeete?» hiyye isee qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:17">Isenna «Ani maa assanno, ‹Anee fulcha gophphottole atee shiyannon› anee hiyyeen» hita'ni iso'n hiissite haasote. <verse eid="1SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Daawwitinna baaje fuleexxi Saamu'eeliba Raama'a me'e; Sa'ooli isoo assexxa duuchcha Samu'eeli'n kule; ookkonechchi uduma Samu'eelinna Daawiti Naayyoti'a me'ine ookko ofolle. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Mataa Daawwiti Raama giddo Naayyoti hiyyemaaba hedhexxa Sa'ooli laqe. <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Tennexxe Daawwiti abidaaka manna Sa'ooli erge insa'nenna ookko'o gennee wodda, Saamu'eelixxe akeetenni bukki hiteexxi wabeekotika hafuura gikki assitee raaga ragaa'naa anfe; ookkone wodda Sa'ooli ergemmake manna'n Mageniiki Hafuur dagemmaxxee insa'nenna hafuura gikki assineexxi raaga raange. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Sa'ooli tenne laqeexxi wele manna erge; insa'nenna wabeekumma haaso'ate'n ke'ne; Sa'oolinna sakkaxxa wele manna erge insa'nenna kinni wabeekumma haasonne. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'ooli ifi'anni Raama'a me'o'a ke'e; Sekku hexxeexxe wode'e camma'neexxe lummoxxe baleba geyeexxi «Saamu'eelinna Daawwiti haba he'ne?» hiyye qoree wodda, Naayyoti he'neexxa iso'n kulende. <verse eid="1SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Tennexxee Sa'ooli Naayyoti'a me'a'ni ora hedhee'naa Mageniink hafuuri iso'inna dage; isinna Naayyoti geyaa qico'n raaga raanga'nee me'a'nemman. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" />Sa'ooli Saamu'eeli bira geyee wodda seemma fulchedheexxi raaga haaso'a'n eettene barranna eettene hashsha duuchcha duwwiti ibeeba hose gale; «Sa'oolinna wabeekotena'n mittiinsha laakko'emeen?» hiyyemaaki mammaassi mammaakemeek tennexxeetemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:11-12">1 Sam. 10:11-12</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Daawwitinna Yoonataani'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Daawwiti Raama giddo hexxeexxe Naayyotinaa'n baaje Yoonataaniba mareexxi «Maa assene? Ballessa anxi maachcho? Anni atiki anee shiyo'a hasa'neeki maa gorse'naate?» hiyye qore.<verse eid="1SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Yoonataninna, «Tinni atenaa'n bayyattoo! Rertaboxxoni!; Lumoxxe kadi shiixxoxxa yaane anki anni anee sho'aaxxi hexxebaan; tenne yaanenna kaddoole anni anki anee sho'abaan; mayee sho'a!» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Daawwiti kinni, «Anni atiki anee yo'oshsha eettaatexxa ege'ne'een; tennexxe hexxeexxa ate'n ege'nishabaashsha mudhdheeni; tennenna assa'neechchi ati tenne egendotole yo'oshsha yaadattoxxa ege'nemmaxxeten; Hedhake Duuchchi Woddike Goottik summinni: atixxenna anxe oddo'ni balete hexxeen inbonnaa qaraqqarake'n he'nenen» hiyye kakate.<verse eid="1SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Yoonataaninna Daawwitii'i, «Ati hassetechcho duuchcha ati'a assannon» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />Daawwitinna, «Soodi baate fuldammake ayyanan; silaanni aninna moyanjiki welti ofo'le itannaken; yaane kinni o'lmisoodixxe hashsha qico'n sho'omonna'a ani'a eeti uwwi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:11">Lak. 28:11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Aki magada anni atiki anee haseexxe kaddoole ‹Firik welti woggatika tolcha shiqin sha'emmaxxee qachcha ifike Beetelihemi'a rake me'o'aa Daawwiti ane'e magannise kadhaten› hite iso'n kuli. <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Moyanjikinna, ‹Eloxxen› hiyyoole, ani atiki erganji nage'ik hedhannoxxa ege'nannoni; mufatoole kinni fuggoxxa ani'a hede'eexxa egendattoni. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Mageniinke summinni ani'a kako aagetaxxee maganneten anee garbichcha atikee eloxxa assi; ani balleessanjoke kadonnole atinni anee shiyi malee shiyaashsha anna atike'n mayee anee sa'issite uutatto?» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Yoonataani kinni, «Iitta hedheeka heduma hara heddoxxee! Ate'n fuggoxxa asso'a hedeexxa dhuganda ege'nenelcho kaddeele, ani ati'a kulannaba?» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Daawwitinna, «Yoona anni atiki elobaaxxa anxee mufeti ate'n haasoole ayyete ane'n kula?» hiyye qore.<verse eid="1SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Yoonataaninna, «Amotata! Diidinba'a me'ino!» hiyye hiisse; lamingi diidi giddi'a me'ine. <verse eid="1SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Yoonataani Daawwitii'i hiyyee qici: «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eeliki Mageni ege'neexxa! Soodo iitexxe yanna'n yookaan olmi soodo Anni anki ati'a eloka yaada afe'eeke kadeexxa qoree ca'a assennelchi uduma tenne yaane ca'a asse kulaaka manjo atiba ergannon. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Ate'ni fuggoxxa asso'a hasa'neeke kadoole kinni, ate'n ca'a asse kula gophe, atinna nage'inginni me'itatoshsha assa gophonnole anki Anni ate'n fuggoxxa asso'a hedeexxa Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ane'n geessiso'o. Anke Anninni welti hedhemmaki Mageni atinninna welti hedhowwaali! <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Ani lubboti hedhenneke baro duuchcha'ni shiyemabo'noshsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti eeyyaaxxa addatendeexxa jaalala ani'a leellishi; <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" />Iitanni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atika Daawwitika naapha buttatenaa'n biraa wodda addatendeexxe atixxe jaalalanni anka mini hadonna waaldoxxee.» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:1">2 Sam. 9:1</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Tennexxee Yoonataani, «Daawwitike naapha'n Duuchchi Woddik Gootti halo fulowwaal» hiyyeexxi Daawitixxe hortenni welti kako aage.<verse eid="1SA 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Yoonataani Daawwitii'i lubbo ifixxishsha eeyyammaxxee Dhugaati anee etattole higgeenna kakati hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Yoonataani isoo hiyyee qici, «Soodo baate fuldammake ayyaannan ofoldattake barcumi duwwi gatoole hexxeboxxoxxa ege'nendatton; <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Olmi soodo galgala tinni rakko kaddee wodda sho'ondeeteba Etseli hiyyemaake kinji uduma marete sho'omi. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Aninna miselcho'n alaama'neeke manjishsha kinji qarqari'a sase gabe darbannon. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Ookkoneechchi uduma darbennaxxa gabuwwa iyyedagaashsha anka erganjo ergannon; isoo ‹Gabuwwa ati kayyi darre hexxeen affetexxi iyyedagi› hiyyonnole hedhaak Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ege'neexxa ‹atee miidhachchi hedhebaani› hiyyoten. Tennexxee shondetabaa'n fuli. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Yaane kinni ookkone belto ‹Gabuwwa ati eliqi darre hexxeeni› hiyyennexxe kaddoole Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ate me'isse'emmaxxee me'i. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Atinna ani weli haasonennaxxe yaanexxee duuchchi woddi'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ati'anna ani'a dhugaaten.»<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Tennexxe Daawwiti badda'a giddo sho'ome ture; baate fuldammake ayyanixxa barra Sa'ooli la'o la'ato'a ofo'le. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Sa'ooli wele woddishshanni ifixxe ulfinniixxe bakka'n mineke'n irikateexxi ofo'le; Abeneerinna iso'n itti aane ofo'laa wodda Yoonataani kinni isi edi gami'n ofo'lemman; konne wodda Daawwiti ofo'lammake baricuma'n ofo'lemang hedhemmabaan. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />Kaddo malee Sa'ooli «Daawwiti kaddexxe yaane hexxeen; yookaan seerinke ajajishsha battummatena'n ca'a hiyyagopheten» hiyya'n godobik hedammaxxee eettene barra haaso'aage hinaageechcho bucuqqi hiyyebaan. <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Baate fuldammake ayyanni sa'ena'a langaxxa barra Daawwiti ofo'lammake baricuma'n ofo'leemang hedhemmabaan; tennexxee Sa'ooli belto ifika Yoonataanii'i «Isseyik belti bereqqenna techcho mayeete tenne lumoxxe ita'ni afema gopheechi?» hiyye qore.<verse eid="1SA 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Yoonataaninna, «Daawwiti Beetelihemi'a me'o'aa eeti isi'a uwwannoshsha magannise anee kadhate. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />‹No'oki mini hadi qachchi giddo tolcha tolchaammaxxee ookko afemannoshsha anki dayyi anee ajaje'een; atenaa'n elle alfoonnole maganneten eetti an'a uwwi dayuwwa anka mare uudo› hiyye anee laqeemman; tennexxeeten moyanjiinxe tenne lumoxxe ita'ni afema gopheechchi.»<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Sa'oolinna Yoonataani'n yo'oshsha mufateexxi «Ati dabaaleetetikenna xaqartite manjichchoki belti! Ati ifi'anna shooke ama atixxanna salphisota'a Isseyike beltinni welti jaalondetexxa ege'nennen! <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Isseyik belti lubboti hedhee qico'n ati mootumma atixxe'n jabaate uurritaboxxoxxa egendeboxxo? Marte isoo aaxxe iyyedagi! Isi shiyemaaken.»<verse eid="1SA 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Yoonataaninna ifika anna Sa'oolii'i, «Maye'a shiyema? Balleessa isixxi maachcho?» hiyye haaso'e.<verse eid="1SA 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Sa'ooli tennenaa'n kexxeexxa Yoonataanii'i shiyo'a anga abixxeeka bagedo iso'n darbe; tennexxee Yoonatani Anni isik Sa'ool Daawwiti'i shiyo'a mudhdhee ke'eexxa ege'ne. <verse eid="1SA 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Yoonataani anni isik Daawwiti'i salphisemmaxxee Daawitixxee yaadexxi qoree waale ke'e; ookkonee baate fuldammake ayyaani langa baro mitte itande hinaachcho itebaan. <verse eid="1SA 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Langa bara gorsa Yoonataani mitte shiixxoka belto adhdheexxi Daawwitinni welti afemo'a abixxinemmaxxe bakkaba'a me'e. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Beltokanna «Edi'a gongite me'ite darbataannexxa gabuwwa hasse ani'a iyye dagi» hiyye. Beltikinna gonga'ni Yoonatani beltokenaa'ni edi'a sa'isse mitte gabe darbate. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Iikki belti gabe ibbemmaxxa bakka geyee wodda Yoonataani «Gabe ibbe'eebi edi'anden!» <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Sammite ookko'o uurritoxxe! Rakke me'i! Hiyya'n beltoke'n cance; beltikinna gabuwwa adhdheexxi gootta ifike Yoonataanibaa hige. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Tinni yaane Yoonataani'aanna Daawwiti'a malee beltokee buqoxxemman. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Yoonataaninna belto ookkone «Anka lolinka miya aaxxe qachchi'a me'i» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Beltikinna ookkone me'eechchi uduma Daawwiti sho'omemmabaan, kinotixxe tuuloke bita'inaa'n fuleexxi Yoonatani edo sasele kumbuyye sagade; lamingi weli sunqe'na'n oonaa'mman; Yoonataninaa'n caala kinni oodhe'emmak Daawititemman. <verse eid="1SA 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Ookkonechchi uduma Yoonataani Daawwitii'i, « ‹Atixxe hortexxenna anxe hortexxe oddo'n Duuchchi Woddik Gootti duuchchi woddi'a dhugaate kaduun› he'nennexxi jaalooma no'oxxi jabaatashsha Mageniike summinni kakanteennaxxee yoona nage'iki me'i» hiyye. Daawwiti ke'e me'e; Yoonataninna qachchi'a hige.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Daawwiti Sa'ooli Edii'n Baqate Me'eexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />Daawwiti Noobi hiyyemaake boonchiba hedheeke qeesichcho Abemelekibaa me'e; qeesichchi Abemelekinna sodaate culphise Daawwiti'i qophedho'a fule mareexxi, «Mitti manjinna atixxa duuka hedhebangi qofitinni kaba'a daggetelchi mayeete?» hiyye qore.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:3-4">Mat. 12:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:25-26">Mar. 2:25-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:3">Luq. 6:3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Daawwitinna qeesichcho Abemeleki'n hiisse haaso'ee qici, «Kaba dagennelchi moyanji Sa'ooli Daawwiti'ni ergeexxe erganiten; tennee ergeme dagennexxa yaane ayye'inna haaso'abo'noshsha anee ajaje'een; anke lolinke manna'inna mitteba afemannoxxa bakka haasone'ennen. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Kaddanaa'nni ta'a ati maa affe'etelchi hedhee? Onde xalta yookaan affetengelcho ani'a uwwi.»<verse eid="1SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Qeesichchikinna, «Gargar foyemeeka woyyichcha xalta kadoole malee ardi itaaxxi kebbo hexxebaan; atik loliink manni shiqoxxe yanna'ni melaalet welti galebaake kadoole konne xaltanaani itaan» hiyye haaso'e.<verse eid="1SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Daawwitinna qeesichchoke'n, «Baratendeeshshanni ergemme fullannoxxa yanna duuchcha aninna anke loliinke manni'a melaalle lagantanon; heenooxxe erga kaddaa woddanna midde ank loliink manni qullichchaken; telchota edixxi caala qullomabaata?» hiyye hiisse. <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" />Qeesichchi Duuchchi Woddike Gootti edo eebbaka xalta uggiyyotee woyyichcha beernaa'n hoyye'emmaka xalta kadoole malee, weli xalti ookko hedha gopheemmaxxee ookkone gargar foyemeeka xalta Daawwiti'a aadhe uwwe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:5-9">Lew. 24:5-9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />Sa'oolixxe allalisanoke umo kadeek Eedoomichchi Dooyiqi, Duuchchi Woddika Gootta magenoonfantammaba okko'o afeme'eemman.<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Daawwitinna Abemelekii'i, «Moyanjiki ajaji ariifachchisaake kadeemmaxxee bagedo yookaan wele miya adheebo'no'n, bagedo yookaan wolaantichcho afeete?» Hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />Abemelekinna, «Ati Ellaxxe Dhooqa'n shilite'etake Filisixeemichcho Goliyaadiki wolaantichchi aniba hedheen; isinna Efuudeti udumi darre hedheen; adhanno hitaattole isoo adhdhi, kaba hedhdheeki lolinki miyyi isoni callan» hiyye. Daawwitinna isooni ani'aa uwwi isoo caalek wolaantichcha habanna afemabaan.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:51">1 Sam. 17:51</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />Daawwitinna Sa'ooli'i baqateexxi Akishi hine ye'naake Gaati moyanjibaa me'e. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" />Moyanjinki Jalqabuwwi, «Kunn bogiinke moyanjo Daawwititeba?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 21:11">« ‹Sa'ooli kuma shiyallo! Daawwiti kinni tomme kuma shiyallo!›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 21:11">hita'ni melaalle meelita'nemmak isotebaa?» hine Akishii'i lanqe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:7">1 Sam. 18:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 29:5">29:5</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />Daawwitinna haaso'a insa'neeka godoba abixxeexxi Akishiininna jaba qico sodaate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 56">Far. 56</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" />Tennexxe Daawwiti insa'ne edo ifi qalbe sa'eeke manjishsha asseexxi hulatika cufana hoqooqa'n areedakenaa'n gorori yaa'aashsha asse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34">Far. 34</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Akishiininna jalqabuwwa ifikee hiyyee qici, «Kunni manjichchi marataken! Anibaa isoo mayee idagine. <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Ani marata afa gopheennexeete? Kunni manjichchi iitta kado'a anibaa iyyedagineechi? Iitta hedheeka manjo aniba iyyedaginagee?» Hiyye qore.<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Daawwiti Aduulamikenna Mitsiphphake Qachcha'ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />Daawwiti Gaatike qachchanaa'n baqatee Adulaamike qachchi bira hexxeexxe wolo'obaa'a me'e; Dayyuwwi isikinna weli mini hadi isik duuchchi tenne laqqeexxi isi hedheeba marreexxi ofolle.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 57">Far. 57</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Rakkatekiir, liqa afemmakiiri, iittanni hedho qararteeki duuchchir isiba'a me'aammaxxe'e manjiink laakkossi mitteba shoole dhibba geye; Daawwitinna insa'neeke akeekisanjo kade.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Daawwitinna ookko'n ke'exxi Mo'aabi bogi giddo hedheeke Misiphphake qachchibaa me'e; Mo'abik moyanjinna, «Mageni ani'a assaaxxa yaane uudanno qico'n anni anikinna ama anxi atiba'a dange he'no'a eeti ani'a uwwi» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Konne qicinni hado ifika Mo'aabike moyanjibaa iyyemare ugge; insa'nenna Daawwiti gongomake'ni sho'oma'n hedhemmake baro duuchcha'n moyanjik welti turre.<verse eid="1SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma wabeek Gaadi Daawwitibaa marrexxi, «Kaba turtoxxe'e, ta'anni rakkee Yihudake bogibaa me'i» hiyye kule. Tennexxee Daawwiti ookkoo'n ke'eexxi Heereetike gongomibaa me'e.<verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sa'ooli Qeese Shiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Barratixxa barra Sa'ooli bagedo angate'n abixxeeshanni, Gibi'a giddo hedheeke tullichchi hana Tamarisiki hiyyemaake haqichchi hunda ofo'leemman. Ja'laabuwwi isikinna isi bira uurremmani. Eettene yanna Daawwitinna isinni welti hedhemmak manni mitte bakka'n hedheexxa Sa'ooli'n kulle. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Sa'oolinna ja'laabuwwa ifika hiyyee qici, «Ha'no koo Biiniyamike manna ani hiyyannexxa laqqe! Dhugaandinni Isseyik belti Daawwiti ha'no mitte mittengee hucitinaka fichchanna woyyinetike hiddichchika boga ha'no'a uwwangee? Ifike lolinke mannike kuma ajajalluwwanna dhibba ajajalluwwa assedho'a isi ha'no'o hariira'neechcho labbee'e? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Ane'nita qophphi hitine kexxinechchi tennexxeetee? Ank belti Isseyike beltinni welti kako aageexxa ha'no giddii'n mittikinna midde ane'n kuleek hedhebaan. Ani'a quuqemeek haranga mittikinna hedhebaan. Telchixxa telchonna assa'neshshann ank erganji anee gaado'a ank belti isoo ane'n ke'isiiseexxa ha'no giddi'n ayyinna ane'n kuleek hedhebaa.»<verse eid="1SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />Eettene yanna Sa'oolik ja'laabuwwinni welti ookko uurre'emmak Dooyiqi Eedoomichchi hiyyee qici: «Ani Isseyik belti Noobike qachcha'ni hedheeke Abemelekii'i Ahixuubikibaa daga'naa afeennen. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Daawwitinna maa assaxxa Abeemeleki isixxee Duuchchi Woddika Gootta laqeen; ookkoneechchi uduma Daawwiti'a gala'atanna Goliyaadi'ii Filisixeemichchiinka wolaantichcha uwween» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:7-9">1 Sam. 21:7-9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 52">Far. 52</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Ookkoneechchi uduma moyanji Sa'ooli qeesichcho Abemelek Ahixuubike'ninna Noobi hiyyemaake qachchiba hedheke qeesichchiinke annike mini hado duuchcha'ni erga dhaame'na insa'nenna dange. <verse eid="1SA 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Sa'oolinna Abemeleki'i, «Ahixuubike beltoo! Yoona laqi» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:12">Abemelekinna «Ishshi anke gootta!» Hiyye hiisse.<verse eid="1SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Sa'oolinna, «Atinna Isseyik belti ane'n kexxinechchi maye'ate? Ati Isi'a gala'atanna wolaantichcha uuteten; isixxee Magenokanna laqqetten; isi ta'a ane'n naapha kade ke'ee ane'e shiyo'a isi'a eldaaxxa yanna halsate'ni hedheen» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Abemelekinna moyanjokee hiyyee qici, «Daawwiti atike lolike mannike addatemeeke ja'laaban; atixxa belto aadheeke atinge ballonna atee heqqaammake lolinke mannike ajajallon; atike mootumatike mini giddo isishsha ulfateeki ayyete hedhe? <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Dhugaandinni ani Mageno isixxee laqe'ennek ani'a tinni siretixxe yannabaan! Moyanjo! Anee erganjo atika yookaan annke anika mini haddo tenne yaannexxee no'oo komatoxxee, tenne yaane ani mitteelchonna ege'nennelchchi hedhebaan.»<verse eid="1SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Moyanjikinna, «Koo Abemelek! Atinna atike anniki mini hadi duuchchi shiyendinaan!» Hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'ooli isi bira uurremmake heqqanjuwwa'n; «Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxe qeesolexxi anga Daawwitinni welti hexxeemmaxxee. Ittanni yaane duuchcha ege'na'inni he'neexxi Daawwiti baqate me'eexxa midde ane'n kullebaan» hiyye. Heqqalluwwi kinni, «Mageniinxa qeese shinnabe'non» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Tennexxe Sa'oli Dooyiqi'i «Atinni insa'ne shiyi!» Hiyye. Dooyiqii Eedoomichchikinna ke'eexxi duuchchinga shiyye; ettene barra'ni bireexxi efuude odo'witaammaxxe qeesoleki laakkossi saddeeta tommenna ondekemmani. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'ooli Noobi'i qeesetike qachchi giddo hedhammaka duuchcha labballokanna melaalle, oosetanna ununixxa annuwwa, laluwwakanna harruwwa iittan gedhebuwwi duuchchi shiyemaashsha asse.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Yaane kinni Abemelekixxe labbaxxe oosenaa'n Abiyataar hiyyemaak mitti belti calli baaje fuleexxi Daawwitibaa me'e. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Isinna Sa'ooli Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa qeese bireexxa Daawwiti'n kule. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Daawwitinna Abiyataarii'i hiyyee qici: «Eettene barra ani Dooyiqi'i Eedoomichchi ookko hedhee'na uudenne wodda duuchchinxa yaane Sa'ooli'n kulaan hiyyeennan. Tennexxe mudeeke atike annike mini hadi duuchchi'a buuto kadeennek anten. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Ati kinni aninni welti hedhi; iittanna sodaattoxxee; Sa'ooli atee shiyo'a hasa'nemmashaann aneenna shiyo'a hasa'neen. Yaane kinni aninni welti nage'ik hexxatton.»<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Daawwiti Qi'iilaka Qachcha Anjireexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Filisixeemik manni Qe'iilaka qachcha loleexxi oodde giddi'n midha saame adhdheexxa Daawwiti laqe. <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Tennexxe Daawwiti Duuchchi Woddika Gootta, «Filisixxeemika manna mare loloo?» Hiyye Mageno laqe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:2">Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna «Eetti! Filisixxeemika manna loldee Qe'iilaka qachcha anjiri» hiyye haaso'e.<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Yaane kinni Daawwitinni hedhemmak manni, «Kaba Yihudake boga'n he'nanno woddanni sodaanta'ennen; ta'ata Qe'iila'aa me'ine Filisixxeemika lolinka manna lollonnolefa'i caala shoonkannon» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Tennenaa'n kexxeexxa Daawwiti higgeeni Duuchchi Woddika Gootta laqe; Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna, «Ani Filisixxeemika manna anga atixxe'n sa'isse uwwaannaxxee martettexxi Qe'iilaka qachcha loli» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Tennexxe Daawwitinna isinni welti hedhemmak manni Qe'iila marreexxi Filisixxeemika manna lolle miine; insa'ne giddi'inna heddo manna shinneexxi lalokanna gedhebo insa'neeka boojine adhdhine; konneqicini Daawwiti Qi'iilake qachchika arda anjire.<verse eid="1SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />Abemelek belti Abiyataari Daawwitbaa Qe'iila'a baaje me'ee wodda Efuudii'i adhdhe me'emman.<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Sa'ooli, Daawwiti Qe'iila hinaaba dageexxa laqeexxi, «Daawwiti, qachcha dalla'i kinjik ijaaremeeke hulatinna sibilike danqaresanjinni e'yate hiyyo anga ifixxa fonxoro giddo ifi usuratishshate kaddeemmaxxee Mageni isoo anga anxe'n sa'isse uwwo'aten» Sa'ooli hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Tennexxe Sa'ooli ifika lolinka manna ye'eexxi Qe'iilake qachcha'ni duulexxi Daawwitinna isinni welti hedhemmaka manna oddote'n bunqaashsha ajaje.<verse eid="1SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />Daawwitinna Sa'ooli iso'ni fuggoxxa hedeexxa laqeexxi qeesichcho Abiyataarii'i, «Efuude kaba'a iyyedagi!» Hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Daawwiti hiyye soodatee qici, «Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Isira'eelike Magenoo! Anee atike erganjixxe buuto'a Sa'ooli dageexxi Qe'iilaka qachcha balleesso'a mudhdheexxa laqeennen. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Iitta kaddoole Qe'iilake qachchik manni anee Sa'oolixxe anga'n sa'isse uwwaaxxi hexxee? Laqenneshshann Sa'ooli kabaa daga'neexxi dhugande? Koo Duuchchi Woddike Gootta Isira'eelike Magenoo! Ane atike garbichchi'a hiissichcho uutota'a atee soodata'ennen!» Hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:11">Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna «Eetti Sa'oolixxi daga dhugaaten» hiyye haaso'e.<verse eid="1SA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Daawwitinna higgenna, «Qe'iilake qachchiki manni aneenna aninni welti dheeka manna Sa'oolixxe anga'n sa'isse'e uwwaa?» Hiyye soodate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:12">Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna, «Eetti ha'noo sa'issine'e unaan» hiyye hiisse.<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Tennexxe Daawwitinna isinni welt hedhemmak jaane dhibba kadaak manni Qe'iilake qachchinaa'n fulleexxi, mitte boonchibaa wele boonchibaa me'inaamman. Sa'oolinna Daawwiti Aqiilaa'ni baaje me'eexxa laqeexxa yanna Aqiila'a dagaammaxxa waale.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawwiti Koobuwwatike Boga'n Hedhemma qico</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Daawwiti Ziifixxe qilla gammoojje bira hedheeke kooba callike boga'n wolo'oti giddo hedha'emman. Sa'ooli iso'a afo'a duuchhci wodda hasa'emman; yaane kinni Mageni Daawwiti'i Sa'oolixxe anga'n sa'isse uwwebaan; <verse eid="1SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Daawwitinna Sa'ooli isoo shiyo'a daga'neexxa ege'ne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:15">Daawwiti Ziifi bira hexxeexxe qiilla gammoojje bogi giddo Horeeshi hiyyemaaba hedhemman. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Sa'oolik belti Yoonataani Daawwiti hedheemmabaa Horeeshi mareexxi addete'ni jabaataashsha Mageniinke summinni jajjabeessa'ni, <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />«Sodaattoxxe anni ankixxi Sa'oolixxi anga ate'e tuqqabaan, ati Isira'eelike moyanjo kaddee'naa ani ate'ni aanee langake kadannoxxa tennee anni anki Sa'ooli midde ege'ne'een.» <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" />Tennexxe lamingi Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summinni jaalummati weli aange; ookkoneechchi uduma Daawwiti ookko Horeeshi ofo'le. Yoonataaninna ifike minibaa illee iima hige me'e.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:3">1 Sam. 18:3</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />Ziifike qachchike manninaa'n kadeek manni Sa'ooli hedheeba Gibi'a mare iso'o'n hiyyee qici, «Daawwiti no'oke bogi giddo Yihudixxe qiilla gammoojjenaa'n bita'i darre'n hexxeexxe Hakkilaxxe kooba hana Horeeshixxe wolo'o giddo sho'omee hedheen. <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />Koo moyanjo, ati eetettexxe yanna'n dagan calla dagi no'o iso'o atee moynjixxe anga'n sa'issine uunannon.»<verse eid="1SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Sa'oolinna insa'ne'aa hiyye hiisee qici, «Ani'a quuqendineexxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ha'noo eebbiso'o! <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Ta'anna higgeenna martine'e kokke; haba hedha'neexxanna Daawwiti ayyi ookko afeexxanna wo'me; isi yo'oshsha qaarontichchake kadeexxa laqe'eennen. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Isi sho'omaaba duuchchara hubattine affe; ca'ite odo aaxxineexxi aniba'a illee iima higge; ookkonechchin uduma aninna ha'noonni welti me'annon; ookkone loola'n hedheexxe kaddoole Yihudake bogi duuchchi giddo file findige e'yeexxe bale giddo eyee isoo fulchannon.»<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Tennexxe insa'ne Sa'ooli'a me'atee ke'ebaa edi darre Ziifi'a illee iima hinge; eettene yanna Daawwiti ifike loliinke manninni welti Yihudixxe qiilla gammoojjenaa'n bita'i darre'n Areba giddo hexxeexxe Ma'oonixxe qiilla gammoojje giddo hedhemman. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Sa'oolinna isiki loliinki manni Daawwiti'i shorratee ke'ne fule me'ine; Daawwitinna tenne laqemmaxxee Ma'oonixxe qiilla gammoojje'n kino bira sa'eeke mitte tullichcha'n ofo'le; Sa'oolinna tenne laqeexxi Daawwiti'i shorrishate'ni ke'e. <verse eid="1SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Sa'oolinna isiki loliinki manni ookkone tulchibaa'ni mitte darre'n me'inee wodda, Daawwitinna isiki loliink manni tullichchii darree'n. Sa'ooli'ninna isik loliinki manni Daawwitinna ifika loliinka manna bunqeemmaxxee, Daawiti Sa'ooli edii'ni baajate'ni hedhemman. <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />Ergemeek Sa'ooli'i, «Filisixeemito arda lolate'ni hexxeemmaxxee ta'a tennee illee iima higge dagi!» Hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Tennexxe Sa'ooli Daawwiti'i shorra waaleexxi Filisixxeemika manna lolo'a illee iima wirri hiyye hige. Tennexxeetemmanni eettene bakkaki summi «Gargar higati kinjo» hiyyemeeki. <verse eid="1SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 23:29" />Daawwitinna ookko'n ke'eexxi sho'ome hedhemmaba Eenigaadi hiyyemaaba'a me'e.<verse eid="1SA 23:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Daawwiti Sa'oolixxa Lubbo Gatise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Sa'ooli Filisixxeemika manna lolee higeechchi uduma Daawwiti Eenigaadi qiilla gammoojje'n hedheexxa laqe. <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Tennexxe Sa'ooli Isira'eeli giddii'n sase kuma fiifina kadeeka lolinka manna adheexxi, «Qiilla gammoojjexxe gadhixxe re'exxe kino» hinaaba boroti darre'n Daawwiti'i shorre abido'a mare. <verse eid="1SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Orinii qarqara gedhebinke dalla'i bira hexxeexxe wolo'obaa'a foole'akee'e e'ye. Ookkonna isi ofo'lemmabaa'n giddi darre'n Daawwitinna isinni welti hedhemmaki manni sho'omme he'nemmake boonchommani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 57">Far. 57</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 142">Far. 142</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />Mannikinna Daawwit'i «ati'a middite eldeen! Kunni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti, naapha atika anga atixxe'n sa'isse uwwannon hiyye ate'ni kulemmaxxe barran; ta'a yooni naapha atike'n hassettexxa assa dandeetatton» iso'n hine. Daawwitinna boxxa'ni isiba shiqeexxi Sa'ooli afebaangi seemmatike kasanaa'n woxee adhdhe. <verse eid="1SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Daawwiti Sa'oolixxe seemmaka kasa woxemmaxxee qalbe isixxi yo'oshsha yaade. <verse eid="1SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Isinna isixxa duuka me'ammake manni'a, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hariire moyanjoke asseeke anke gootta'n elobaaxxa assabe'noshsha Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti anga anxa abidoo! Isi Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti fi'leeke moyanjo kadeemmaxxee ani iso'n fuggoxxa assa ani'a hasissabaan!» Insa'nee hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 26:11">1 Sam. 26:11</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Tennexxe Daawwiti konne hiyyichchinni Sa'ooli'n fuggoxxa assinabaasha isixxa duuka me'ammaka manna hoyye. Sa'oolinna wolo'o giddii'n ke'e fule me'e.<verse eid="1SA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Daawwitinna gongomi giddi'n fuleexxi Sa'ooli hordofe ye'eexxi «Anke gootta moyanjo!» Hiyye. Sa'oolinna udumi'a wirri hiyye eriqe kayya uudee wodda Daawwiti albi buttina tuqaa qico'n heeshshi hiyyeexxi anga iimi'a ke'isse; <verse eid="1SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Daawwitinna Sa'oolii'i hiyyee qici, «Ani ate'n fuggoxxa assona'a hasaanneesha asse manni ate'n haaso'a'neeka haaso'a mayee laqqaate? <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Techcho wolo'oti giddo hexxeenaa Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atee anga anxe'n sa'isse uwwemmaxxa uushsho dandeetatton. Mitti mitti aninni hedhemmaki manninna ani atee shiyonnaa anee tiritirseemman. Yaane kinni ati Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti hariireke moyanjo kaddeettaxxee ani anke gootta'ni anga anxa ke'issabe'non hiyyee ati'a marareenneni. <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Anke anna! Seemma atixxenaa'n woxee aadhennexxa uudi! Atee shiya dande'annan; yaane kinni atee shiyannaxxa bakka seemma atixxike kassanaa'n woxedhe aadhennen. Ani ate'n jallate yookaan ate'n elobaaxxa assa hasebe'noxxa tennenninni ege'na dandeetatton; ati kinni telchonna atee balleessebe'nongi anee shiltotta'a shorritaaten. <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />Yooni Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atixxenna anixe oddo'n balleessanji ayyete kadeexxa foye murowwaali! Ani ate'n elobaaxxa assatee hasebe'nongi ane'n assitaattexxe elobaaxxe yaane duuchchi'a Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti halo fulowwaal. <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Fuggoxxa yaane hujjaaxxi fuggaaleyye callan, hiyyaaka edike manna no'okika hiyyichcho atinni egendeeten; tennexxee ani ate'n anga anxa ke'issabe'non.<verse eid="1SA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />«Isira'eeliki moyanji ayyee shilltotaa wo'landaatexxa uudi! Ayyee shorritatexxa kassi hiyyi! Anee reyeke wolchishsha yookaan taffetishsha hedhenenge shorritato?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 26:20">1 Sam. 26:20</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti no'o lamenaa'ni balleessanji ayyete kadeexxa murowwaal. Isi tenne yaane uude ani'a baasee anga atixxenaa'n anee anjirowwaal.»<verse eid="1SA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Daawwitinna haaso'a bireechchinni uduma Sa'oolinna, «Anke belto Daawwiti! Dhugaanda kunni hafuuri atinge?» Hiyye oodhe. <verse eid="1SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Daawwiti'i hiyyee qici, «Ati Daawwiiti dhugaatike manjoni! Ani kinni ballesanjoken; ani ati'a elobaaxxa assenne wodda ati ani'a eloxxa assitetten! <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti anga atixxe'n anee sa'isse uwweemman; ati kinni anee shiltebexxon; ani'a eloxxa assitaateke kaddetexxa telcho ege'nishsheeten. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />Naapha ifika anga ibirse fuggoxxa assebaaki walaaki manji haba afema? Telcho ani'a assitettexxe eloxxe yaane'a Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ati'a elo! <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Ati Isira'eelike moyanjo kaddattoxxanna Isira'eelixxi moottumma atixxe galcha'n jabaate hexxaaxxa telcho kokeennen. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Yoona anki summinna anke mini hadike summixxi booso baxxe dedhedaabaashsha assite sanne anxanna anke annika mini hado yo'oxxenaa'n gatisattoshsha Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summinni ani'a kakatimee.» <verse eid="1SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Daawwitinna Sa'ooli'a fuggoxxa assabe'noni hiyye kakate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 24:22">Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'ooli mini ifikiba'a me'e; Daawwitinna isixxa duuka me'ammaki mann wolo'otiba'a hinge me'ine.<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Saamu'eelixxa Reyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Saamu'eeli reye, Isira'eeliki ardi duuchchi mitteba bukki hiyye oodhe; okkonechchi uduma Raama mini isingi giddo moonge.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:1">Ookkoneechchi uduma Daawwiti Faaraanixxe qiilla gammoojjebaa me'e.<verse eid="1SA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daawwiti Naabaliinna Abigeeli'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />Ma'ooni offo'leeke mitti manji hedhemman; isinna karra Qerimelosi'i afe'emma'a; isinna sase kuma gedhebonna mitte kuma re'e afeeke yo'ooke dureesamman; Qermeloosike boncho'ninna gedhebo ifikixxa orida cira'emman. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Ookkone manjichik summinna Naabaali, are isixxikinna Abigeeltemman; isenna danchitettenna qalbeeffachcho afeexxe kaddaa wodda isi kinni adaba afebaake fuggoke manjomman; Isinna Kaaleebixxe gosake manjomman. <verse eid="1SA 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Daawwitinna qiila gammoojje'ninni hedhee Naabaali gedhebiinxa orda woxa'neexxa laqe. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Tennexxe isinna tomme dargageeyye fileexxi Qermeloosi martine'e Naabaali'n nage'a ankanna kulle. <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />Martine hitinaa qici, «Anke jaalo! Ati nage'ange, hori manji atiki duuchchi nage'ange? Hiyya'neenni hitine kulle. <verse eid="1SA 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />Atike gedhebixxa orida woxissaattexxa laqeennen; allalisano atixxi gedhebo atika allalida'n no'o bira hexxemma wodda duuchcha no'o insa'nee tunqebe'non; Qermeloosi he'nemma woddanna gedhebokenaa'n mittekanna midde adhdhinebe'non. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Allalisano atixxa laqqottolena insa'ne ati'n kullaan; kunni no'onna telcho gammashshotixxa jila jildaatexxe barra'n dangennen; no'onna elo qicinni adhdhite keessunsexxattoshsha hiyya'neenni atee Daawwiti; tennexxe no'oo atixxe ergatemeeyye'anna atike jaali'a Daawwiti'a hitee afetelchcho no'o'a uwwi» hine.<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Daawwiti ergedhdhemmaki manninna Daawwiti kullemmashshanni Naabaali'n kulleexxi sammi hine ofoolle heqe'ne. <verse eid="1SA 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Naabaalinna Daawwiti ergemmake manni'a hiyyee qici, «Isi kunni Daawwiti ayyete? Isi Isseyik belti ayyete? Ani isoo ege'nebe'non! Kunni ta'a goottoletee ajajema gibe baqateexxi garboole boga duuchcha'n wo'mite'een! <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Tennexxe waasa ankanna wodde'e anka iittaanni gedhdhebi ankixxa orda woxxammake manni'a dulenneke lalinka maala habaa'n dageexxa ege'nebe'noke manni'a uwwaabe'non!» Hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Daawwiti ergemmaki manni wirri hiyye higeexxi Naabaali hiyyeexxa duuchcha mitte mitteti kulle. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Daawwitinna isinni welti hedhemmaka manna, «Wolaantichcha ha'nooka ka'litine ke'we!» hiyye ajaaje. Insa'nenna ka'line ke'ne; Daawwitinna wolaantichcha ka'le; miya heqaaka lame dhibba manna ookkonni waaleexxi shoole dhibba manna adhdhexxi me'e. <verse eid="1SA 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Naabaali ergatammaxxe ergatameeyyenaa'n mitti Naabalixxe are'ni Abigeeli'n hiyyee qici, «Daawwiti qiilla gammoojje'ninni hedhdhe gootta no'oka nage'inginni hexxete hiyye erga ergeemman; isi kinni insa'nee yowee salphiseen. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Insa'ne kinni no'o'a eloxxe asseeke mannamman. Insa'ne mitte rakkonna no'o'n geessinsemmabaan; insa'nenni welti badda'ate'n he'nenna wodda duuchcha hore no'okenaa'ni mittikinna midde moorememmabaan. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Hore no'oka alla'lina'n insa'nenni welti he'nenna wodda barranna kadi hashsha duuchchi wodda insa'ne no'o'o heqqina'nemman. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Maganneten tenne yaane heddee ati assiyyo hasissaaxxa yaane mudhdhi; iitta kada gophphoole gootta no'oke'ninna isike mini hado duuchcha'n elobaaxxi gelto'aten; isotenna kadoole ayyika gorsa laqabaake woyi fulabaake manjon!» Hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Abigeelinna rakkeexxi lame dhibba wodhamo, lame qalqallo'ni woyineti bulbulo wonshite, onde gedhebika dudhinsheeka maala, tommenna torbaane kiilo anneeka tisha, mitte dhibba woyinetixxe gummaxxa roddenna lame dhibba balasetixxe gummaxxa kebbo mitteba bukki assiteexxi harruwwate'ni feete. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Ookkoneechchi uduma erganjuwwa isekee, «Ha'no edi'a me'ee; aninna duuka ha'nooxxe'n hedhennen» insa'nee hite. Yaane kinni aro'o ifike Naabaali'n kuldeemmabaan.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Isenna harichcho gulufeexxi tullichchinii qarqarika adaddeeshumma me'a'neeka ora me'ita'n dedhanga Daawwitinna isiki mann iseba'a adadde danga'naa futti hite. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Daawwitinna godobi giddo hiyya'n hedaamma qici, «Ookkone woyi fulabaake manjixxa karra tenne qiilla gammoojje'n mayee heqqa'n turene? Isixxe karranaa'n mittilchinna mooreme ege'nebaan. Yooni ani isi'a eloxxa asseneexxee isi ani'a elobaaxxa asse! <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Soodo bariisa isixxa labbaxxa oose duuchcha mittetanna gatisebo'nogi shiye bira gophonnoole Mageni ane'e shiyo!» Hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Abigeelinna Daawwiti afeexxi rakkee harrichotenaa'n dirriteexxi Daawwit edo albike butta wabbi hiteexxi anga iimi'a ke'issite. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Lekka isixxe'n ibbeexxi hittee qici, «Anke gootta! Magannetenni ani attixxi erganjo hiyyannexxa laqi! Balleessa ane'ninni woxxi. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />Anke gootta ookkone gowwi manjika Naabaalika haaso'a mittelchishshanna laakkootoxxee; summi isingi gowwaake hiyyote kadeemmaxxee manjichchikinna summi isikishshanden; gowwumma isixxinni hundii'ninni dagggeexxen. Erganjuwwi atiki dagemma wodda ani hedhenabaan.<verse eid="1SA 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />«Haloti kexxee naapha atika shiltabexxoshsha anga atixxa abideeki Duuchchi Woddike Goottan; kunni ani duuchchi wodda hedhaake Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxanna atixxe hedhoxxa; naaphi atikinna ate'n fuggoxxa asso'a hasaaki duuchchi Naabaalishsha xixichcho adhdhinaan. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />Anke gootta! Maganneten ani erganjo atixxi ati'a iyyedageennexxa uwwa adhdhitee erganjuwwa atikee uwwi. <verse eid="1SA 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />Anke gootta ati Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a lolda'n hexxeten; hexxattoke baro duuchcha'n mittelchonna fuggoxxa yaane hasa gophphaattaxxee balleessennexxe ballessa'a magannetenni ani'a gattowwaali hiyy; Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti duuchchi wodda mootattoshsha assaan. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Fedheeki manji ate'n fuggoxxa asso'a hasoole manji eloka hira fulchitaaxxa karra ifixxa heqqedhammashsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Mageni atee heqqaan; naaphuwwi atikixxeenna kaddoole mitti manji kinjo looyyati darbatammashsha Mageni naapha atika hunaan. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ati'a assannon hiyyemmashshan, eloxxa calla ati'a assee Isira'eelike moyanjo assaa wodda, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />Mittilchi yaadisaachchi yookaan godobi atiki giddo qurruxi hinaageechchi hedhaabaan. Anke gootta, tolanga yookaan halo fuldotaa'a hitee shiltetteki manji hedhebaan; tennexxee anke gootta, Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ati'a eloxxa bira sa'isaa wodda aneenna deetoxxe'e» hite.<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Daawwitinna isee hiyyee qici, «Aninni welti afendatoshsha atee aniba'a ergeeki Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Isira'eeliki Mageni saademowwaal! <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Telchixxe barra'n halo fulatee hiyye munde dunabo'noshsha asseeki elooki yaadi atiki eebbisemo'o; teeyyoo atinna eebbisemi. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Ate'n fuggoxxa assabo'noshsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti anee hoyyeen; rakkee anibaa daga gophpheetele kinni, Naabaalixxa labbaxxa oose duuchcha mittetanna gatisebo'nongi bogi soodebangi shiye bironna'a hedhaake Isira'eelike Magenike summinni kakateennan.» <verse eid="1SA 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Okkonechchi uduma Daawwiti isi'a iyyedaggemmalcho adhdheexxi hiyyee qici, «Mini atikibaa nage'iki higge me'i; hitettexxa laqeennen; ati hassettexxa duuchcha ati'a assannon» isee hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Abigeelinna Naabaalibaa higge dagee wodda moyatike minixe jilashsha gargariti hexxeexxa ita qophpheesedheexxi yo'oshsha machcho'e gammada'n utaala'nemman tennexxee bogi soodaqico'ni mittelchonna isi'a haasotebaan. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Ookkoneechchi uduma gorsanni Naabaali machche balleeffateechchi uduma duuchchinxa yaane isi'a haasote; isinna alayye qexxeri hiyye kinjinsha bage gate. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti Naabaalii'i mufeti ganemmaxxee tomme barra uduma isi reye.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Daawwitinna Naabaali reyeexxa laqeexxi, «Naabali anee yowweemmaxxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti iso'ni halo fule aneenna erganjo isika dedhakenaa'n heqqeemmaxxee, Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti saademowwaal. Isi Naabali'i isixxe fuggoxxe huje'a xixeeni» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:39">Ookkoneechchi uduma Daawwiti Abigeeli aadho'a hasa'neexxa kulo'a manjo ise'ni erge. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Erganjuwwi isikinna Qermeloosi Abigeeliba mareexxii, «Daawwiti atee aadho'a hasemmaxxee atiba'a no'o ergammale isibaa atee adhdhine me'inonna'a dangeennen» isee hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Abigeelinna buttinake'n albiki gonbisende anga iimi'a ke'isitee, «Ani anke goottixxe erganjon, anke goottike erganjuwwixxa lekka anshatee qophpheffateennen» hite. <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Isenna rakke harricho gulufeexxi onde ise'a hujammaxxa garboole adhdhiteexxi Daawwitike erganjuwwinni welti me'ite Daawwiti'ni heerunde.<verse eid="1SA 25:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Daawwiti edi darre Iyyizira'eelixxe sanne kadeexxa Ahino'aamii'i aadheemman; ta'anna kinni lebbeexxi Abigeeli'i aadhe. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Sa'ooli belto ifixxa Daawwiti aadhemmaxxa Melkoolii'i Gaalimi ilemeeka Leessake belto Feeliixi'n heerunsiiseemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:14-26">2 Sam. 3:14-26</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Daawwiti Higgeenna Sa'ooli'i Shiyya Waaleexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />Ziifike qachchik manni Sa'ooli hedheeba Gibi'a mareexxi, «Daawwiti Yihudinxe qiilla gammoojje albi edi darre Hakkila hiyyemaake tullichcha'ni sho'ome hedheen» hiyya'n iso'ni kulle.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 54">Far. 54</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Sa'oolinna rake ke'eexxi Isira'eeli giddo fiifinake kadeeka sase kuma loliinka manna adheexxxi Daawwitika hasito Ziifixxe qiilla gammoojjeba'a me'e. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Sa'ooli Hakkilake tulchinaa'n sa'aneeke ori bira, Heeshimoona edi darre ofo'le; Daawwiti kinni qiilla gammoojje'n hedhemmani. Sa'ooli isika hasito dageexxa afeexxi, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />dooyyaaka manna ergeexxi Sa'oolixxi ookko daga dhugaate kaddeexxa ege'ne. <verse eid="1SA 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Ookkoneechchi uduma rake ke'e mareexxi, Sa'oolinna isike lolinke mannik ajajalli Nerik belti Abeneer diipheemmaxxa bakka afe. Sa'oolinna loliink manni bakka abixeexxe oddo'n diiphee'naa isik loliinki manni kinni qarqara isike'n qececeemman.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Daawwiti Hiitichcho Abemelekinna Tsuriya ildeexxe oosenaa'n Iyyo'abika dayyo Abisaanii'i, «Ha'no lami giddii'ni aninni welti Sa'oolixxe kaambeba maraaki ayyete?» hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">Abishayinna, «Ani marannon» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="1SA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Tennexxe eettene hashsha'ni Daawwitinna Abisaani Sa'oolik loliinki manni hedhemmaba marre e'yine; Sa'oolinna loliinke mannixxe oddo'n diiphee'na'a anfe, bagedokanna umiinbaa'n butta olteemman. Abeneerinna loliinki manni isike qarqara'n diinpheemman. <verse eid="1SA 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Abisaaninna Daawwitii'i, «Mageni tenne hashshaa'n naapha atika anga atixxe'n sa'isse uwwe'een; langasebo'nog mitte ochchi callinni isoo buttinki buttinake assoo!» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Daawwiti kinni Abisaani'n hiyye hiisse haaso'ee qici, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hariiree moyashsha asseeka anga sa'aaka Mageni umo ifingenninni isoo xixaan, waali isoo shiltoxxee. <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Hedhaake Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa; umo isingenninni Duuchchi Woddik Goottinni Sa'ooli qoomaan; yookaan reyammaxxi barra geltee'naa, yookaan bagedoke'n reyaan. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti hariire moyaashsha asseeka moyanjo anga sa'a anenaa'n bayyato'o! Yaane kinni umo isikiba hedheeka isika bagedonna wode'iinxa isixxa baarre adhine me'ino» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 24:6">1 Sam. 24:6</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Tennexxe Daawwiti bagedokanna wodeiinxa baarre Sa'oolike umibaa'n aadhee'na'a isinna Abisa ookko'n me'ine; Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'ne diinphe cokooki hinaashsha assemmaxxee, tinni duuchchi kaddaa woodda mittikinna dammaqe afeeki yookaan ege'neeki hedhemmabaani.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Daawwiti dhooqati wido hedheeke boonchibaa foofee; insa'nenaa'inna bayyateexxi koobati hana uurre. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Daawwitii Sa'oolike loliinke mannibaa hafuura gikki asseexxi «koo Abiner hee hitabexxo?» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:14">Abeneerinna, «Moyaanjoke'n taaqqi hitaa'ettek ati ayyete?» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Daawwitinna hiyyee qici: «Koo Abeneer! Ati Isira'eeli'ni ege'nendeeteke lumooke manjoba? Hittata moyanjo atika gootta adda heqitabexxochchi? No'oo giddi'n mitti manji atika gootta shiyyo'a ha'noba dageemman. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Tinni ati assitettexxi yaane eloxxebaan; koo Abeneer, hedhaake Duuchchi Woddike Goottixxa! Mageni hariirexxi moyaashsha asseeka moyanjo, ha'nooka gootta dandeetinee heqqa gophphineemmaxxe'e ha'noo duuchchiinge hasisaachchi shiyyematen! Umiiba hedhemmaka isika bagedonna wode'e ikkilamaxxi baarre ta'a haba hexxe? Mee qarqara atike'n uudi» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Sa'oolinna Daawwitike haaso'a kadeexxa ege'nemmaxxe'e, «Anke belto! Kunni haasota'etek atende?» hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:17">Daawwitinna, «Eetti anke gootta! Anenden hiyye hiisse haaso'e» <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Ookko iimanni lebeexxi, «anke gootta anee atika erganjo mayyeta shorritaatyota? Maa balleessenne? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Moyaanjoo! Magannete'n ani haaso'aannexxa laqi! Ati ane'n kexxattoshsha asseeki Duuchchi Woddike Gootta kado'oole, tolcha shiqishiyyoti araarsedha dandeesissaan; yaane kinni manji tennee asso'oole martee wele magenuwwa magenofati hiyyatishsha Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ani'a uwwemmake geeginaa'n anee shorrinemmaxxee Duuchchi Woddik Gootti insa'nee uudo. <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Duuchchi Woddike Goottinaa'n bayyatennexxi annafee boga'n ani shiyyemannoshsha assitoxxee. Ati Isira'eeliki lummoki moyaanji badda'a giddo goroorre adamammake manjishsha anee taffetenaa'n woyyo'abe'noka manjo mayee shorritatto?» <verse eid="1SA 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Sa'oolinna, «Anke belto Daawwiti! Balleesseenne; illee iima higee anibaa amo; ta'ann elqa ate'n fuggoxxen ke'abe'non; yebeno hashsha lubbo anxee mararte'eten; gowwummati ani konnete hiyyemabaake dedha huje'ennen» hiyye hiisse haaso'e.<verse eid="1SA 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Daawwitinna hiyye haaso'e hiissee qici, «Moyaanjo! Bagedi atik kaba hedheen dageexxi adhdhowaal mitte manjo atike lolinke manninaa'n ergi. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />Mitte mittengi hujeexxe eloxxe hujeka hira uwwaak Duuchchi Woddik Goottaan; atee Duuchchi Woddike Gootti anga anxe'n sa'isse uwwe'naa'n ani kinni atee anga sa'a gibennen. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Telcho atixxi lubbo ani eddo lomoka ulfinna alfitemmashshan anxi lubbonna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti edo ulfinna lumoka alfitaashshanna rakkotenaa'n anee gatisaa'ana iso'o soodata'ennen!»<verse eid="1SA 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Sa'oolinna Daawwiti'i, «Anke beltoo! Mageni atee eebbisoo! Asitattoxxi duuchchi ati'a qajeeldaan» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:25">Tennexxee Daawwiti me'ammaba'a me'e; Sa'oolina mini ifikiba'a illee iima hige.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s1">Daawwitixxa Filisixeemike Boga'ni Hedha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Yaane kinni Daawwiti godobi giddo, «Mitte barra ani Sa'oolixxe anga'n reya gattabaan. Yooni anee fulchaachchi baqatee Filisixeemike bogibaa me'a callan; ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'ooli Isira'eelike bogi giddo anee hasa waalammaxxee nage'iki hedhannon.» <verse eid="1SA 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Tennexxe Daawwitinna isinni welti hedhemmaki jaani dhibbi manni rake ke'eexxi Gaatike moyanjibaa Ma'oke belto Akishibaa'a me'ine. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Daawwitinna isinni welti hedhemmaki manni ifi ifinge mini hadinni welti Gaatike booncho'n ofolle. Daawwitinna ifixxe lamiinxe arenni, Iyyizira'eelike bogixxe Ahino'aaminninna Qermeeloosike bogike Naabaalii'i reyyemakixxe Abigeelinni welti hedhemman. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Sa'oolinna Daawwiti Gaati'a baaje me'eexxa laqeexxi isika hasito waale.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Daawwitinna moyanjo Akishii'i, «Ani ati edo elle alfonnole shiixoke qachcha'n ofo'lonnaa eetti ani'a uwwi, anke gootta. Konne lumoke qachcha'n ani atinni welti ofo'la ani'a hasissabaani» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Tennexxe Akishi Tsiqilaagika qachcha Daawwiti'a uwwe, tenne daafe'a eettene yannanaa'n ke'isse Tsiqilaagiki qachchi Yihudake moyanjuwwike qadaada kadeeshshanni gate. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Konne qicinni Daawwiti Filisixeemike bogga'n mitte woganna shoole agenjo ofo'le.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Eettene yanna giddo Daawwitinna duuka isixxa me'ammaki manni Geshuureto, Geezaawwitonna Amaaleqitote'n duule; kunni ardinna Suurii'n Gibtseke bogi qico'n olimiinaa'ninni ookko'o boga'ni hedhaamman. <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Daawwitinna labballonna melaalle duuchcha shiya'n, lalo gedhebo, harruwwa, gaaluwwakanna seemmuwwa booji'e adhdhe; ookkoneechchi uduma Daawwiti Akishii'a hige. <verse eid="1SA 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Akishinna, «Techcho hoone gama'n duuldine» hiyye qoraa wodda Daawwitinna, «No'o duulelneebi Yihuda'n bita'i darree'n hedheeke boga'nten; iittanni Yirahime'eelike gosati minike boga'ninna Qenaanito hexxemmake boga'niten» hiyya'ni hiissaamani. <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Daawwiti labbakenna kadi meyyaaxxa Gaati'a iyyedagebaangi duuchchiinga shiyye bire. Tennee assechchi Daawwiti iitta asseene hineexxi haasonaanni hiyye hedemmaxxeeten. Filisixeemike boga'n hedhemmake baro duuchcha'n iitta assa isi'a baratendeexxemman. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Akishi kinni Daawwiti'i godobi mittinni addatammaxxee hiyyaamma qici, «Gosa isixxe Isira'eelike ardi giddo hara gibemeemmaxxee hedhaake baro duuchcha'n ani'a ergatemaan» hiyya'n heda'nemman.<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Eettene yanna'n Filisixeemik ardi Isira'eeli lolo'a loliinka sannachcha bukki assedhe. Akishinna Daawwiti'i, «Atinna atinni welti me'ammaki manni loliinbaa me'inaannexxa ege'ne» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Daawwitinna, «Ani atiki erganji maa assannoxxa atinni uuda dandetatton» hiyye hiisse.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:2">Akishinna, «Eloxxen! Ani atee duuchchi woddike ulfesendeeteke heqqanjo anke assannon!» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sa'ooli Ekedha Haasessaammake Mannika Gorsa Laqedhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />Saamu'eeli reyee wodda Isira'eeliki ardi duuchchi isixxe reyo'a yaade oodheexxi isi hedhammange qachcha'n Raama mongeemman. Edi wodda Sa'ooli ekedha haasesammakaaranna morammaka manna Isira'eelike bogi giddi'n shorre bireemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:27">Lew. 20:27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:10-11">Lew. 18:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 25:1">1 Sam. 25:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Filisixeemik loliink manni bukki hiyye dagee Sunemi qachchi bira bakka abixxe ofo'le, Sa'oolinna Isira'eelika arda duuchcha bukki asseexxi Gilbo'exxe kooba'n bakka abixxe ofo'le. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Sa'oolinna Filisixxeemika sannachcha uudexxe yanna'ni sodaate culphise. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" />Sa'oolinna Duuchchi Woddika Gootta laqedhe, Duuchchi Woddiki Goottinna kinni oojjotinna Uriiminni yookaan qeeseti darree'ni yookaan wabeekoti gamii'n isi'a hiisse haaso'a gibe. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'ooli, «Ekedha haasossitaaxxa mitte meyyaxxa manjichcho ani'a hasse; tennexxe aninna mare hitaachcho laqedhannon» hiyye isi'a ergatemammaka manna ajaje.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:7">Insa'nenna «Kunni ekedha haasositaxxi Mitte manjichcho Ayyindoori hexxeen» hine hiissine.<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Sa'oolinna seemma welenxa odo'we ayyumma egennabaashsha lame manninni welti hashsha manjichchotibaa me'e. Ookko'o geyyeshshanni, «Ekedha haasossite edi'a kaddaaxxa yaane ani'a kuli, ani summa kulannoka manjo ke'issi» isee hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Manjichchotinna, «Moyanji Sa'ooli asseexxa duuchcha egendeeten. Isiqqa morammakanna ekedha haasossammaka manna Isira'eelike bogi giddii'n bire'een. Yoon ati anee abidisse shilchiisotta'a hassaatelchi mayi'ate?» hite.<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'oolinna ise'ni, «Tenne yanna'ni Sa'oolinna atee xixabaaxxa hedhaake Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summinni kakataannen» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />«Ke'isaaneki ayyete?» hite qorte.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:11">Isinna «Saamu'eeli ke'issi» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Isenna Saamu'eeli uudee wodda hafuura gikki assite cancita'n, «Ati Sa'oolinde kaddee mayee anee sobbete?» hite.<verse eid="1SA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Moyanjikinna, «Meeco'o sodaattoxxee! Maachcho uuddete?» hiyye isee qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:13">Isenna, «Magenummatixxa bifa afeechchi moogokena'n fulaa'naa uudannen» hite.<verse eid="1SA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Isinna, «Maachcho laba?» Hiyye isee qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Iseenna «Kaabba odo'weeki mitti geerchi ke'a'nee hedhdheen» hite hiissite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:14">Ookkoneechchi uduma Sa'oolinna iikki Saamu'eelite kadeexxa ege'neexxi buttinake'n waabi hiyye anga iimi'a ke'isse.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Saamu'eelinna Sa'ooli'i, «Ane ke'issite olokkaateki mayye'ate?» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:15">Sa'oolinna «Ani Filisixeemike manninni welti lolema'n yo'oshsha rakkatee wixixxi iyyeennen! Magenikinna anenaa'n bayyete'een. Isinna wabeekoti darree'ninna kadi oojjotinna haaso'a gibeen. Tennexxe maa assa ani hassisaaxxa ani'a kuldottaa atee ye'isennen» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Saamu'eelinna Sa'ooli hiyyee qici, «Duuchchi Woddik Gootti atee gibe ate'n naaphoole anee mayyee ye'isatto? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" />Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ani darree'n ati'a haaso'emmaxxa muuxxate'n hedhdhen. Atixxa moyaanjumma atenaa'n hoyyee olla'a atikee Daawwiti'a uwwe'een. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" />Ati Duuchchi Woddike Gootti'a ajajendeboxxon; Amaaleeqika mannanna insa'nelchcho kadeechcho duuchcha balleessite birteboxxon, isexxee Duuchchi Woddiki Gootti ta'a tenne duuchcha ate'n assa'neechchi tenne daafe'aten.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:3-9">1 Sam. 15:3-9</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />Tennexxe isi atenna Isira'eelika arda Filisixeemike mannixxe anga'n sa'isse uwwaan; soodo atinna oose atixxi ani hedhdheneeke booncho'n dagginaan. Duuchchi Woddik Goottinna Isira'eelika sannachcha Filisixxeemike mannixxe anga'ni sa'isse uwwaani.»<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Sa'oolinna Saamu'eeli hiyyichcho laqeeshshanni alayye shaqqeexxi buttinake'n wabbi hiyye ibe. Isinna eettene hashshanna barra duuchcha mittelcho ita gophemmaxxee shaqqe. <verse eid="1SA 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Manjichchotinna Sa'ooli bira marteexxi roqonsaa'naa uudemmaxxee hitee qici, «Ani atixxi erganjo ati hitettexxa laqeennexxi lubbo anxa jibbee ati hitettexxa muuxxennen. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Atinna kinn ta'a ani atixxi erganjo ati'a hiyyaannexxa laqi; shiixxoxxa ita ittotaa shiqishaannen; itte'e jabaate me'a dandeetattoshsha.»<verse eid="1SA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Sa'oolinna hiyyee qici, «Mittelchonna itabo'non» hiyye gibe. Kaddo malee isiki erganjuwwinna iitti manjichcho jaba qicinni isoo kadhantemmaxxee buttinake'n ibbemmabaa'n ke'eexxi taqete'n ofo'le. <verse eid="1SA 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Manjichchotinna ha'yaka jibichcha affeemman, rakke okkone jibichcha duldeexxi. Isenna shiixxoxxa bulle aaxxe qushshitee gamami tuqebaaxxa kebbo kebbisse. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Itatanna Sa'ooli'anna isike erganjuwwi'a uute'naa indee eettene hashsha ookkoo'n ke'ne me'ine.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Filisixxeemiki Manni Daawwiti Jibbeexxa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Isira'eeliki ardi Iyyizira'eelixxe dhooqa giddo hexxeexxe muumme bira bukki hine he'nee'naa, Filisixeemik sannachchi mitteba bukki hiyye Afeeqi hedhemman. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Ondingi Filisixeemik moyanjuwwi dhibbi dhibbikinna kumi kumiixxe kuta insa'neeke lolinke manninni welti duulle, Daawwitinna isixxa duuka me'ammaki manni Akishi udumii'n me'a'nemman. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Filisixeemike lolinke mannki ajajaluwwi insa'nee uudexxi, «Tinni Ibirito kaba maa assita'ne?» hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 29:3">Akishinna «Kunni Isira'eelike moyanjike erganjo Daawwititeba? Isi anba dageechchinni woggatenaa'n sa'een, Sa'ooli gibe anba dageechchinni anee yaadissaaxxa mitti balleessechchn hedhebaani» hiyye hiisse.<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Yaane kinni Filisixeemike sannachchik akeekisanjuwwi Akishiini'ni muffante hinee qici, «Daawiti no'oke mannika gooba woxe aadhe iyyemaroole malee gootta ifikenni araaremaaki ori hedha gopheemmaxxee hedhaasha uutettake qachchibaa higaashsha assi malee; no'onni welti duuloqqee. <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" />Konneechchi edi gama sirbake'ni meellina'n,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 29:5">« ‹Sa'ooli kuma shiye! Daawwiti tomme kuma shiye!›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 29:5">hina'ni meelina'n faarsinaammaki Daawwiti konnendeba?» hiyye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:3-9">1 Sam. 15:3-9</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Tennexxee Akishi Daawwiti'i ye'eexxi hiyyee qici, «Ati ani'a xuurameesake kaddeettexxa hedhaake Duuchchi Woddike Goottike summinni kakataannen; anini welti duuldettele gammadannan. Aniba daggeteexxe yannanaa'n ke'issite mitte balleessa balleessite'naa uudebo'non, yaane kinni weli galchaluwwinni ati welti duuldota'a eeyyebaan. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Tennexxe udumi'a higgee nage'iki me'i; Filisixeemik galchaluwwi gibaaxxa yaane mittelchonna assitoxxee.»<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Daawwitinna, «Anke gootta maachcho balleessene? Ati'a ergatemennexxe yaanna'n balleessennelchi hedha gophoole anke goottanna anke moyanjo kaddettexxinni atixxa duuka me'e naapha atika mayeeteta dandee lola gophanno» hiyye hiisse.<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Akishinna Daawwiti'i, «Ati ani'a Mageniinke iimike ergajishsha eloke kaddeettexxa ege'neennen; yaanne kinni Filisixeemik galchaluwwi ‹No'onni welti atee duula dande'abaan› hiyyen. <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Tennexxe atinna atinni welti daggeemmaxxi atike goottixxi ergatoole boro dayyaateba edo kexxine hexxinemmake boonchiba'a higge» hiyye hiisse.<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Tennexxe Daawwitinna isixxa duuka me'ammaki manni gorsa bariisa ke'eexxi Filisixeemike bogibaa hige me'o'a ke'e; Filisixeemiki manninna Iyyizira'eeli'a duule.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Amaaleqi'n Ke'eeka Lola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Daawwitinna isixxa duuka me'ammaki manni sakkaxxe barra'n Tsiqilaagi gennee wodda; Amaaleqik manni bita'i darreka boganna Tseqilaagii'n duuleemman; Tsegilaaginna lolle miinee qachchakanna gunbe. <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />Melaalle dargageeyyenna geedhuwwa duuchcha boojine adhdhine me'ine; boojineechcho adhdhine me'ine malee mittikinna shinneeki hedhemmabaan. <verse eid="1SA 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Daawwitinna isinni welti hedhemmaki manni ookko geyee wodda qachcha gunbe birree; aruwwa insa'neexxa, labbaxxanna meyyaxxa oose boojine adhdhine me'ineexxa egenne. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Daawwitinna isixxa duuka me'ammaki manni qonqo insa'neexxi sheeritaa qico'n hafuura gikki assine oo'ne. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" />Laminxi Daawwitixxi are Iyyizira'eeli bogixxi Ahino'aaminna Qermeeloosi bogixxi Naabaali adhdhemaxxa Abigeelinna bojinemman.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:42-43">1 Sam. 25:42-43</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="1SA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Manni duuchchi labbaxxanna meyyaxxa oose insa'neexxa boojinemmaxxe daafe'a yo'oshsha aarremmaxxee isoo kinjik cancanqo'a mari'antemmaxxe Daawwiti lummoxxe rakko giddo hedhemman. Isinna Duuchchi Woddik Gootti ifiki Mageni jabeessaaxxa ege'ne. <verse eid="1SA 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />Daawwitinna Abemelek belto qeesichcho Abiyataarii'i, «Efuude ani'a iyyedagi» hiyye. Abiyatarinna efuude iyyedage.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:20-23">1 Sam. 22:20-23</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />Daawwitinna, «Ookkonne saamemmaka manna shorre abido?» hiyye Duuchchi Woddika Gootta laqedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:8">Magenikinna, «Shorrite dhaqqabe'e booji'ememmaka manna hiissitaton» hiyye isi'a hiisse.<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Tennexxe Daawwitinna jaane dhibba geyaake isixxa duuka me'ammake manninni fullee me'ine; Biisoori hinaake wode'i bira gennee wodda, shiixxoki manni hafuura adhdha'n ture. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Daawwiti kinni shoole dhibbi manninni welti shorricho safe;; weli lami dhibbi isoo hordofammaki kinni wode'e dande'enne foofa gonphemmaxxee udumanni gante. <verse eid="1SA 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />Mitti Gibtseke bogiki dargaggeessi qiilla gammoojjenaa'n daga'naa anfeexxi Daawwitiba iyyemarre; insa'nenna itaachcho uune'na'a ite; wode'ekanna ha'we. <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />Baggeexxa balasetixxa gummanna lame woyinetixxa gummaxxa rodde uune; dargaaggeessi ite ke'echchi uduma jabaate; ookkoneechchi edi gama sase barranna sase hashsha midhatanna wode'e afo'oke'n maqeechchi hedhemmabaan. <verse eid="1SA 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Daawwitinna darrgaggeessa, «Ati ayyike erganjo? Daggetebi haba'nite?» hiyye iso'o qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:13">Dargaaggeessikinna, «Ani Gibtseke bogike manjon; mitte Amaaleqichchi'a ergatemaanneken; ela gophennaxxee sase barra edi gama gootti anki anee hune me'een; <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Kelitotika bita'i darreka boga, Yihudaka boganna Kaalebika bita'a lollee Tsiqilaagika qachcha gunbennen» hiyye hiisse.<verse eid="1SA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Daawwitinna, «Ikki saamemmaki manni hedheeba no'o iyyemara dandeetatto?» hiyye qore.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:15">Dargaaggeessikinna «Anee shiya waalde anke goottixxe anga'n sa'issite uutaboxxoshsha kakatottole leellishannon» hiyye hiisse. <verse eid="1SA 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Daawwiti'i saamemmaki manni hedheeba iyyemare geesisse.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:16">Saamemmaki manninna erqenna kayya xexxeremee ita'ninna ha'wa'ni gammada'n hedhemman; Filisixeemi'ninna Yihudaa'n boojineexxi booji'o yo'oshsha lumoxxemman. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Daawwiti eettene hashshanaa'n gorsi qico'n lolee insa'nee miidhe; gaala guluffe baqatte fuldeexxa shoole dhibba dargaggeeyye malee okkone saamemmake manni giddii'n mittikinna baqate fuleeki hedhebaan. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Daawwitinna Amaaleeqik manna booji'e adhdhe me'emaalcho manjokanna karra duuchcha, iittanni laminxa are isixxanna hiissedhe. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Mittilchinna gatebaangi Daawwiti isixxa duuka me'ammake mannixxa labbaxxanna meyyaxxa oose, iittanni Amaleqiki manni booji'e adhdhe me'emmalcho duucha hiisse. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Ittanni Daawwiti lalo Gedhebokanna re'e booji'e; isixxa duuka me'ammaaki manninna isi edo oofa'n «Kunni duuchchi Daawwiti booji'eechchon!» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Daawwitinna Biisoorke lagi qarqara yo'oshsha gophee hafuura adhdhate'n gatemmake isixxa duuka dande'e me'a gophemmake lame dhibbi manniba'a hige me'e. Insa'nenna Daawwitinna isixxa duuka me'ammaka manna qophe'no'a dange; Daawwitinna insa'neba'a shiqeexxi nage'inginni hexxinee hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Yaane kinni Daawwitinni welti me'emmake manni giddii'n adaba eloka afebaak mitti mitti goofi manni, «Insa'ne no'onni welti lolinba'a me'a gonpheemmaxxee boojinennalcho insa'ne'a qoondabo'non; aruwwanna oose insa'nexxa calla adhdhine me'inowwaal» hiyye.<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Daawwitinna hiyyee qici, «Anke dayyuwwa! Duuchchi Woddik Gootti injifachcho no'o'a uwweemmaxxee iitta assa dandetinabaan! No'o hedhoti he'nannoshsha assee saamemmaka manna injifantannoshsha hunna no'anna uwweeki isoten. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Ha'noo hitina'neexxa yaane ayyinna adhabaan! Uduma gatee miya heqqa'n turemmakinna iittanni loliiba'anna duuleeki duuchchi boojinemmalcho duuchcha qixxe qoodema hasissaan» hiyye. <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Daawwitinna eettene barranaa'n ke'isse telchi qico'n Isira'eelike boga'n kunni seerinna galdumi hedhaashsha asse.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Daawwitinna Tsiqilaagi'a higeexxa yanna ifike jaaluwwi'a Yihudaxxe geedhe'a, «Tinni uwwa Duuchchi Woddike Goottike naaphuwwanaa'n booji'endeexxen» hiyya'ni boojinemalchonaa'n gamisa insa'ne'a erge. <verse eid="1SA 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Ookkone booji'emalchonaa'n Beeti'eel hedheekee, Yihudike bita'i darrexxe Raamaati hedheekeenna, iittanni Yaatirike qachchuwwa'n hedheeke ardi duuchchi'a erge. <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />Iittanni Aro'eerike, Sifimootike, Eshiteemo'ake boga'n hedheekeenna, <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />Raakaali hedheeke Yirahime'eelixxe sanne'anna Qenaanitotee, <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />Horima'ni, Boori'ashaanke, Ataakeenna, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />Kebiroonike qachchuwwa'n he'naake duuchchi'a erge; iittanni Daawwitinna isixxa duuka me'ammaki manni mammaremeemmake boncho duuchcha'n hedhemmake manni'a uwwa erge.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s1">Sa'oolixxanna Isixxe Labbaxxe Oosexxa Reyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 10:1-12">1 Odo. 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />Barratixxa bara Filisixeemik manni Gilbo'ixxe kooba'n Isira'eelinni welti lollemme; heddi Isira'eeliki manni baaje, heddi manninna reye. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Filisixeemik manni kinni shorre dhaqqabeexxi sasiinxa Sa'oolixxa oose Yoonataanii'i, Abinadaabinna Malkishu'a shorre dhaqqabe. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Bagedi Sa'ooli hedhemma darre'n jabaata'ni me'eemmaxxee naaphakenaa'ni darbendammaxxi gabuwwa Sa'ooli fuggo ottee madeessite. <verse eid="1SA 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Sa'oolinna isika lolinka miyya ba'edhaammaka dargageessa hiyyee qici, «Kunni Mageno ege'nebaaki anee otee salphiseexxi manni'n, ati wolaantichchi atikenni anee shiyyi» hiyye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 31:4">Yaane kinni lolinka miya ba'edhammaki dargageessi kinni sodaatexxi shiyebaan; tennexxee Sa'ooli ifinga wolaantichcha adhdheexxi hana ibe dirrimmeme. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Lolinka miya ba'edhdhammaki dargageessinna Sa'ooli reyeexxa udeexxi isinna ifinge wolaantichchike qara'n hana dirme Sa'oolinni welti reye. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Yooni Sa'oolinna sasinxi isixxi labbaxxi oose lolinka miya ba'edhdhammaaki dargageessinna Sa'oolixxa duuka me'ammaki manni eettene barra'ni mittenba renne. <verse eid="1SA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Yordaanoosike galaanibaa'n boroti daree'ninna Iyizira'eelixxe dhooqa wido hedhemmaaki Isira'eeliki manni Isra'eeliki sannaachchi baqateexxa, Sa'oolinna oose isixxa shinneexxa lanqeexxi qachcha waaliee baqante; Filisixeemik manninna dageexxi qachcha abixxe.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Lolikinna langa baro gorsa, Filisixeemik manni reyyeemake mannanaa'n loliinka miya adhdhino'a marreexxa yanna, insa'nenna Sa'oolika renshanna sasiinxe isixxe ooseki renshi Gilbo'ixxe kooba'n ibe'naa anfe. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Sa'oolika gooba wonxeexxi isixxa loliinxa seemmanna fulchine adhdhine magenuwa insa'nekike galmi'anna arda insa'neeke duuchchi'a gammashshotixxa odo lassaaka manna Filisixeemike boga duuchcha'n ergine. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Ookkoneechchi uduma Filisixxeemiki manni Sa'oolika loliinka miya asitaarooti hiyyemaake melaalletike mageno insa'neke galmi giddo ugine. Sa'oolika rensha Beetishani hinaake qachchiinke dalla'a'ni misimaareti ganne fanninse.<verse eid="1SA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Iyyabiisi Gele'adik manni Gele'adike qachchik Filisixeemik manni Sa'ooli'ni asseexxa yaane laqeexxi, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />insa'neki loliinki jannuwwi ke'e dageexxi hashsha duuchcha Beetishanemi'a marre. Insa'nenna Sa'oolikanna isixxe ooseka rensha qachchiinke dalla'anaa'n dirrinse Iyyabiisi'a iyyedage gunbe. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Ookkoneechchi uduma miqe insa'nixxa aa'neexxi Iyyabiisi giddo hedheeke Tamaaresiki hiyyemaake haqichchi hunda moogeexxi torribaane barra indeechi hedhebaanig agabo goddo honse.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>